<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MAT" style="id" />
  <para style="h">MATAYO</para>
  <para style="toc1">Kwena Maber ma MATAYO Ocoyo</para>
  <para style="toc2">Matayo</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mat</para>
  <para style="mt2">Kwena Maber ma</para>
  <para style="mt1">MATAYO</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ocoyo</para>
  <para style="imt">Lanyut wilok madito ma i buk man</para>
  <para style="ip">Kwena Maber ma Matayo ocoyo nyutu kamaleng ni Yecu en aye Lalar mayam kiciko pire. I en Lubanga ocobo cikene bot jone kit ma kicoyo kwede i buk me Cik Macon. Kwena man maber ni pe pi Lujudaya keken onyo kama Yecu kinywalo iye dok bene odongo ki iye ni, ento pi wilobo ni kulu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Buk pa Matayo kicano maber kore ki kore kun cake ki tekwaro pa Lujudaya, nywalo Yecu, batijane, atematema ma Yecu owok ki iye, tito loke, pwonye ki cango two mapatpat ma en otimo i Galilaya. Ki inge man Matayo otito pi wot pa Yecu nia ki i Galilaya cito Jerucalem kama kineko en iye ka lacen en ocer ki ilyel.</para>
  <para style="ip">Kwena man Maber ni nyutu Yecu macalo lapwony madit ma oa ki bot Lubanga matye ki ngec dok ki twero me gonyo tecik pa Lubanga maber. Buk man bene onyutu Yecu macalo lapwony ma pwonyo pwony ma atir ikom lok ma mako ker pa Lubanga.</para>
  <para style="ip">Matayo oketo pwony pa Yecu i dul abic: (i) Pwony pa Yecu iwi got. Dit me pwony man ocung ilok magi: Bedo ki kit ma atir, tic maber, twero ma jo ma ye Lubanga tye kwede ki agiki ma megi i Polo ma i nongo icura abic nio kwede wa icura abiro; (ii) Miyo tic bot lukwenane apar wiye aryo matye i cura apar; (iii) Pwony pa Yecu mapatpat icaro lok ma mako ker me polo nonge icura apar wiye adek; (iv) Pwonye ma mako bedo dano ma kite atir dok muteggi i niye ma inongo icura apar wiye aboro; (v) Pwonye pi kare me agiki me kwo man ki bino me ker pa Lubanga, ma nonge icura pyere aryo wiye angwen ki pyere aryo wiye abic.</para>
  <para style="ip">Dong wilok madito ma i buk man en aye; timo tic maber ki bedo dano ma lagen.</para>
  <para style="ip">I buk man bene en aye kama Yecu oloko madwong lok ma mako Cik pa Moses ki tekwaro pa jo Lujudaya.</para>
  <para style="ip">Agiki me buk man tito pi to pa Yecu, cere ki ilyel, ciko ki oro lupwonyene.</para>
  <para style="iot">Lacim wilok madito ma i buk man</para>
  <para style="io1">Tekwaro ki nywale pa Yecu Kricito <char style="ior"><ref loc="MAT 1:1-2:23">1:1—2:23</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Tic pa Jon Labatica <char style="ior"><ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">3:1-12</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Batija ki atematema pa Yecu <char style="ior"><ref loc="MAT 3:13-4:11">3:13—4:11</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Tic pa Yecu i Galilaya <char style="ior"><ref loc="MAT 4:12-18:35">4:12—18:35</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Wot pa Yecu nia ki Galilaya me cito i Jerucalem <char style="ior"><ref loc="MAT 19:1-20:34">19:1—20:34</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Cabit me agiki i Jerucalem ki kabedo ma orumu Jerucalem <char style="ior"><ref loc="MAT 21:1-27:66">21:1—27:66</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Cer ki nyute pa Rwotwa Yecu <char style="ior"><ref loc="MAT 28:1-20">28:1-20</ref></char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MAT 1" />
  <para style="s1">Kwari pa Yecu Kricito</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 3:23-38">Luk 3:23-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 1:1" />Jo magi aye gubedo kwari pa Yecu Kricito, ma lakwar Daudi, lakwar Abraim.<verse eid="MAT 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 1:2" />Abraim onywalo Icaka, Icaka onywalo Yakobo, Yakobo onywalo Juda ki omegine; <verse eid="MAT 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 1:3" />ka dong Juda ki Tamar gunywalo Perej ki Jera, ci Perej onywalo Kejeron, Kejeron onywalo Aram; <verse eid="MAT 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 1:4" />ci Aram onywalo Aminadab, Aminadab onywalo Nakucon, ka Nakucon onywalo Calmon; <verse eid="MAT 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 1:5" />Calmon ki Rakab gunywalo Boaj, ci Boaj ki Ruth gunywalo Obed, ki Obed onywalo Yece; <verse eid="MAT 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 1:6" />ka Yece onywalo rwot Daudi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 1:6">Daudi ki dako pa Uria gunywalo Solomon; <verse eid="MAT 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 1:7" />ci Solomon onywalo Rekoboam, Rekoboam onywalo Abija, Abija onywalo Aca; <verse eid="MAT 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 1:8" />Aca onywalo Yekocapat, Yekocapat onywalo Joram, Joram onywalo Ujia; <verse eid="MAT 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 1:9" />Ujia onywalo Jotam, Jotam onywalo Akaj, Akaj onywalo Kejekia; <verse eid="MAT 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 1:10" />Kejekia onywalo Manace, Manace onywalo Amoc, Amoc onywalo Jocia; <verse eid="MAT 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 1:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 24:14">Luk 24:14</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 24:15">15</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 36:10">2 Tek 36:10</ref>; <ref loc="JER 27:20">Jer 27:20</ref> </char></note>Jocia onywalo Jekonia ki omegine, ikare ma kiterogi woko kwede i Babilon.<verse eid="MAT 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 1:12" />Lacen ma onongo dong kiterogi woko i Babilon, Jekonia onywalo Cealtiel, ci Cealtiel onywalo Jerubabel; <verse eid="MAT 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 1:13" />Jerubabel onywalo Abiud, ka Abiud onywalo Eliakim, Eliakim onywalo Ajor; <verse eid="MAT 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 1:14" />Ajor onywalo Jadok, Jadok onywalo Akim, Akim onywalo Eliud; <verse eid="MAT 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 1:15" />Eluid onywalo Eleajar, Eleajar onywalo Matan, Matan onywalo Yakobo; <verse eid="MAT 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 1:16" />Yakobo onywalo Yucepu cwar Maliam ma obedo min Yecu ma kilwongo ni Kricito.<verse eid="MAT 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 1:17" />Kitmeno kwari ducu mayam kinywalogi cake ki ikom Abraim nio kwede ikom Daudi, ducu onongo welgi romo apar wiye angwen, dok cake ki ikom Daudi nio wa ikare mayam kiterogi kwede i Babilon, onongo romo kwari apar wiye angwen, dok cake ikare ma kiterogi kwede i Babilon nio kwede wa ikom Kricito romo kwari apar wiye angwen.<verse eid="MAT 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kit ma kinywalo kwede Yecu Kricito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 1:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 1:27">Luk 1:27</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Man aye obedo kit mayam kinywalo kwede Yecu Kricito. Ikare ma mine Maliam dong Yucepu ocunu oye, ma peya kin gi orwate, kinongo ni Maliam tye ki ic pa Cwiny Maleng. <verse eid="MAT 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 1:19" />Cware Yucepu yam onongo obedo dano ma kite atir, ci pe obedo ki cwiny me keto lewic iwi Maliam; ento onongo mito ni eryem woko lalingling i mung. <verse eid="MAT 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 1:20" />Ento ikare ma onongo Yucepu pud tye kalwodo lok meno ki i cwinye, ci cutcut lamalaika pa Rwot onen bote iwang lek, kun wace ni, “Yucepu, lakwar Daudi, pe ilwor kwanyo Maliam me bedo dakoni, pien ic ma en tye kwedeni obedo ic pa Cwiny Maleng. <verse eid="MAT 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 1:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 1:31">Luk 1:31</ref></char></note> En binywalo latin awobi, ibicako nyinge Yecu, pien bilaro dano ki ibalgi.” <verse eid="MAT 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 1:22" />Lok man ducu otime wek lok pa Rwot ocobe kakare kit macalo yam oloko i dog lanebi kit man;<verse eid="MAT 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 1:23" />“Nen, nyako mo ma peya ongeyo laco biyac,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:23">binywalo latin ma laco,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:23">kibicako nyinge Emmanuel. Ma teloke ni, Lubanga tye kwedwa.”<verse eid="MAT 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 1:24" />Ikare ma Yucepu oco ki iwang nino, otimo kit macalo lamalaika pa Rwot ocike kwede; okwanyo dakone otero bote, <verse eid="MAT 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 1:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 2:21">Luk 2:21</ref></char></note> ento pe obedo kwede, nio wa ikare madong kinywalo latin. Yucepu ocako nyinge Yecu.<verse eid="MAT 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MAT 2" />
  <para style="s1">Luryeko gucito kalimo latin Yecu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 2:1" />Ma dong kinywalo Yecu i Beterekem ma i Judaya ikare me loc pa rwot Kerode, luryeko mogo ma co gua tung kunyango gubino i Jerucalem, kun gin penyo ni, <verse eid="MAT 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 2:2" />“En latin ma kinywalo me bedo Rwot pa Lujudaya ni tye kwene? Pien onongo waneno lakalatwe manyutu nywale tung kunyango, ci wan wabino ka wore.”<verse eid="MAT 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 2:3" />Ikare ma rwot Kerode owinyo lok man, cwinye opoto matek, kadi wa jo Jerucalem bene ducu cwinygi opoto matek. <verse eid="MAT 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 2:4" />Man omiyo rwot Kerode ocoko ajwaki madito ki Lupwonycik me rokgi ducu, ci openyogi ni, “Kricito mono kibinywalo kwene?” <verse eid="MAT 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 2:5" />Gin gudoke iye ni, “I Beterekem ma i Judaya, pien lanebi yam ocoyo ni,<verse eid="MAT 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 2:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MIC 5:2">Mik 5:2</ref>
      </char>
    </note> ‘In Beterekem ma i lobo me Judaya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:6">in pe itidi tutwal ki ikin luloc me Judaya;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:6">pien laloc bia ki i in,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:6">en aye ma biloyo jona jo Icrael.’”<verse eid="MAT 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 2:7" />Ci Kerode olwongo luryeko i mung, guniange kun gitite kare ma lakalatwe onen iye. <verse eid="MAT 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 2:8" />Ka dong ocwalogi me cito i Jerucalem kun waco botgi ni, “Wucit wupeny lok kom latin man maber kore kikore, ce ka wunonge ci wudwoka loke, wek an bene acit awore.” <verse eid="MAT 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 2:9" />Ikare madong guwinyo lok pa rwot Kerode, gucito ki yoogi ci guneno lakalatwe mayam kong guneno tung kunyango ca otelo nyimgi, obino ocung ki malo wa i kabedo kama onongo latin man tye iye. <figure style="fig" alt="Wise men on camels following the star" file="CN01628b.tif" size="col" loc="Mathew 2:9" copy="David Cook" ref="2:9">Lakalatwe otelo nyim luryeko</figure> <verse eid="MAT 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 2:10" />Ma guneno lakalatwe meno, cwinygi obedo yom adada. <verse eid="MAT 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 2:11" />Madong gudonyo i ot, guneno latin kacel ki mine Maliam, cutcut guryebe piny guwore. Gugonyo yecgi ma onongo tye iye lonyo madwong, ci gumiye mot, jabu ki odok luban ki murra. <verse eid="MAT 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 2:12" />Lacen, Lubanga ocikogi ni pe gudok cen ki korgi bot Kerode, ci gudok tugi ma kun gilubu yoo mukene.<verse eid="MAT 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lunyodo pa Yecu guringo gularo Ejipt</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 2:13" />Ikare ma luryeko gucito woko, ci lamalaika pa Rwot onen bot Yucepu iwang lek kun waci, “Aa malo, i kwany latin ki mine, iring ilar kwedgi Ejipt, ci wubed kunu nio wang ma awaco lok botwu, pien Kerode dong cok yenyo latin man wek enek woko.” <verse eid="MAT 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 2:14" />Ci Yucepu oa malo okwanyo latin ki mine ki dyewor, ocito kwedgi i Ejipt; <verse eid="MAT 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 2:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 11:1">Koc 11:1</ref></char></note> gubedo kunu nio ka Kerode oto. Man otime wek lok mayam Rwot oloko ki i dog lanebi ni ocobe kakare ni; “Yam alwongo Woda nia ki i Ejipt.”<verse eid="MAT 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Neko lutino matino</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 2:16" />Ikare ma Kerode dong oniang ni luryeko gutimo ryeko ikome, akemo omake matek tutwal, ci ocwalo dano guneko lutino co woko ducu ki i Beterekem kacel ki i kabedo ducu ma orumu kenyo, cake ki ikom lutino me mwaka aryo dok kwede piny, kun poro ki kit kare mayam luryeko guniange pire ca. <verse eid="MAT 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 2:17" />Man omiyo lok mayam lanebi Jeremia oloko ocobe kakare ni,<verse eid="MAT 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 2:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 31:15">Jer 31:15</ref>
      </char>
    </note> “Koko owinye ki i Rama,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:18">kumu ki koko lyel;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:18">Lakeri onongo kok pi lutinone.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:18">Okwero woko ni pe myero</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:18">gikwe cwinye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:18">pien lutinone dong gipeke.”<verse eid="MAT 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yucepugi gudwogo cen ki i Ejipt</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 2:19" />Ikare madong Kerode oto woko, lamalaika pa Rwot onen bot Yucepu iwang lek ki i Ejipt, kun wace ni; <verse eid="MAT 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 2:20" />“Aa malo, kwany latin ki mine, ci idok kwedgi cen i lobo Icrael, pien jo ma onongo nene gimito neko latin ni dong guto woko.” <verse eid="MAT 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 2:21" />Ci Yucepu oa okwanyo latin ki mine odok kwedgi cen i lobo Icrael. <verse eid="MAT 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 2:22" />Ento ka Yucepu owinyo ni Arkelao aye dong tye kaloc i Judaya ma ka wone Kerode, lworo omake me dok kunu; ento kit ma Lubanga ocike iwang lek omiyo owoto ocito i Galilaya. <verse eid="MAT 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 2:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 1:24">Mar 1:24</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 2:39">Luk 2:39</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:45">Jon 1:45</ref></char></note> En ocito obedo i taun ma nyinge Najaret, wek gin mayam lunebi guloko ocobe kakare ni, “Kibilwonge ni Lanajaret.”<verse eid="MAT 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MAT 3" />
  <para style="s1">Lok ma Jon Labatija otito</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Mar 1:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-9">Luk 3:1-9</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 3:15-17">15-17</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Jon 1:19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 3:1" />Ikare meno Jon Labatija obino kun tito lok i tim me Judaya. <verse eid="MAT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 3:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 4:17">Mat 4:17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:15">Mar 1:15</ref></char></note> En owaci, “Wunguti, pien ker me polo dong onyiko cok.” <verse eid="MAT 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 3:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 40:3">Ica 40:3</ref></char></note> Jon en aye dano mayam lanebi Icaya otito pire ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 3:3">“Dwon dano mo ma dange i tim ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 3:3">‘Wuger yo pa Rwot,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 3:3">wutir yone ocung ma atir.’”<verse eid="MAT 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 3:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 1:8">2 Luk 1:8</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Jon yam onongo ruku bongo yer kinaga, kun tweyo pyere ki del, dok camo bonyo ki moo kic ma i tim. <verse eid="MAT 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 3:5" />Jo mapol gua ki i Jerucalem, ki lobo Judaya ducu, ki lobo ducu matye cok ki Jordan, gumol gubino bote. <verse eid="MAT 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 3:6" />Gutucu balgi, ci en obatijagi i kulu Jordan.<verse eid="MAT 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 3:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 12:34">Mat 12:34</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 23:33">23:33</ref></char>
    </note> Ento ikare ma en oneno Luparicayo ki Lucadukayo gibino kun gimito ni en e batijagi, ci en owaco ni, “Wun lutino twol ororo, anga ma owaco botwu ni myero wuring woko ki i akemo pa Lubanga matye ka binoni? <verse eid="MAT 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 3:8" />Dong wutii gin ma nyutu ni wungut ikom balwu, <verse eid="MAT 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 3:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 8:33">Jon 8:33</ref></char></note> pe dok wucak tamo ni, ‘Watye ki kwarowa Abraim.’ Kong wunen awaco botwu ni, Lubanga tye ki twero me miyo gweng magi loke doko likwayo Abraim. <verse eid="MAT 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 3:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 7:19">Mat 7:19</ref></char></note> Kombedi dong kiketo latong woko ilwit yadi, yat acel acel ma pe nyako nyige mabeco, kitongo kireto woko piny, ci kibolo woko i mac.<verse eid="MAT 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 3:11" />An abatijawu ki pii pi nyutu ni dong wungut woko ikom balwu, ento ngat ma bino luba ni tek kata woko; pe amyero me mako war tyene. En bibatijawu ki Cwiny Maleng, dok ki mac bene. <verse eid="MAT 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 3:12" />Oderone tye i cinge me pyeto ngano, en biyubu larone woko maber, ci bicoko nganone bidilo i dero, ento cunge en biwango woko ki mac ma pe to.” <figure style="fig" alt="A winnowing fork" file="CN01655b.TIF" size="col" loc="Mathew 3:12" copy="David C. Cook" ref="3:12">Odero me pyeto</figure><verse eid="MAT 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jon obatija Yecu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:9-11">Mar 1:9-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:21-22">Luk 3:21-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 3:13" />Yecu oa ki i Galilaya obino bot Jon i dog kulu Jordan, wek Jon obatija en. <verse eid="MAT 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 3:14" />Jon onongo mito kwero woko, owaco bot Yecu ni, “Amito ni, in aye ibatija an, ento in dok ibino bota ni an aye abatija in?” <verse eid="MAT 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 3:15" />Ento Yecu odoke iye ni, <char style="wj">“Wek kong dong obed kitmeno kombedi, pien pore botwa me cobo gin ducu matye atir.”</char> Jon ocako ye loke. <verse eid="MAT 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 3:16" />Ikare madong kityeko batija Yecu, ci en okati woko ki ipii. Cutcut polo oyabe, ci oneno Cwiny Maleng pa Lubanga ma bino kun lyane piny macalo akuri, ci opye ikome. <verse eid="MAT 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 3:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 42:1">Ica 42:1</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:18">Mat 12:18</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 17:5">17:5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:11">Mar 1:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:35">Luk 9:35</ref></char></note> Ci dwon ocako winye ma a ki i polo ma waco ni, “Man aye Woda ma amaro, ma cwinya yom ikome mada.”<verse eid="MAT 3:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MAT 4" />
  <para style="s1">Catan obito Yecu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:12-13">Mar 1:12-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:1-13">Luk 4:1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 4:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HEB 2:18">Ibru 2:18</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Cutcut Cwiny Maleng otero Yecu wa i tim wek Catan obite. <figure style="fig" alt="Jesus in the wilderness" file="CN01658B.TIF" size="col" loc="Mathew 4:1" copy="David C. Cook" ref="4:1">Yecu i dye tim</figure> <verse eid="MAT 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 4:2" />Ka Yecu obedo i nirii kec nino pyere angwen dyeceng ki dyewor, ci lacen kec ocako neke. <verse eid="MAT 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 4:3" />Labit dano obino ci owace ni, “Ka in i Wod pa Lubanga, wac ki gweng man oloke odok kwon.” <verse eid="MAT 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 4:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 8:3">Nwo 8:3</ref></char></note> Ento Yecu odok iye ni, <char style="wj">“Yam kicoyo ni,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:4">
    <char style="wj">‘Dano pe bibedo kwo ki kwon keken,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:4">
    <char style="wj">ento bedo kwo ki lok ducu ma a ki i dog Lubanga.’”</char><verse eid="MAT 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 4:5" />Catan dok otere i taun madit maleng, ci ocibe ocung iwi labila Ot pa Lubanga, <verse eid="MAT 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 4:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 91:11">Jab 91:11</ref>,<ref loc="PSA 91:12">12</ref></char></note> ci owace ni, “Ka in i Wod pa Lubanga, kong i a ki malo kany ipot piny pien yam bene kicoyo ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:6">‘En biciko lumalaikane piri,’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:6">dok bene ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:6">‘Gin bijoli ki cinggi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:6">wek pe iyok tyeni ikom got.’”<verse eid="MAT 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 4:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 6:16">Nwo 6:16</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Yecu dok ogamo doge owaci, <char style="wj">“Yam bene kicoyo ni, ‘Pe item i Rwot Lubangani.’”</char> <verse eid="MAT 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 4:8" />Catan dok otere malo iwi got mabor adada, ci onyute ker ducu ma iwi lobo ki deyogi ducu. <verse eid="MAT 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 4:9" />Ci owace ni, “Magi ducu abimiyo boti, ka igungu piny iwora.” <verse eid="MAT 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 4:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 6:13">Nwo 6:13</ref></char></note> Ci Yecu owace ni, <char style="wj">“Nyik icit cen, Catan, pien yam kicoyo ni,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:10">
    <char style="wj">‘Wor Rwot Lubangani,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:10">
    <char style="wj">dok bene iti pire keken.’”</char><verse eid="MAT 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 4:11" />Cutcut Catan oweke, ci lumalaika gubino gukonye.<verse eid="MAT 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yecu ocako tice i Galilaya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:14-15">Mar 1:14-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:14-15">Luk 4:14-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 4:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 14:3">Mat 14:3</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:17">Mar 6:17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:19">Luk 3:19</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 3:20">20</ref></char>
    </note> Cutcut ka Yecu owinyo ni kimako Jon kitweyo woko i buc, oa obino i Galilaya. <verse eid="MAT 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 4:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 2:12">Jon 2:12</ref></char></note> En pe dong obedo i Najaret, ento ocito obedo i Kapernaum matye i dog nam, i lobo Jabulon ki Naputali, <verse eid="MAT 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 4:14" />wek lok mayam lanebi Icaya oloko ocobe kakare ni:<verse eid="MAT 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 4:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 9:1">Ica 9:1</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 9:2">2</ref></char>
    </note> “Lobo Jabulon ki lobo Naputali,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:15">tung nam, loka Jordan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:15">Galilaya pa Lurok.<verse eid="MAT 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 4:16" />Jo mayam gibedo i piny macol dong guneno dero ceng madit,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:16">jo mayam gibedo i lobo ki i tipu me to,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:16">ceng dong otuc woko omenyogi.”<verse eid="MAT 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 4:17" />Cake ikare meno Yecu ocako tito lok kun waco ni, <char style="wj">“Wunguti, pien ker me polo dong onyiko cok.”</char><verse eid="MAT 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yecu olwongo lucik rec angwen</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:16-20">Mar 1:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:1-11">Luk 5:1-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 4:18" />Ikare ma Yecu obedo kawot kun rabo dog nam Galilaya, ci oneno omego aryo, Cimon ma kilwongo Petero ki omine Anderiya, ka gitye kabolo obwo recgi i nam; pien onongo gin lumak rec. <verse eid="MAT 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 4:19" />Ci olwongogi ni, <char style="wj">“Wubin wulub kora, ci an abimiyo wudoko lumak dano.”</char> <verse eid="MAT 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 4:20" />Ci cutcut gutugi weko obwogi, gulubu kore. <verse eid="MAT 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 4:21" />Ka dok owoto anyim manok, ci oneno omego mukene aryo, Yakobo ki omine Jon, gin awobe pa Jebedayo, ma onongo gitye i yeya kacel ki won gi Jebedayo ka tudu wang obwo recgi ma oyec, ci olwongogi. <verse eid="MAT 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 4:22" />Cutcut gutugi weko yeya ki won gi Jebedayo, ci gulubu kore.<verse eid="MAT 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yecu opwonyo dok ocango dano</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:17-19">Luk 6:17-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 4:23" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:23: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 9:35">Mat 9:35</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Yecu owoto orumu lobo Galilaya ducu, kun pwonyo i kacokegi, dok bene onongo tito lok me Kwena Maber me ker pa Lubanga. Ocango bene kit two ducu ki kit goro ducu ki ikin dano. <verse eid="MAT 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 4:24" />Ma omiyo nyinge oywek i lobo Ciria ducu. Dano gukelo jo ducu ma komgi lit bote, jo ma gitwo kit two mapatpat ki jo ma arem obwoyogi, jo matye ki cen, jo ma twoyo two alili ki jo ma twoyo two akweya, ci en ocangogi. <verse eid="MAT 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 4:25" />Lwak dano mapol ata ma gua ki i Galilaya, Dekapoli, Jerucalem, Judaya ki loka Jordan ducu gulube.<verse eid="MAT 4:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MAT 5" />
  <para style="s1">Lok ma Yecu otito iwi got</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 5:1" />Yecu ka oneno lwak, ci oito malo iwi got, ka dong obedo piny, ci lupwonyene gucito bote. <verse eid="MAT 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 5:2" />Ocako pwonyogi kun waco botgi kit man ni:<verse eid="MAT 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Gum me ada</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:20-23">Luk 6:20-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 5:3" />
    <char style="wj">“Gitye ki gum jo ma gingeyo ni gin lucan ilok me cwiny, pien ker me polo meggi.”</char><verse eid="MAT 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 5:4" />
    <char style="wj">“Gitye ki gum jo ma cwinygi cwer, pien kibikweyo cwinygi.</char><verse eid="MAT 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 5:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 37:11">Jab 37:11</ref>
      </char>
    </note> <char style="wj">Gitye ki gum jo ma mwol, pien gibileyo lobo doko meggi.</char><verse eid="MAT 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 5:6" />
    <char style="wj">Gitye ki gum jo ma kec ki orwo pii nekogi pi bedo jo ma kitgi atir, pien kibimiyo giyeng.</char><verse eid="MAT 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 5:7" />
    <char style="wj">Gitye ki gum jo ma lukica, pien gin bene kibitimo kica botgi.</char><verse eid="MAT 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 5:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 24:3">Jab 24:3</ref>,<ref loc="PSA 24:4">4</ref></char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">Gitye ki gum jo ma cwinygi leng, pien gin aye gibineno Lubanga.</char><verse eid="MAT 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 5:9" />
    <char style="wj">Gitye ki gum jo makelo kuc, pien gin aye kibilwongogi ni lutino pa Lubanga.</char><verse eid="MAT 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 5:10" />
    <char style="wj">Gitye ki gum jo ma kiketo ayelayela ikomgi pi bedo jo ma kitgi atir, pien ker me polo meggi.</char><verse eid="MAT 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 5:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1PE 4:14">1 Pet 4:14</ref>
      </char>
    </note> <char style="wj">Wutye ki gum ka dano ngalowu, kun giyelowu ma giwaco kit lok ducu maracu gobagoba ikomwu pira.</char> <verse eid="MAT 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 5:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 36:16">2 Tek 36:16</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 7:52">Tic 7:52</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Wupwo, cwinywu obed yom atika, pien mot ma kibimiyowu me pwoc dit, tye i polo, pien lunebi mayam gukwongo nyimwu dano guketo ayelayela ikomgi kitmeno.</char><verse eid="MAT 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lok ikom kado ki dero</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:50">Mar 9:50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:34-35">Luk 14:34-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 5:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MRK 9:50">Mar 9:50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:34">Luk 14:34</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 14:35">35</ref></char>
    </note> <char style="wj">Wun wukado me lobo; ento kado atwona</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yecu oporo dano ki kado atwona ma ka odoko bot ci ki onyo woko iwi piti onyo iwi odur ci dano nyono ata.</char></note> <char style="wj">ka dong odoko bot, ci kibitimo ningning wek dok odok mit? Konye dong nongo peke, myero kiony woko dano onyon.</char><verse eid="MAT 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 5:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 8:12">Jon 8:12</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 9:5">9:5</ref></char>
    </note> <char style="wj">Wun dero me lobo. Taun madit ma kigero iwi got pe twero kane.</char> <verse eid="MAT 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 5:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 4:21">Mar 4:21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:16">Luk 8:16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:33">11:33</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Dok pe kicwinyo tara me auma ki aduku, ento kicibo iwi lacib tara, ci lyel caro piny bot jo ducu matye i ot.</char> <verse eid="MAT 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 5:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 2:12">1 Pet 2:12</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Wun bene wubed jo ma menyo piny calo tara bot dano, wek gunen tic mabeco ma wutiyo ci gumi deyo bot Wonwu matye i polo.”</char><verse eid="MAT 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lok ma Yecu opwonyo ikom Cik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 5:17" />
    <char style="wj">“Pe wutam ni an abino kajwayo Cik pa Moses ki lok pa lunebi woko; pe abino ka gengo dano lubugi, ento me cobogi acoba.</char> <verse eid="MAT 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 5:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 16:17">Luk 16:17</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Adada awaco botwu ni, nio wang ma polo ki lobo bitum woko, latin ton mo acel, kadi ki nukuta mo acel me Cik pe birwenyo, nio kalok ducu ocobe kakare.</char> <verse eid="MAT 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 5:19" /><char style="wj">Pimeno, dano mo ma bimiyo Cik mo acel ki ikom Cik magi doko yogoyogo, kun pwonyo ki dano kitmeno, kibilwongo ni en dano matidi i ker me polo; ento ngat ma gwoko Cik magi, kun pwonyo ki dano, kibilwonge ni en dano madit i ker me polo.</char> <verse eid="MAT 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 5:20" /><char style="wj">Pien awaciwu ni, ka pe kitwu obedo atir makato kit pa Lupwonycik ki pa Luparicayo, ci pe wubidonyo i ker me polo.”</char><verse eid="MAT 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lok ma Yecu opwonyo ikom kiniga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:57-59">Luk 12:57-59</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 5:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:21: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 20:13">Nia 20:13</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:17">Nwo 5:17</ref></char>
    </note> <char style="wj">“Dong wuwinyo lok mayam kiwaco bot jo macon ni, ‘Pe ineki; ngat ma oneko dano kibingolo kop ikome.’</char> <verse eid="MAT 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 5:22" /><char style="wj">Ento an awaco botwu ni ngat mo ka kiniga omako ikom omine kibingolo kop ikome; dano ma yeto omine kibitero i kot, ki ngat ma biwaco ni, ‘In laming’ kibibolo woko i mac me Geena.</char> <verse eid="MAT 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 5:23" /><char style="wj">Pimeno, ka ikelo moti bot Lubanga, ma itye ka tyerone inyim keno tyer, kace ipo ni omeru onongo tye ki lok mo ikomi,</char> <verse eid="MAT 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 5:24" /><char style="wj">ci myero iwek moti kunu inyim keno tyer, ci idok cen; mukwongo kong wumer wuribe ki omeru, ka lacen dong idwogi ityer moti.</char> <verse eid="MAT 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 5:25" /><char style="wj">Mak larem woko oyotoyot ki ngat mudoti, ikare ma pud wutye kawot kwede i yoo me cito i kot, wek dano mudoti ni pe oteri inyim langolkop, ci langolkop bimiyi bot lakurpiny, ci teri tweyi woko i buc.</char> <verse eid="MAT 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 5:26" /><char style="wj">Adada awaci ni, pe ibikati woko ki kunu, nio ka iculu cul ducu, ma wi cente mo pe orem.</char><verse eid="MAT 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lok ma Yecu opwonyo ikom timo abor</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 5:27" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:27: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 20:14">Nia 20:14</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:18">Nwo 5:18</ref></char>
    </note> <char style="wj">Dong wuwinyo ka yam kiwaco ni, ‘Pe i tim abor.’</char> <verse eid="MAT 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 5:28" /><char style="wj">Ento an awaco botwu ni, dano mo ma oneno dako mo ce oparo ni ebed kwede, meno nongo dong otimo abor woko kwede ki i cwinye.</char> <verse eid="MAT 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 5:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 18:9">Mat 18:9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:47">Mar 9:47</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Kace wangi tung lacuc aye mamiyo i poto ibal, kole ci ibol woko kamabor; pien bedo ber ka dul komi mo acel orwenyo, kato ma kono kibolo komi kulu woko i Geena.</char> <verse eid="MAT 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 5:30" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 18:8">Mat 18:8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:43">Mar 9:43</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Kace cingi ma lacuc aye mamiyo i poto ibal, tonge ingune ibol woko; pien bedo ber ka dul komi mo acel orwenyo, kato ma kono gibolo komi woko kulu i Geena.</char><verse eid="MAT 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lok ma Yecu opwonyo ikom keto nyom</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:9">Mat 19:9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:11-12">Mar 10:11-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 16:18">Luk 16:18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 5:31" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:31: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 24:1-4">Nwo 24:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 19:7">Mat 19:7</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:4">Mar 10:4</ref></char>
    </note> <char style="wj">Yam kiwaco ni, ‘Dano mo ma ryemo dakone, myero omiye waraga me keto nyom.’</char> <verse eid="MAT 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 5:32" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:32: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 19:9">Mat 19:9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:11">Mar 10:11</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 10:12">12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 16:18">Luk 16:18</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 7:10">1 Kor 7:10</ref>,<ref loc="1CO 7:11">11</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Ento an awaco botwu ni, laco mo ma oryemo dakone, kono pi lok me tim me tarwang keken, nongo dong omiyo dakonu odoko latim abor; dok dano ma onyomo dako ma cware oryemo nongo otimo abor.</char><verse eid="MAT 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lok ma Yecu opwonyo ikom kwongo kwong</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 5:33" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:33: a </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 19:12">Lev 19:12</ref>; </char>
      <char style="xo" closed="false">b </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 30:2">Wel 30:2</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 23:21">Nwo 23:21</ref></char>
    </note> <char style="wj">Dok bene yam wuwinyo lok ma onongo kiwaco bot jo macon ni, ‘Pe ikwong kwong goba, ento cob kwongi ducu bot Rwot.’</char> <verse eid="MAT 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 5:34" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:34: a </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JAS 5:12">Yak 5:12</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">b </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 66:1">Ica 66:1</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 23:22">Mat 23:22</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Ento an awaco botwu ni: pe myero wukwong kwong mo kadi ki acel, kadi ki nying polo, pien meno komker pa Lubanga,</char> <verse eid="MAT 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 5:35" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:35: a </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 66:1">Ica 66:1</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">b </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 48:2">Jab 48:2</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">nyo ki nying lobo, pien meno kom me teno tyene, nyo kadi ki nying Jerucalem, pien meno taun madit pa Rwot madit.</char> <verse eid="MAT 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 5:36" /><char style="wj">Dok bene pe ikwong kwong ki wii, pien in pe itwero loko yer wii mo acel doko matar nyo macol.</char> <verse eid="MAT 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 5:37" /><char style="wj">Ento wuwek lokwu obed ni ‘Eyo’ nyo ‘Pe’; gin mukene makato lok man nongo oa ki bot Larac.</char><verse eid="MAT 5:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lok ma Yecu opwonyo ikom culu kwor</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:29-30">Luk 6:29-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 5:38" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:38: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 21:24">Nia 21:24</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 24:20">Lev 24:20</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 19:21">Nwo 19:21</ref></char>
    </note> <char style="wj">Dong wuwinyo yam ka kiwaco ni, ‘Wang kiculu ki wang, lak kiculu ki lak.’</char> <verse eid="MAT 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 5:39" /><char style="wj">Ento an awaco botwu ni: pe icul kwor ikom dano mo ma otimo gin marac ikomi. Kace ngat mo odongo lemi tung lacuc, lok bote lemi tung lacam wek odong bene;</char> <verse eid="MAT 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 5:40" /><char style="wj">dok kace ngat mo mito pido kwedi ni wek eter kotini, ci miye kanyini bene.</char> <verse eid="MAT 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 5:41" /><char style="wj">Kace dano mo odiyi tektek ni iting yece icit kwede i wot me mairo acel, wot kwede wot me mairo aryo.</char> <verse eid="MAT 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 5:42" /><char style="wj">Ka dano mo olegi gin mo ci myero imiye, dok bene pe myero ikwer pi den bot ngat ma mito deno jami ki boti.</char><verse eid="MAT 5:42" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Maro lukworwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:27-28">Luk 6:27-28</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 6:32-36">32-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 5:43" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:43: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 19:18">Lev 19:18</ref>
      </char>
    </note> <char style="wj">Dok wuwinyo bene ka yam kiwaco ni, ‘Mar lawoti ento ikwer lakwori.’</char> <verse eid="MAT 5:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 5:44" /><char style="wj">Ento an awaco botwu ni, ‘Wumar lukworwu, dok bene wuleg Lubanga pi jo ma keto ayelayela ikomwu,’</char> <verse eid="MAT 5:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 5:45" /><char style="wj">wek wudok lutino pa Wonwu matye i polo. Pien en miyo ceng tuc bot jo maracu ki jo mabeco bene, dok miyo kot cwer bot dano ma kitgi atir, ki bot jo ma pe kitgi atir bene.</char> <verse eid="MAT 5:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 5:46" /><char style="wj">Pien ka wumaro jo ma marowu keken, ci wubinongo iye kit pwoc ango? Lujog mucoro kono pe gitimo kitmeno?</char> <verse eid="MAT 5:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 5:47" /><char style="wj">Kace imoto utmegini keken, ci nongo itimo gin ango maber makato jo mukene? Lurok ma pe gingeyo Lubanga ni bene pe gitimo kitmeno?</char> <verse eid="MAT 5:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 5:48" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:48: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:2">Lev 19:2</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 18:13">Nwo 18:13</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Wubed jo ma bal mo peke ikomwu, kit macalo Wonwu matye i polo bal mo pe ikome ni.”</char><verse eid="MAT 5:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MAT 6" />
  <para style="s1">Lok ma Yecu opwonyo ikom konyo lucan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 6:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 23:5">Mat 23:5</ref>
      </char>
    </note> <char style="wj">“Wugwoke, pe wunyut kitwu ma atir inyim dano ni wek gunenwu. Ka wutimo kumeno ci pe wubinongo mot mo ki bot Wonwu matye i polo.</char><verse eid="MAT 6:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 6:2" />
    <char style="wj">Pimeno, ka ikonyo lucan pe ikut tum, macalo lugoba mogo gitimo i kacoke ki i yoogu, ni wek dano opakgi. Adada awaco botwu ni, dong gutyeko gamo mot meggi woko.</char> <verse eid="MAT 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 6:3" /><char style="wj">Ento in ka imiyo kony bot lucan, pe iwek cingi ma lacam onge gin ma cingi ma lacuc timo,</char> <verse eid="MAT 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 6:4" /><char style="wj">wek imii kony bot lucan i mung; ento Woru ma neni i mung bimiyi mot.</char><verse eid="MAT 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lok ma Yecu opwonyo ikom lego Lubanga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:2-4">Luk 11:2-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 6:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 18:10-14">Luk 18:10-14</ref>
      </char>
    </note> <char style="wj">Dok ka wutye kalego Lubanga, pe wubed calo jo ma lugoba, pien gimaro lego Lubanga kun gicung acunga i kacoke ki i angaka ngaka yoogu ducu, ni wek dano onengi. Adada awaco botwu ni, gin dong gutyeko gamo motgi woko.</char> <verse eid="MAT 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 6:6" /><char style="wj">Ento ka ilego, cit idony i kicikani ci ilor dogola woko, ka ileg Woru matye i mung; ci Woru ma neni i mungngi bimiyi mot.</char><verse eid="MAT 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 6:7" />
    <char style="wj">Ka wutye ka lega pe wudur lwak lok mapol kit macalo Lurok ma pe gingeyo Lubanga gitimo ni; pien gitamo ni Lubanga winyo legagi pi lwak lok mapol ma giduroni.</char> <verse eid="MAT 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 6:8" /><char style="wj">Pe wubed calo gin, pien Wonwu ngeyo gin ma wumito ma nongo peya wupenye.</char> <verse eid="MAT 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 6:9" /><char style="wj">Dong wuleg kit man ni,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 6:9">
    <char style="wj">‘Wonwa matye i polo,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 6:9">
    <char style="wj">kiwor nyingi maleng.</char><verse eid="MAT 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 6:10" />
    <char style="wj">Ker meri obin;</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 6:10">
    <char style="wj">kitii gin ma i mito i lobo kit ma kitiyo i polo.</char><verse eid="MAT 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 6:11" />
    <char style="wj">Miwa tin camwa me tin.</char><verse eid="MAT 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 6:12" />
    <char style="wj">Iwek balwa,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 6:12">
    <char style="wj">macalo wan waweko bal pa dano ma gibalo botwa.</char><verse eid="MAT 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 6:13" />
    <char style="wj">Pe iwek kibitwa,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 6:13">
    <char style="wj">ento ilarwa ki igin marac.</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 6:13">
    <char style="wj">Pien ker ki dit ki deyo obedo meri matwal, nino ma pe tum. Amen.’</char><verse eid="MAT 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 6:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MRK 11:25">Mar 11:25</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 11:26">26</ref></char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">Ka wutimo kica bot dano pi balgi, ci Wonwu matye i polo bene bitimowu kica.</char> <verse eid="MAT 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 6:15" /><char style="wj">Ento ka pe wutimo kica bot dano pi balgi, ci Wonwu matye i polo bene pe bitimowu kica pi balwu.</char><verse eid="MAT 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lok ma Yecu opwonyo ikom rii kec</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 6:16" />
    <char style="wj">Ka wurii kec pe wubed macalo lugoba ma wanggi nongo olwal woko, pien gibalo wanggi kitmeno ni wek dano onen ni gitye ka rii kec. Adada an awaco botwu ni, dong gutyeko gamo motgi woko.</char> <verse eid="MAT 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 6:17" /><char style="wj">Ento ka wurii kec, wuwir wiwu woko ki moo, ci wulwok wangwu woko bene,</char> <verse eid="MAT 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 6:18" /><char style="wj">wek dano pe gunen wun ni wutye ka rii kec, ento Wonwu makome pe nen aye onen; en Wonwu ma nenowu i mung bimiyowu mot.</char><verse eid="MAT 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lonyo ma kikano i polo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:33-34">Luk 12:33-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 6:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JAS 5:2">Yak 5:2</ref>,<ref loc="JAS 5:3">3</ref></char>
    </note> <char style="wj">Pe wukan lonyo pirwu kenwu i lobo, kama nyenye ki nyal gibalo woko, dok kama lukwo gibino gituru ot ci gikwalo woko.</char> <verse eid="MAT 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 6:20" /><char style="wj">Ento wukan lonyo pirwu kenwu i polo, kama nyenye ki nyal pe gibalo, dok kama lukwo pe bino gituru ot ci gikwalo.</char> <verse eid="MAT 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 6:21" /><char style="wj">Kama lonyowu tye iye cwinywu bene bedo iye.</char><verse eid="MAT 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tara me kom</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:34-36">Luk 11:34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 6:22" />
    <char style="wj">Tara me kom aye wang. Kace wangi bal mo peke iye, ci komi kulu bibedo i dero.</char> <verse eid="MAT 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 6:23" /><char style="wj">Ento kace wangi tye kibal mo ikome, ci komi kulu bibedo i colpiny. Dong ka dero ma i cwiny ni odoko mutu, ci mutune dong bedo rom mene!</char><verse eid="MAT 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tic pi Lubanga ka dok tic pi lim</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 16:13">Luk 16:13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 6:24" />
    <char style="wj">Pe tye dano mo matwero tic ite twero pa ludito aryo; pien bikwero ngat acel ci maro mukene ni, nyo bimoko ikom ngat acel, ci cayo ngat mukene ni. Pe wutwero tic pi Lubanga ka dok wutiyo pi lim bene.</char><verse eid="MAT 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bedo ki par mapol</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:22-31">Luk 12:22-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 6:25" />
    <char style="wj">Pimeno awaco botwu ni, pe wubed ki par mapol pi kwowu, ni wubicamo ango, nyo ni wubimato ango, nyo pi komwu, ni wubiruku ango. Kwo pe pire tek kato cam? Ki kom kono pe pire tek kato ginaruka?</char> <verse eid="MAT 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 6:26" /><char style="wj">Kong wunen winyo me polo; pe gicoyo kodi dok bene pe gikayo kac, pe bene gidilo cam idero, ento Wonwu matye i polo pud pitogi. Wun pe pirwu tek kato pirgi woko?</char> <verse eid="MAT 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 6:27" /><char style="wj">Dong anga ikinwu matwero medo mwaka acel ikom kwone pi bedo ki par mapol?</char> <verse eid="MAT 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 6:28" /><char style="wj">Pingo wubedo ki par mapol pi ginaruka? Kong wutam pi lenga me tim, kit ma gidongo kwede. Pe giwiyo uci, dok bene pe gicweyo bongo;</char> <verse eid="MAT 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 6:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 10:4-7">1 Luk 10:4-7</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 9:3-6">2 Tek 9:3-6</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">ento pud amede ki waco botwu ni, kadi bed Solomon yam oruke ki deyone ducu, ento pe oruke macalo mo acel ikin gi.</char> <verse eid="MAT 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 6:30" /><char style="wj">Kace Lubanga ruku lum ma i tim kitmeno, ma bedo tye pi nino ma tin keken, ento diki inongo kibolo woko i keno, ci en pe birukuwu makato, wun jo ma niyewu nok?</char> <verse eid="MAT 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 6:31" /><char style="wj">Pimeno pe wubed ki par mapol kun wuwaci, ‘Wabicamo ango?’ nyo ni, ‘Wabimato ango?’ nyo ni, ‘Wabiruku ango?’</char> <verse eid="MAT 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 6:32" /><char style="wj">Pien Lurok gitye kayenyo jami magi ducu; Wonwu matye i polo ngeyo bene ni wumito jami magi ducu.</char> <verse eid="MAT 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 6:33" /><char style="wj">Ento kong wukwong keto cwinywu ikom kere, ki nongo kit ma atir ma en tye kwede, ci jami magi ducu kibimedo botwu.</char> <verse eid="MAT 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 6:34" /><char style="wj">Pe wubed ki par mapol pi nino ma diki, pien nino ma diki biparo pire kene. Wuwek can me nino acel acel otum ki ninone.”</char><verse eid="MAT 6:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MAT 7" />
  <para style="s1">Ngolo kop ikom jo mukene</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:37-38">Luk 6:37-38</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 6:41-42">41-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 7:1" />
    <char style="wj">“Pe wungolkop ikom jo mukene, wek wun bene pe kingolkop ikomwu.</char> <verse eid="MAT 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 7:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 4:24">Mar 4:24</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Pien kit ma itero ki dano, en aye kibiteri kwede, dok kit ma ingolo kwede kop, en aye kibingolo kwede kop boti.</char> <verse eid="MAT 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 7:3" /><char style="wj">Pingo ineno cungkal matye iwang omeru, ento dul yat matye i wangi in ki komi pe ineno?</char> <verse eid="MAT 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 7:4" /><char style="wj">Nyo itwero waco bot omeru ningning ni, ‘Wek akwany cungkal matye i wangini woko’ kun in bene dul yat tye i wangi?</char> <verse eid="MAT 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 7:5" /><char style="wj">In lagoba, kong ikwong kwanyo dul yat matye i wangini woko, ci miyo dong ineno piny maber me kwanyo cungkal matye iwang omeru ca.</char><verse eid="MAT 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 7:6" />
    <char style="wj">Pe myero wumii jami maleng bot gwogi dok pe wubol ryal ma welgi tek bot opego, pien gibinyono anyona ki tyen gi dok gibiloke kalweny alwenya ikomwu.</char><verse eid="MAT 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Leg, yeny, dwong</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:9-13">Luk 11:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:31">6:31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 7:7" />
    <char style="wj">Wuleg, ci kibimiyo botwu; wuyeny, ci wubinongo; wudwong dogola ci kibiyabo botwu.</char> <verse eid="MAT 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 7:8" /><char style="wj">Pien dano ma lego kimiye, ki ngat ma yenyo bene nongo, ki ngat madwongo dogola bene kibiyabo dogola bote.</char> <verse eid="MAT 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 7:9" /><char style="wj">Anga ikinwu ma won latin, ma ka latine olege ni omiye kwon, ci bimiye gweng?</char> <verse eid="MAT 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 7:10" /><char style="wj">Nyo ka olege ni omiye rec, ci bimiye twol?</char> <verse eid="MAT 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 7:11" /><char style="wj">Dong kace wun jo maracu wungeyo miyo mot mabeco bot lutinowu, ci Wonwu matye i polo pe bimiyo jami mabeco makato ducu bot jo ma lege?</char> <verse eid="MAT 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 7:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 6:31">Luk 6:31</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Kit gin ducu ma wumito ni dano gutim botwu, wun bene wutim botgi kitmeno; pien man aye tyen lok me Cik ki pwony pa lunebi.</char><verse eid="MAT 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dogola mading</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:24">Luk 13:24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 7:13" />
    <char style="wj">Wudony ki idogola mading, pien dogola ma tero dano ito lac, dok yoo ne kipiro maber, dok jo ma donyo ki iye pol.</char> <verse eid="MAT 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 7:14" /><char style="wj">Pien dogola matero dano i kwo ding, ki yoo ne bene ding, dok jo ma nongo yoo meno gin nok.</char><verse eid="MAT 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yat maber kingeyo ki nyige</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:43-44">Luk 6:43-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 7:15" />
    <char style="wj">Wugwoke ikom lunebi ma lugoba, ma gibino botwu ma guruke woko calo romi, ento ki i cwinygi nongo gitye calo orudi ma owor.</char> <verse eid="MAT 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 7:16" /><char style="wj">Wubingeyogi ki kitgi. Kitwero pwono olok ki ikom yat okutu, nyo nyig oduru ki ikom yat tworo?</char> <verse eid="MAT 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 7:17" /><char style="wj">Kitmeno, yat maber nyako nyige mabeco, ento yat marac nyako nyige maracu.</char> <verse eid="MAT 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 7:18" /><char style="wj">Yat maber pe twero nyako nyige maracu, ki yat marac bene pe twero nyako nyige mabeco.</char> <verse eid="MAT 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 7:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:10">Mat 3:10</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:9">Luk 3:9</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Kit yat ducu ma pe nyako nyige mabeco kitongo ci kibolo woko imac.</char> <verse eid="MAT 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 7:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:33">Mat 12:33</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Kitmeno wun bene wubingeyogi ki kitgi.</char><verse eid="MAT 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Cake wacon onongo pe angeyowu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:25-27">Luk 13:25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 7:21" />
    <char style="wj">Pe dano ducu ma gilwonga ni, ‘Rwot, Rwot’ aye gibidonyo i ker me polo, ento ngat ma tiyo gin ma Wora ma i polo mito.</char> <verse eid="MAT 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 7:22" /><char style="wj">Inino meno jo mapol biwaco bota ni, ‘Rwot, Rwot, yam pe watito lok pa Lubanga i nyingi, dok pe waryemo cen maracugu woko ducu i nyingi? Yam pe watiyo tic mogo matek madito i nyingi?’</char> <verse eid="MAT 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 7:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 6:8">Jab 6:8</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Ci abitucu botgi kamaleng ni, ‘Onongo pe angeyowu; wua woko ki bota, wun lutim gin maracu.’</char><verse eid="MAT 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lugedo aryo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:47-49">Luk 6:47-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 7:24" />
    <char style="wj">Dano acel acel ma winyo loka ce tiyo kwede, bibedo calo dano maryek, ma ogedo ode ikom pata got.</char> <verse eid="MAT 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 7:25" /><char style="wj">Kot ocwer, lalele omol matek, ci yamo okodo matek ikom ot meno, oyengo, ento pe opoto, pien tegutine kikwinyo ikom pata got.</char> <verse eid="MAT 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 7:26" /><char style="wj">Ento dano acel acel ma winyo loka ce pe tiyo kwede bibedo calo dano ma laming ma ogedo ode ikom kweyo.</char> <verse eid="MAT 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 7:27" /><char style="wj">Kot ocwer, lalele omol matek, yamo okodo matek ikom ot, oyengo, ci opoto woko; potone owinye matek adada.”</char><verse eid="MAT 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Twero ma Yecu tye kwede</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:22">Mar 1:22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 7:28" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:28: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MRK 1:22">Mar 1:22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:32">Luk 4:32</ref></char>
    </note> Ikare ma Yecu dong otyeko loko lok magi ducu, lwak guuru kit pwonye matek, <verse eid="MAT 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 7:29" />pien opwonyogi calo ngat matye ki twero, pe macalo Lupwonycik.<verse eid="MAT 7:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MAT 8" />
  <para style="s1">Yecu ocango ladobo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:40-45">Mar 1:40-45</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:12-16">Luk 5:12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 8:1" />Ikare ma Yecu dong oa ki iwi got olor piny, lwak dano mapol gulube. <verse eid="MAT 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 8:2" />Ci cutcut ladobo mo obino bote, orumu conge piny inyime kun wace ni, “Ladit, ka i mito, itwero canga.” <verse eid="MAT 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 8:3" />Yecu oryeyo bade ogude, kun wace ni, <char style="wj">“Amito; cang.”</char> Cutcut dobone otugi cang woko. <verse eid="MAT 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 8:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 14:1-32">Lev 14:1-32</ref></char></note> Yecu ocike ni, <char style="wj">“Nen ni pe iwaco lok man bot ngat mo; ento icit inyute keni bot ajwaka pa Lubanga ci ityer mot mayam Moses ociko pire ni, wek dano gunen ni ada in kara dong icang.”</char><verse eid="MAT 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yecu ocango latic pa ladit ma Laroma maloyo acikari</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 7:1-10">Luk 7:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 8:5" />Ikare ma Yecu odonyo i Kapernaum, ladit mo maloyo acikari obino bote, malege kun waci, <verse eid="MAT 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 8:6" />“Rwot, latica tye twoyo two akweya, obutu piny i ganga, ma arem dong oketo kome woko.” <verse eid="MAT 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 8:7" />Ci Yecu odoke iye ni, <char style="wj">“Aebino ka cange.”</char> <verse eid="MAT 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 8:8" />Ento ladit maloyo acikari ogamo loke ni, “Rwot, an pe amyero me wek in ibin idony i oda; ento wac lok awaca keken, ci latica bicang. <verse eid="MAT 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 8:9" />Pien an bene adano ma kiloya aloya i dog tic, atye ki acikari bene ma an aloyogi. Ka awaco bot acikari mo acel ni, ‘Cit,’ ci cito, dok ka awaco bot ngat mukene ni, ‘Bin,’ ci bino, ka awaco bene bot opiina ni, ‘Tim man,’ ci timo.” <verse eid="MAT 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 8:10" />Ka Yecu owinyo lok man ma dano ni oloko, ci ouru tutwal. Owaco bot lwak ma gulube ni, <char style="wj">“Adada awaco botwu ni, peya anongo niye marom ki man, kadi i Icrael.</char> <verse eid="MAT 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 8:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 13:29">Luk 13:29</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Atitiwu ni jo mapol bia kitung kunyango, kitung kupotoceng gibibedo i dog cam kacel ki Abraim, Icaka ki Yakobo i ker me polo,</char> <verse eid="MAT 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 8:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 22:13">Mat 22:13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 25:30">25:30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:28">Luk 13:28</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">ento lutino me ker kibibologi woko i colpiny, kama dano bikok kun gikayo lakgi iye.”</char> <verse eid="MAT 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 8:13" />Lacen Yecu owaco bot ladit maloyo acikari ni, <char style="wj">“Cit, omyero otime boti kit macalo dong i ye kwede ni.”</char> Ci latice ocang woko cut i cawa meno.<verse eid="MAT 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yecu ocango maro pa Petero</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:29-31">Mar 1:29-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:38-39">Luk 4:38-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 8:14" />Lacen ikare ma Yecu odonyo i ot pa Petero, ci oneno maro pa Petero obutu piny onongo tye ki two lyeto. <verse eid="MAT 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 8:15" />Yecu ogudu cinge, ci two lyeto ocang woko ki ikome, oa malo ocako gwoko Yecu.<verse eid="MAT 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 8:16" />I otyeno me nino meno dano gukelo bote jo mapol ma onongo cen tye ikomgi; ci oryemo cen woko ki lok keken, dok bene ocango jo ducu ma onongo komgi lit. <verse eid="MAT 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 8:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:4">Ica 53:4</ref></char></note> Man otime wek lok mayam lanebi Icaya oloko ocobe kakare ni, “En otingo gorowa, dok otingo twowa ducu ikome.”<verse eid="MAT 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jo ma onongo gimito lubu Yecu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 9:57-62">Luk 9:57-62</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 8:18" />Ka Yecu dong oneno lwak dano orume woko dyere, ci owaco bot lupwonyene ni myero gikat loka nam tungcel. <verse eid="MAT 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 8:19" />Lapwonycik mo oa obino bote owace ni, “Lapwony, abilubi kama icito iye ducu.” <verse eid="MAT 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 8:20" />Ento Yecu odoke iye ni, <char style="wj">“Too tye ki boro, winyo me polo bene tye ki odigi, ento Wod pa dano pe tye ki kama myero opyel iye wiye.”</char> <verse eid="MAT 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 8:21" />Dok dano mo acel ikin lupwonyene owace ni, “Rwot, kong iwek acit ayik wora.” <verse eid="MAT 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 8:22" />Ento Yecu odoke iye ni, <char style="wj">“Luba, wek jo ma oto guyik jo ma oto wadigi.”</char><verse eid="MAT 8:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yecu ojuku yamo i nam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:35-41">Mar 4:35-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:22-25">Luk 8:22-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 8:23" />Ka Yecu odonyo i yeya, ci lupwonyene gulube. <verse eid="MAT 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 8:24" />Ci nen, pii me nam ocako twage matek, ma yeya onongo dong cok lwiny woko ite pii; ento Yecu onongo onino woko. <verse eid="MAT 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 8:25" />Ci gucito gucoye, kun giwace ni, “Larwa Rwot, nen wato woko do!” <verse eid="MAT 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 8:26" />En owaco botgi ni, <char style="wj">“Pingo wubedo ki lworo, wun jo ma niyewu nok?”</char> Ci oa malo, ojuku yamo ki nam, ci nam ocako ling mot. <verse eid="MAT 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 8:27" />Ma omiyo dano guuru matek, kun giwaco ni, “Man dok kit dano ango ma yamo ki nam giwinye ni?”<verse eid="MAT 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yecu ocango jo matye ki cen</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 5:1-20">Mar 5:1-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:26-39">Luk 8:26-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 8:28" />Ka Yecu dong oo loka nam tungcel, i lobo pa Lugadara, cutcut jo aryo ma cen tye ikomgi gurwate kwede; onongo gua ki ikin lyel. Onongo giger adada ma ngat mo pe twero kato ki i yoo kenyo. <verse eid="MAT 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 8:29" />Ci gudange matek ni, “Ilaro ango kwedwa, in Wod pa Lubanga? In mono ibino kany kaunuwa ma kare peya oromo?” <verse eid="MAT 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 8:30" />Lwak opego mapol onongo gitye ka cam kama gitye kalok iye. <verse eid="MAT 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 8:31" />Ci cen gubako doggi bote kun giwaco ni, “Kace i mito ryemowa woko, cwalwa i dul opego nica.” <verse eid="MAT 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 8:32" />Ci Yecu owaco botgi ni, <char style="wj">“Wucit.”</char> Gua woko ki ikom jonu ci gudonyo i opego; cutcut lwak opego gutware ki ngwec gularo piny i lung matut ci gupoto woko i nam, gumwony guto woko i pii. <verse eid="MAT 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 8:33" />Lukwat guringo woko, gucito wa i taun madit ci gutito lok ikom gin ducu ma otime, wa lok ma otime ikom jo aryo ma cen onongo tye ikomgi ni. <verse eid="MAT 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 8:34" />Ma omiyo lwak dano ducu ma i taun meno gubino karwate ki Yecu; ka gunene, ci gubako doggi bote ni en omyero oa woko ki i lobogi.<verse eid="MAT 8:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MAT 9" />
  <para style="s1">Yecu ocango dano matwoyo two akweya kom</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:1-12">Mar 2:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:17-26">Luk 5:17-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 9:1" />Yecu odonyo i yeya ongolo nam okato loka tungcel, ci obino i lobo tugi kikome. <verse eid="MAT 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 9:2" />Ci kikelo bote dano mo matwoyo two akweya kom kun obutu iwi kitara. Ka Yecu oneno niyegi, ci owaco bot dano matwo ni, <char style="wj">“Di cwinyi, latina, bali dong kiweko woko.”</char> <verse eid="MAT 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 9:3" />Ma omiyo Lupwonycik mogo gucako loko lok keken gi ni, “Dano man tye kayeto Lubanga.” <verse eid="MAT 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 9:4" />Ento Yecu ongeyo tamgi woko, ci openyogi ni, <char style="wj">“Pingo wutamo tam marac i cwinywu?</char> <verse eid="MAT 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 9:5" /><char style="wj">Mene mayot makato, me waco ni, ‘Bali dong kiweko’, nyo ni, ‘Aa, iwoti’?</char> <verse eid="MAT 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 9:6" /><char style="wj">Ento man me miyo wek wunge ni, Wod pa dano tye ki twero i lobo man me weko bal,” ci owaco bot latwo ni, “Aa, ikwany kabutuni idok paco.”</char> <verse eid="MAT 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 9:7" />Ci oa odok paco. <verse eid="MAT 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 9:8" />Ka lwak guneno gin ma otime, lworo omakogi, ci gumiyo deyo bot Lubanga, ma omiyo kit twero macalo meno bot dano.<verse eid="MAT 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yecu olwongo Matayo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:13-17">Mar 2:13-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:27-32">Luk 5:27-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 9:9" />Ikare ma Yecu tye kakato ki kunu, ci oneno laco mo ma nyinge Matayo obedo kama kijogo iye mucoro owace ni, <char style="wj">“Lub kora.”</char> Ci oa malo olubu kore.<verse eid="MAT 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 9:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 15:1">Luk 15:1</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 15:2">2</ref></char>
    </note> Ikare ma Yecu obedo i ot pa Matayo i dog cam, lujog mucoro mapol ki lubalo gubino gubedo kacel ki Yecu ki lupwonyene. <verse eid="MAT 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 9:11" />Ka Luparicayo guneno man, gupenyo lupwonyene ni, “Pingo lapwonywu camo kacel ki lujog mucoro ki lubalo?” <verse eid="MAT 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 9:12" />Ikare ma Yecu owinyo ogamo ni, <char style="wj">“Jo ma komgi yot pe gimito daktar, ento kono jo ma komgi lit aye.</char> <verse eid="MAT 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 9:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:13: a </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:7">Mat 12:7</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">b </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 6:6">Koc 6:6</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Wucit wupwonye i tyen lok man ni, ‘Amito kica, pe gin atyera.’ Pien pe abino kalwongo jo ma kitgi atir, ento lubalo.”</char><verse eid="MAT 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Peny ikom lok me rii kec</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:18-22">Mar 2:18-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:33-39">Luk 5:33-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 9:14" />Ikare meno lupwonye pa Jon gubino bot Yecu, gupenye ni, “Pingo wan kacel ki Luparicayo wa rii kec, ento lupwonyeni pe giri kec?” <verse eid="MAT 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 9:15" />Ci Yecu odok iye botgi ni, <char style="wj">“Lurem lanyom twero kumu ma nongo lanyom pud tye kacel kwedgi? Kare bibino ma kibikwanyo lanyom woko ki botgi, ka dong gibiri kec ikare meno.</char> <verse eid="MAT 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 9:16" /><char style="wj">Pe tye ngat mo ma dabo bongo manyen ikom ginaruka ma otii. Pien kiraka biyec woko ki ikom ginaruka, ci wang bongo yec mede marac adada.</char> <verse eid="MAT 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 9:17" /><char style="wj">Dok bene pe tye ngat mo ma piko kongo bwino manyen i opiru macon; ka opiko, ci kongo bwino biyeco opiru woko, kongo bwino bio woko ki opiru bene bibale. Ento kongo bwino manyen myero kipik i opiru kongo bwino manyen, wek gin aryo ducu kigwokgi maber.”</char><verse eid="MAT 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nya pa laloc mo ki dako ma ogudu dog bongo pa Yecu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 5:21-43">Mar 5:21-43</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:40-56">Luk 8:40-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 9:18" />Ikare ma Yecu tye kalok botgi, cutcut laloc mo obino odonyo i ot orumu conge, inyime kun wace ni, “Nyara oto pud kombedi, ento alegi ibin iket cingi ikome, ci bibedo kwo.” <verse eid="MAT 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 9:19" />Yecu oa olubu kore kacel ki lupwonyene. <verse eid="MAT 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 9:20" />Ci dako mo ma onongo dong otwoyo two agobi pi mwaka apar wiye aryo obino kitung inge Yecu ogudu dog bongone, <verse eid="MAT 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 9:21" />pien onongo otamo ki i cwinye kekene ni, “Kace agudu bongone keken, ci abicang.” <verse eid="MAT 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 9:22" />Yecu oloke, ka onene owace ni, <char style="wj">“Di cwinyi nyara; niyeni ocangi.”</char> <verse eid="MAT 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 9:23" />Ka Yecu obino i ot pa laloc, oneno lukut nyamulere, kun lwak tye kakoko, <verse eid="MAT 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 9:24" />ci owaco ni, <char style="wj">“Wua woko; nyakoni pe oto ento onino anina.”</char> Ci gin gunyere anyera. <verse eid="MAT 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 9:25" />Ento ikare madong oryemo lwak gukato woko, ci en odonyo i ot omako latin nyakoni ki cinge, nyakoni oa malo. <verse eid="MAT 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 9:26" />Lok meno oywek owinye oromo lobo meno ducu.<verse eid="MAT 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yecu ocango lutowang aryo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Mat 20:29-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 9:27" />Ikare ma Yecu dong oa ki kunu omede ki wote, ci lutowang aryo gulube, ma gidange matek ni, “Kica omaki ikomwa do, Lakwar Daudi.” <verse eid="MAT 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 9:28" />Ka Yecu dong odonyo i ot, lutowang aryo magi gubino bote; ci en openyogi ni, <char style="wj">“Wuye ni atwero timo man?”</char> Gudoke iye ni, “Itwero, Rwot.” <verse eid="MAT 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 9:29" />Yecu ogudu wanggi kun waco ni, <char style="wj">“Wek otime botwu kit macalo niyewu tye kwede.”</char> <verse eid="MAT 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 9:30" />Cutcut wanggi otugi yabe woko. Yecu ocikogi matek tutwal ni, <char style="wj">“Wunen ni dano mo pe ongeyo lok man.”</char> <verse eid="MAT 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 9:31" />Ento gin gucito guketo lok man omiyo nyinge oywek oromo lobo meno ducu.<verse eid="MAT 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dano ma telebe oto oloko</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:22-24">Mat 12:22-24</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:14-15">Luk 11:14-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 9:32" />Ikare ma Yecu ki lupwonyene gia me cito woko, kikelo bote dano mo ma telebe oto, ma onongo tye ki cen. <verse eid="MAT 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 9:33" />Ka dong Yecu oryemo cen woko, cutcut laco meno ma telebe oto ni ocako lok. Ma omiyo lwak ma onongo gitye kenyo guuru matek, kun giwaco ni, “Cake manaka yam con kit gin macalo man peya onongo onen i Icrael.” <verse eid="MAT 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 9:34" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:34: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:25">Mat 10:25</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:24">12:24</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:22">Mar 3:22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:15">Luk 11:15</ref></char></note> Ento Luparicayo guwaco ni, “En ryemo cen pi twero pa ladit pa cen.”<verse eid="MAT 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kica omako Yecu ikom lwak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 9:35" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:35: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 4:23">Mat 4:23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:39">Mar 1:39</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:44">Luk 4:44</ref></char>
    </note> Yecu owoto orumu taun madito mapatpat ki gangi matino ma i carogu ducu, kun pwonyo i kacokegi, dok tito kwede lok me Kwena Maber me ker pa Lubanga ki cango kit two ducu kadi wa kit goro ducu. <verse eid="MAT 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 9:36" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:36: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 27:17">Wel 27:17</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 22:17">1 Luk 22:17</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 18:16">2 Tek 18:16</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 34:5">Eje 34:5</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 10:2">Jek 10:2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:34">Mar 6:34</ref></char></note> Ka oneno lwak ci kica omake ikomgi mada, pien onongo gitye ka unugi matek, dong gudoko goro, calo romi ma lakwatgi peke. <verse eid="MAT 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 9:37" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:37: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 10:2">Luk 10:2</ref></char></note> Lacen owaco ki lupwonyene ni, <char style="wj">“Kac dwong, ento lutic nok.</char> <verse eid="MAT 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 9:38" /><char style="wj">Pimeno, wuleg Won poto wek ocwal lutic ka kayo kace.”</char><verse eid="MAT 9:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MAT 10" />
  <para style="s1">Yecu oyero Lukwena apar wiye aryo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:13-19">Mar 3:13-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:12-16">Luk 6:12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 10:1" />Yecu olwongo lupwonyene apar wiye aryo bote, ci omiyogi twero me ryemo cen, ki me cango kit two ducu kadi wa gorogu. <verse eid="MAT 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 10:2" />Nying lukwena pa Yecu magi apar wiye aryo gin ene: mukwongo Cimon, ma kilwongo ni Petero, ki Anderiya omine; Yakobo wod pa Jebedayo, ki Jon omine; <verse eid="MAT 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 10:3" />Pilipo ki Bartolomayo; Tomaci ki Matayo lajog mucoro; Yakobo wod pa Alipayo, ki Tadayo; <verse eid="MAT 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 10:4" />Cimon mayam obedo ikin jo ma gimito locken, ki Juda me Keriot, ma oloke odobe.<verse eid="MAT 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yecu ooro lukwena apar wiye aryo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:7-13">Mar 6:7-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:1-6">Luk 9:1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 10:5" />Jo magi apar wiye aryo Yecu oorogi, kun cikogi ni, <char style="wj">“Pe wucit ikin Lurok, pe bene wudony i taun pa Lucamaria mo,</char> <verse eid="MAT 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 10:6" /><char style="wj">ento wucit bot jo Icrael, ma gitye calo romi ma orwenyo.</char> <verse eid="MAT 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 10:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 10:4-12">Luk 10:4-12</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Ikare me wotwu wutit lok me Kwena Maber kit man ni, ‘Ker me polo dong onyiko cok.’</char> <verse eid="MAT 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 10:8" /><char style="wj">Wucang lutwo, wucer jo ma oto, wucang ludobo wek gulonye, wuryem cen. Wun wugamo twero man nono labongo cul mo, wumii bene nono labongo cul.</char> <verse eid="MAT 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 10:9" /><char style="wj">Pe wuwot ki jabu, kadi ryal, kadi lim mo i opiru lim mo ipyerwu,</char> <verse eid="MAT 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 10:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 9:14">1 Kor 9:14</ref>; <ref loc="1TI 5:18">1 Tem 5:18</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">pe wuter kadi opiru mo me wotwu, kadi ki bamo kanyi aryo, kadi war tyen, kadi ki odo; pien latic myero kimiye cam ocam.</char> <verse eid="MAT 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 10:11" /><char style="wj">Taun nyo paco mo ma wudonyo iye, kong wuniang anga ma myero ma kite atir ma bedo iye, ci wubed bote nio wang ma wua ki kenyo.</char> <verse eid="MAT 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 10:12" /><char style="wj">Ka wubidonyo i ot kong wumot dano ma i ot meno.</char> <verse eid="MAT 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 10:13" /><char style="wj">Ci ka ot meno ojolowu, wumii kuc ikom jo me ot meno; ento kace pe ojolowu, ci wuwek kucwu odwog cen botwu.</char> <verse eid="MAT 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 10:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:51">Tic 13:51</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Kace ngat mo pe bijolowu nyo pe biwinyo lokwu, ci wuteng apwa woko ki i tyenwu me bedo caden botgi ka wua wuweko ot nyo taun meno.</char> <verse eid="MAT 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 10:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:15: a </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 11:24">Mat 11:24</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">b </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 19:24-28">Aca 19:24-28</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Adada, atitiwu ni, inino me ngolo kop can pa Codom ki Gomora bibedo tworatwora, ento can ma kibikelo ikom taun meno dong bikato.</char><verse eid="MAT 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ayelayela ma bibedo ikare me anyim</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:9-13">Mar 13:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:12-17">Luk 21:12-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 10:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 10:3">Luk 10:3</ref>
      </char>
    </note> <char style="wj">Nen, dong acwalowu me cito woko macalo romi ikin orudi; pimeno wubed ryek calo twol dok wubed mwol macalo akuri.</char> <verse eid="MAT 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 10:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 13:9-11">Mar 13:9-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:11">Luk 12:11</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 12:12">12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:12-15">21:12-15</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Dok wugwoke ikom jo ma bikelo ayela ikomwu; pien gibiterowu i kot, dok gibigoyowu i kacokegi,</char> <verse eid="MAT 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 10:18" /><char style="wj">gibiywayowu giterowu inyim luloc ki lukergu pira, wubitito lok ma bedo caden botgi ki bot Lurok bene.</char> <verse eid="MAT 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 10:19" /><char style="wj">Ka kiterowu ikot, pe wubed ka tamo kit mamyero wulok kwede, nyo kit lok ango ma wubilokone; pien lok mamyero wuloki kibimiyowu i cawa meno;</char> <verse eid="MAT 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 10:20" /><char style="wj">pien pe wun aye wubilok, ento Cwiny Maleng pa Wonwu aye bilok ki i iwu.</char> <verse eid="MAT 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 10:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 13:12">Mar 13:12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:16">Luk 21:16</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Omego bimiyo omine ni kinek woko, ki wego bene bimiyo latine ni kinek woko, ki lutino gibituge ikom lunyodogi, gimiyo lunyodogi ni kinekgi woko;</char> <verse eid="MAT 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 10:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:22: a </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:9">Mat 24:9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:13">Mar 13:13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:17">Luk 21:17</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">b </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:13">Mat 24:13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:13">Mar 13:13</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">dok dano ducu bikwerowu pira. Ento ngat ma ciro kun diyo cwinye nio i agiki bilare.</char> <verse eid="MAT 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 10:23" /><char style="wj">Ka inen guketo ayela ikomwu i taun acel, ci wuring woko i taun macok kwede; pien ada awaciwu ni, pe wubiwoto i taun me Icrael wurumu woko ducu, ma nongo peya Wod pa dano obino.</char><verse eid="MAT 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 10:24" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:24: a </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 6:40">Luk 6:40</ref>; </char>
      <char style="xo" closed="false">b </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 13:16">Jon 13:16</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 15:20">15:20</ref></char>
    </note> <char style="wj">Dano ma pud kipwonyo apwonya pe bedo dit makato ngat ma pwonye, kadi latic bene pe bedo dit makato ladite;</char> <verse eid="MAT 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 10:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 9:34">Mat 9:34</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:24">12:24</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:22">Mar 3:22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:15">Luk 11:15</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">ento dano ma kipwonyoni romo doko calo ngat ma pwonye, ki latic bene doko calo ladite. Ka onongo gulwongo won ot ni Beeljebul, ci dong jo ma ipacone gibilwongogi ki nying marac marom mene?</char><verse eid="MAT 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ngat ma myero dano olwor</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:2-9">Luk 12:2-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 10:26" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:26: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MRK 4:22">Mar 4:22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:17">Luk 8:17</ref></char>
    </note> <char style="wj">Pimeno, pe wulworgi; pien pe tye gin ma kiumu ma pe kibiyabo kamaleng, kadi ki gin ma kikano ma pe bingene.</char> <verse eid="MAT 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 10:27" /><char style="wj">Gin ma awaco botwu i colpiny, myero wutit kama leng; ki gin ma kikwilo akwila i itwu lawewe, wutuc loke wa iwi labila ot.</char> <verse eid="MAT 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 10:28" /><char style="wj">Pe wulwor jo ma neko kom, ento pe gitwero neko tipu; ento myero wulwor ngat matwero neko tipu ki kom ducu i Geena.</char> <verse eid="MAT 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 10:29" /><char style="wj">Ojwinyojwiny aryo pe kicato pi cente mo manok keken? Ento mo acel pe poto piny i ngom ma Wonwu pe ngeyo.</char> <verse eid="MAT 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 10:30" /><char style="wj">Kadi bed wa yer wiwu dong kikwanogi woko liweng.</char> <verse eid="MAT 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 10:31" /><char style="wj">Pimeno, pe wulwor; pien pirwu tek tutwal makato pi ojwinyojwiny mapol.</char> <verse eid="MAT 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 10:32" /><char style="wj">Pimeno dano ducu ma biye an inyim dano, an bene abiye en inyim Wora matye i polo,</char> <verse eid="MAT 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 10:33" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:33: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TI 2:12">2 Tem 2:12</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">ento ngat ma bikwera inyim dano, an bene abikwere woko inyim Wora matye i polo.</char><verse eid="MAT 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pe kuc ento pala lucwan</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:51-53">Luk 12:51-53</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:26-27">14:26-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 10:34" />
    <char style="wj">Pe wutam ni abino me kelo kuc i lobo; an pe abino me kelo kuc, ento pala lucwan.</char> <verse eid="MAT 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 10:35" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:35: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MIC 7:6">Mik 7:6</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Pien abino me poko kin latin awobi ki wone, nyako bipoke woko ki mine, ki ciwod bene bipoke woko ki daa ne.</char> <verse eid="MAT 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 10:36" /><char style="wj">Lukwor pa dano bibedo jo ma ipacone.</char> <verse eid="MAT 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 10:37" /><char style="wj">Ngat mamaro wone nyo mine makato an pe myero me bedo danona; ki ngat mamaro wode nyo nyare makato an pe myero me bedo danona.</char> <verse eid="MAT 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 10:38" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:38: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 16:24">Mat 16:24</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:34">Mar 8:34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:23">Luk 9:23</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Dok bene dano ma pe tingo yatariyane kun lubu kwede kora pe myero me bedo danona.</char> <verse eid="MAT 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 10:39" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:39: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 16:25">Mat 16:25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:35">Mar 8:35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:24">Luk 9:24</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:33">17:33</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:25">Jon 12:25</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Dano ma keto cwinye i kwo me lobo man, birwenyone woko arwenya; ento dano ma jalo kwone pira binongo kwo ma pe tum.</char><verse eid="MAT 10:39" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mot ma dano binongo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:41">Mar 9:41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 10:40" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:40: a </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 13:20">Jon 13:20</ref>; </char>
      <char style="xo" closed="false">b </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MRK 9:37">Mar 9:37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:48">Luk 9:48</ref></char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">Dano ma jolowu nongo ojolo an, ki ngat ma jola nongo ojolo ngat ma oora.</char> <verse eid="MAT 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 10:41" /><char style="wj">Ngat ma jolo lanebi ni pien obedo lanebi, bilimo mot pa lanebi; ki ngat ma bijolo dano ma kite atir, pien dano meno kite atir, bilimo mot marom ki pa dano ma kite atirni.</char> <verse eid="MAT 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 10:42" /><char style="wj">Dok bene dano ma bimiyo pii mangic me amata bot ngat acel ikom jo magi matino ni pien en obedo, lapwonyena, adada awaciwu ni, pe bikeng mote.”</char><verse eid="MAT 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MAT 11" />
  <para style="s1">Jo ma Jon Labatija oorogi bot Yecu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 7:18-35">Luk 7:18-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 11:1" />Ikare madong Yecu otyeko ciko lupwonyene apar wiye aryoni, oa ki kunu ocito kapwony ki katito lok ikin taun gi macok ki kunu.<verse eid="MAT 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 11:2" />Madong Jon owinyo pi tic pa Yecu ki i buc, ci ooro lupwonyene bot Yecu <verse eid="MAT 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 11:3" />wek gupenye ni, “In aye ngat ma myero obin ni, nyo dok wakur ngat mukene?” <verse eid="MAT 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 11:4" />Ci Yecu odok iye botgi ni, <char style="wj">“Wucitit bot Jon gin ma wuwinyo ki ma wuneno;</char> <verse eid="MAT 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 11:5" /><char style="wj">lutowang wanggi oyabe guneno piny, lungolo guwoto, ludobo kicangogi, ki ludingit guwinyo lok, ki jo ma oto kicerogi woko, ki lucan bene kitito botgi lok me Kwena Maber.</char> <verse eid="MAT 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 11:6" /><char style="wj">Dong dano ma pe okwanyo niye ne woko ki ikoma tye ki gum.”</char><verse eid="MAT 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 11:7" />Ikare ma lupwonye pa Jon dong gitye ka dok cen, Yecu ocako lok ki lwak, lok ikom Jon ni, <char style="wj">“Onongo wucito i tim kaneno gin ango? Onongo wucito kaneno lagada ma yamo obedo ka yengone?</char> <verse eid="MAT 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 11:8" /><char style="wj">Wucito kunu kono pingo? Wucito kaneno dano ma oruku bongi mabeco? Nen, jo ma ruku bongi mabeco gibedo i odi pa luker.</char> <verse eid="MAT 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 11:9" /><char style="wj">Wucito kunu pingo? Wucito kaneno lanebi mo? Eyo, awaciwu ni kaneno ngat makato lanebi.</char> <verse eid="MAT 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 11:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 3:1">Mal 3:1</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Man aye ngat mayam kicoyo lok ikome ni,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 11:10">
    <char style="wj">‘Nen, acwalo lakwenana otelo nyimi,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 11:10">
    <char style="wj">ma bigero yoo ni ma peya nongo in ibino.’</char><verse eid="MAT 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 11:11" />
    <char style="wj">Adada, awaco botwu ni, pe tye dano mo ki ikin jo ma mon onywalogi makato Jon Labatija ki dit; ento ngat matidi tutwal i ker me polo aye dit kate.</char> <verse eid="MAT 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 11:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 16:16">Luk 16:16</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Cake ikare pa Jon Labatija nio kwede wa onyo ker me polo kinyayo ki tek, jo ma gin lutim gero aye gijuku ki tek.</char> <verse eid="MAT 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 11:13" /><char style="wj">Pien Cik pa Moses ki lunebi gubedo katito lok pa Lubanga nio wa ikare pa Jon;</char> <verse eid="MAT 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 11:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 4:5">Mal 4:5</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 17:10-13">Mat 17:10-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:11-13">Mar 9:11-13</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">kace wumito ye lok gi ci Jon aye Eliya ma omyero obin ni.</char> <verse eid="MAT 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 11:15" /><char style="wj">Ngat ma ite tye me winyo lok man myero owiny.</char><verse eid="MAT 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 11:16" />
    <char style="wj">Abiporo yalwak me kare man ki gin ango? Gin romaroma ki lutino mabedo i cuk ma gilwongo lutino wadigi kun giwaco ni,</char><verse eid="MAT 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 11:17" />
    <char style="wj">‘Yam wakutu nyamulere botwu,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 11:17">
    <char style="wj">ento wun pe wumyelo;</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 11:17">
    <char style="wj">wawero wer lyel,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 11:17">
    <char style="wj">ento wun pe wukok.’</char><verse eid="MAT 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 11:18" />
    <char style="wj">Pien Jon yam obino ma pe camo cam, dok bene onongo pe mato kongo bwino mo, man omiyo guwaco ni, ‘Dano man tye ki cen.’</char> <verse eid="MAT 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 11:19" /><char style="wj">Wod pa dano obino kun camo cam dok mato mat bene, meno bene guwaco ni, ‘Nen, dano ma owor dok lamero bene, larem lujog mucoro ki lubalo!’ Ento ryeko pa Lubanga tye kakare pi gin ma en tiyo.”</char><verse eid="MAT 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Can ikom taun madito ma pe giye ngut</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 19:13-15">Luk 19:13-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 11:20" />Lacen Yecu ocako loko lok ki kiniga ikom taun madito mogo mayam en onongo otiyo iye tice matego dok madito, pien jo matye iye gukwero ngut woko. <verse eid="MAT 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 11:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 23:1-18">Ica 23:1-18</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 26:1-28:26">Eje 26:1—28:26</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 3:4-8">Joe 3:4-8</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 1:9">Amo 1:9</ref>,<ref loc="AMO 1:10">10</ref></char></note> Yecu owaco ni <char style="wj">“Ibineno can, in Korajin! Ibineno can, in Betecaida! Kono yam tic madito ma kitiyo botwu kitiyo i Turo ki Cidon, kono onongo jone gungut wa con, kun gin ruku bongo cola, ma gibedo i buru bene.</char> <verse eid="MAT 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 11:22" /><char style="wj">Ento atiti ni, can pa Turo ki Cidon bibedo tworatwora inino me ngolo kop, makato can ma bipoto ikomi.</char> <verse eid="MAT 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 11:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:23: a </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 14:13-15">Ica 14:13-15</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">b </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 19:24-28">Aca 19:24-28</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Ki in Kapernaum kibitingi woko malo i polo? Pe kumeno, kibidwoki woko piny i lyel. Kono yam tic matek madito ma kitiyo botwuni kitiyo i Codom, kono obedo tye nio wa onyo.</char> <verse eid="MAT 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 11:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:15">Mat 10:15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:12">Luk 10:12</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Ento atiti ni, can pa Codom bibedo tworatwora inino me ngolo kop, makato can ma bipoto ikom in.”</char><verse eid="MAT 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Wubin bota wek wuywe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 10:21-22">Luk 10:21-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 11:25" />Ikare meno Yecu otucu ni, <char style="wj">“Apwoyi Wora, in Rwot me polo ki me lobo, pien ikano lok magi woko ki bot luryeko ki jo makwiri, ci inyutugi bot lutino lukere.</char> <verse eid="MAT 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 11:26" /><char style="wj">Eyo, Wora, pien onongo ineno ni ber i wangi kitmeno, dok ipwoyo kit yo macalo meno.</char> <verse eid="MAT 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 11:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:27: a </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:35">Jon 3:35</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">b </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:18">Jon 1:18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 10:15">10:15</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Jami ducu dong Wora otyeko miyogi woko bota; ngat mo pe mangeyo Wod, kono Won keken, dok bene ngat mo pe mangeyo Won kono Wod keken ki ngat ma Wod oyero me nyutu Won bote.</char> <verse eid="MAT 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 11:28" /><char style="wj">Wubin bota, wun jo ducu ma wuol ki ma yec onuruwu, ci abimiyo wuywe.</char> <verse eid="MAT 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 11:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 6:16">Jer 6:16</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Wuting ayokona, ki wupwony kita, pien an awor, dok amwol bene i cwinya, ma omiyo wun bene wubilimo yweyo i cwinywu.</char> <verse eid="MAT 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 11:30" /><char style="wj">Pien ayokona yot, ki yeca bene pe pek.”</char><verse eid="MAT 11:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MAT 12" />
  <para style="s1">Lapeny ma mako ceng Cabit</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:23-28">Mar 2:23-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:1-5">Luk 6:1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 12:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 23:25">Nwo 23:25</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Ikare meno Yecu owoto kun ngolo ki i poto ngano i ceng Cabit. Kec onongo neko lupwonyene, ci gucako rito wit ngano gumwodo. <verse eid="MAT 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 12:2" />Ento ka Luparicayo guneno, ci guwaco bot Yecu ni, “Nen, lupwonyeni gitiyo gin ma cik ogengo ni pe kiti i ceng Cabit.” <verse eid="MAT 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 12:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 21:1-6">1 Cam 21:1-6</ref></char></note> Yecu odok iye botgi ni, <char style="wj">“Wun pe wukwano gin ma Daudi otiyo, ikare ma onongo kec oneke, en kacel ki jo ma onongo gitye kwede?</char> <verse eid="MAT 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 12:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 24:9">Lev 24:9</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Kit ma en odonyo kwede i Ot pa Lubanga, ci ocamo mugati ma kiketo inyim Lubanga, mayam Cik ogengo ni en pe ocam, kadi ki jo ma onongo gitye kacel kwede, ento kono ajwaki pa Lubanga keken?</char> <verse eid="MAT 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 12:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 28:9">Wel 28:9</ref>,<ref loc="NUM 28:10">10</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Dok bene pe wukwano i Cik ni i ceng Cabit ajwaki ma i Ot pa Lubanga gipyedo ceng Cabit, ento gipeke kibal?</char> <verse eid="MAT 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 12:6" /><char style="wj">Atitiwu ni gin madit makato Ot pa Lubanga tye kany.</char> <verse eid="MAT 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 12:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:7: a </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 9:13">Mat 9:13</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">b </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 6:6">Koc 6:6</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Kace onongo wungeyo tyen lok man ni, ‘Amito kica, pe lee me gitum,’ onongo myero pe wungolkop oloo jo ma peke ki bal.</char> <verse eid="MAT 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 12:8" /><char style="wj">Pien Wod pa dano aye Rwot me ceng Cabit.”</char><verse eid="MAT 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dano ma bade otal</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:1-6">Mar 3:1-6</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:6-11">Luk 6:6-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 12:9" />Yecu oa ki kunu ocito odonyo i kacoke. <verse eid="MAT 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 12:10" />Nen, onongo yam tye kunu dano mo ma bade otal. Ci gupenye ni, “Cik ye ni kicang dano i ceng Cabit?” Gupenye kitmeno pien onongo gimito ni gidote. <verse eid="MAT 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 12:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 14:5">Luk 14:5</ref></char></note> Yecu openyogi ni, <char style="wj">“Anga ikinwu ma ka tye ki romo acel ce romo meno opoto i bur i ceng Cabit, en pe bimako ywayo kelo woko kamaleng?</char> <verse eid="MAT 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 12:12" /><char style="wj">Dano pe pire tek tutwal kato pi romo? Pimeno Cik ye ni myero kitim gin maber i ceng Cabit.”</char> <verse eid="MAT 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 12:13" />Ci owaco bot danoni ni, <char style="wj">“Rye badi.”</char> Danoni oryeyo bade, ci bade ocang woko maber odoko calo mukeneni. <verse eid="MAT 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 12:14" />Ento Luparicayo gukato woko ci gupiro lok ikom Yecu, kit macalo myero gineke kwede.<verse eid="MAT 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Latic ma ki yero</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 12:15" />Ka Yecu ongeyo lok man, oa woko ki kunu. Jo mapol gulube, ci en bene ocangogi woko ducu, <verse eid="MAT 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 12:16" />ocikogi ni pe myero gumi pire ongene. <verse eid="MAT 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 12:17" />Man otime wek lok mayam lanebi Icaya oloko ocobe kakare ni,<verse eid="MAT 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 12:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 42:1-4">Ica 42:1-4</ref>
      </char>
    </note> “Nen, latica ma ayero ma amaro,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 12:18">ma cwinya yom ikome.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 12:18">Abiketo Cwiny Maleng ikome,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 12:18">en bitucu ngolo kop atir bot Lurok.<verse eid="MAT 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 12:19" />Pe bidaa, pe bene bidange matek,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 12:19">ngat mo pe biwinyo dwone i wanga yoo;<verse eid="MAT 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 12:20" />pe bituru lagada ma okak,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 12:20">dok pe bineko mac tara ma lyel nio wang ma en omiyo ngolo kop atir oloyo loc;<verse eid="MAT 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 12:21" />ento Lurok bigeno gin maber pi nyinge.”<verse eid="MAT 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yecu ki Beeljebul</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:20-30">Mar 3:20-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:14-23">Luk 11:14-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 12:22" />Ci kikelo bote latowang mo matye ki cen, ma pe loko, ci Yecu ocange. Cutcut latelebeoto otugi lok dok oneno piny bene. <verse eid="MAT 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 12:23" />Jo ducu ma onongo gitye kenyo guuru matek kun giwaco ni, “Man twero bedo Lakwar Daudi?” <verse eid="MAT 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 12:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 9:34">Mat 9:34</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:25">10:25</ref></char></note> Ento Luparicayo guwinyo ci guwaco ni, “Dano ni ryemo cen pi twero pa beeljebul, ma en aye ladit pa cen.” <verse eid="MAT 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 12:25" />Ka Yecu ongeyo tamgi, ci owaco botgi ni. <char style="wj">“Ka ker iye opoke aryo, ker meno lobone bale woko, ki taun bene nyo ot ka opoke iye aryo pe twero cung.</char> <verse eid="MAT 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 12:26" /><char style="wj">Kace Catan ryemo Catan, nongo opoke i dul aryo ikome kekene; ci kere dong bicung ningning?</char> <verse eid="MAT 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 12:27" /><char style="wj">Ka an aryemo cen ki twero pa Beeljebul, ci lupwonyewu kono giryemo cen ki twero pa anga? Pimeno gin aye gibibedo lungolkopwu.</char> <verse eid="MAT 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 12:28" /><char style="wj">Ento kace an aryemo cen i twero pa Cwiny pa Lubanga, ci dong nen ni ker pa Lubanga dong obino woko botwu.</char> <verse eid="MAT 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 12:29" /><char style="wj">Dano mo twero donyo i ot pa ngat ma kome tek ningning, ci cako yako jamine ducu, ka pe kong en otweyo laco meno ma kome teki woko? Ka lacen dong cako yako ode</char>. <verse eid="MAT 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 12:30" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 9:40">Mar 9:40</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Ngat ma pe tung bota, meno nongo en lakwora, dok ngat ma pe nywako kacel kweda ka coko, nongo keto mere aketa.</char> <verse eid="MAT 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 12:31" /><char style="wj">Pimeno awaciwu ni, bal ducu ma dano timo, ki lok ducu ma giyeto kwede Lubanga, kibiwekone woko, ento bal me yet ma kiyeto ki Cwiny Maleng pe kibiwekone matwal.</char> <verse eid="MAT 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 12:32" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:32: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 12:10">Luk 12:10</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Dok dano ma loko lok marac ikom Wod pa dano kibiweko bale; ento ngat ma loko lok marac ikom Cwiny Maleng pe kibiweko bale, kadi ikare man nyo ikare mabino anyim.</char><verse eid="MAT 12:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kingeyo yat ki nyige</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:43-45">Luk 6:43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 12:33" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:33: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 7:20">Mat 7:20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:44">Luk 6:44</ref></char>
    </note> <char style="wj">Myero wunge ni yat maber nyako nyige mabeco, ki yat marac nyako nyige maracu; pien yat ki ngeyo ikom nyige.</char> <verse eid="MAT 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 12:34" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:34: a </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:7">Mat 3:7</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 23:33">23:33</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:7">Luk 3:7</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">b </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 15:18">Mat 15:18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:45">Luk 6:45</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Wun lutino ororo, wutwero loko lok maber ningning, ma kun wun jo maracu? Pien lok ma ogure i cwiny dano, en aye dog bene loko.</char> <verse eid="MAT 12:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 12:35" /><char style="wj">Dano maber kwanyo gin maber ki ikin jamine mabeco ma en okano, dano marac kwanyo gin marac ki i gin maracu ma en okano.</char> <verse eid="MAT 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 12:36" /><char style="wj">Atitiwu ni, lok ducu me carocaro ma dano giwaco ma pe gigwoke iye ni, kibipidogi pire inino me ngolo kop.</char> <verse eid="MAT 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 12:37" /><char style="wj">Pien lok ma iloko aye bimiyo iloyo kop, ki dok bene lok ma iloko aye bimiyo kingolo kop loyi.”</char><verse eid="MAT 12:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kipenyo Yecu pi lanyut</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:11-12">Mar 8:11-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:29-32">Luk 11:29-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 12:38" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:38: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 16:1">Mat 16:1</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:11">Mar 8:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:16">Luk 11:16</ref></char>
    </note> Jo mogo ikin Lupwonycik ki Luparicayo guwaco bot Yecu ni, “Lapwony, wamito neno lanyut mo ma a ki boti.” <verse eid="MAT 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 12:39" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:39: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 16:4">Mat 16:4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:12">Mar 8:12</ref></char></note> Ento Yecu odok iye owaco botgi ni, <char style="wj">“Yalwak pa jo maracu ki lutim abor giyenyo lanyut, ento pe kibimiyo botgi lanyut mo kono lanyut pa lanebi Yona keken.</char> <verse eid="MAT 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 12:40" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:40: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JON 1:17">Yon 1:17</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Pien kit macalo Yona yam otyeko nino adek, dyeceng ki dyewor, irec, kitmeno Wod pa dano bene bityeko nino adek, dyeceng ki dyewor ibur lyel.</char> <verse eid="MAT 12:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 12:41" /><char style="wj">Jo Nineve bicung kacel ki yalwak me kare man, ikare me ngolo kop, ci miyo kop loyogi; pien gin yam gungut pi lok ma Yona onongo otito ento nen, gin madit makato Yona tye kany.</char> <verse eid="MAT 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 12:42" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:42: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 10:10">1 Luk 10:10</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 9:1-12">2 Tek 9:1-12</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Rwot ma dako matye tung kupiny bicung kacel ki yalwak me kare man, ikare me ngolo kop, ci miyo kop loyogi; pien en oa ki i agiki lobo obino kawinyo ryeko pa Solomon, ento nen, gin madit makato Solomon tye kany.”</char><verse eid="MAT 12:42" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dwogo pa cen ikom dano</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:24-26">Luk 11:24-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 12:43" />
    <char style="wj">“Ka cen dong oa woko ki ikom dano mo, ci cito wire i tim kama pii peke iye kun yenyo kama ebiywe iye; ento pe nongo kabedo mo kadi ki acel.</char> <verse eid="MAT 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 12:44" /><char style="wj">Ci cako waco ni, ‘Abidok gira i oda kama yam aa ki iye ni.’ Ka obino, ce nongo ode tye nono, kiyweyo woko, dok kiyubu woko maber,</char> <verse eid="MAT 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 12:45" /><char style="wj">ka dong cito kelo cen mukene abiro ma giracu gikate woko, ci gidonyo gibedo i ode ni. Lacen danoni bibedo marac makato kit ma onongo yam obedo kwede con. Bibedo kitmeno bene bot yalwak pa jo maracu me kare man.”</char><verse eid="MAT 12:45" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Min Yecu ki omegi Yecu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:31-35">Mar 3:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:19-21">Luk 8:19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 12:46" />Ikare ma Yecu pud tye kalok bot lwak, nen, mine kacel ki omegine onongo gucung woko, kun guwaco ni gimito lok ki Yecu. <verse eid="MAT 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 12:47" />Ci dano mo acel owace ni, “Nen, meni ki omegini gitye gucung woko gimito lok kwedi.” <verse eid="MAT 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 12:48" />Ento Yecu odok iye ki danoni ni, <char style="wj">“Maa anga? Ki omegina kono angagi?”</char> <verse eid="MAT 12:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 12:49" />Ka oryeyo bade tung bot lupwonyene, ci owaco botgi ni, <char style="wj">“Wunen, maa ki omegina aye jo matye kany!</char> <verse eid="MAT 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 12:50" /><char style="wj">Pien dano ma tiyo gin ma Wora matye i polo mito, meno aye omera ki lamera, ki maa bene.”</char><verse eid="MAT 12:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MAT 13" />
  <para style="s1">Carolok ikom lacokodi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:1-9">Mar 4:1-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:4-8">Luk 8:4-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 13:1" />Inino meno aceli Yecu oa woko ki i ot, ci ocito obedo i dog nam. <verse eid="MAT 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 13:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 5:1-3">Luk 5:1-3</ref></char></note> Lwak madwong tutwal gucoke bote, omiyo en odonyo i yeya ci obedo iye, lwak ducu gucung iwi tura. <verse eid="MAT 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 13:3" />Obedo kaloko botgi lok mapol i carolok, kun waco ni, <char style="wj">“Lacokodi ocito kacoyo kodi.</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 13:4" /><char style="wj">Ka kun coyo, kodi mogo okir opoto i yoo, winyo gubino gucamo woko.</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 13:5" /><char style="wj">Kodi mukene okir ikom pata kama ngom tye iye manok. Cutcut gutwi, kama ngome pe tut.</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 13:6" /><char style="wj">Ento ma ceng oryeny, owangogi gutwo woko, pien onongo lwitgi peke.</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 13:7" /><char style="wj">Kodi mukene okir ikin okutu, okutu olot odiyogi woko.</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 13:8" /><char style="wj">Kodi mukene okir i ngom maber, ci gunyako nyiggi, mogo miya acel, mukene pyere abicel, ki mogo pyere adek.</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 13:9" /><char style="wj">Ngat matye ki it me winyone owiny.”</char><verse eid="MAT 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pwony ikom carolok</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:10-12">Mar 4:10-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:9-10">Luk 8:9-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 13:10" />Lacen lupwonye gubino bot Yecu gupenye ni, “Pingo iloko kwedgi icarolok?” <verse eid="MAT 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 13:11" />En odok iye botgi ni, <char style="wj">“Wun kimiyo botwu mot me ngeyo mung me ker me polo, ento bot jo mukene pe kimiyo botgi.</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 13:12" /><char style="wj">Pien ngat matye ki gin mo kibimiyo doki makato, ci en bibedo ki jami mabup; ento ngat ma peke ki gin mo, kadi gin ma en tye kwede kibikwanyo woko ki bote.</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 13:13" /><char style="wj">Man aye gin ma omiyo aloko kwedgi i carolok, pien kadi neno piny pe gineno, kadi winyo lok bene pe giwinyo, dok bene pe giniang.</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 13:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 6:9">Ica 6:9</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 6:10">10</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Piman lok pa Lubanga mayam lanebi Icaya otito ocobe kakare ikomgi ni,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:14">
    <char style="wj">‘Winyone mere wubiwinyo, ento pe wubiniang teloke;</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:14">
    <char style="wj">nenone wubineno, ento pe wubingeyo gin matye.</char><verse eid="MAT 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 13:15" />
    <char style="wj">Pien jo me rok man cwinygi dong odoko nwang,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:15">
    <char style="wj">ki itgi bene dong oding woko kawinyo lok,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:15">
    <char style="wj">dok gumiyo wanggi woko,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:15">
    <char style="wj">wek pe gunen ki wanggi,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:15">
    <char style="wj">pe bene guwiny ki itgi,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:15">
    <char style="wj">pe bene guniang iye ki cwinygi</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:15">
    <char style="wj">wek pe guloke gudwog bota acang gi.’</char><verse eid="MAT 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 13:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 10:23">Luk 10:23</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 10:24">24</ref></char>
    </note> <char style="wj">Ento wun wangwu tye kigum, pien gineno piny, itwu bene tye kigum, pien giwinyo lok.</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 13:17" /><char style="wj">Adada, awaco botwu ni, lunebi mapol ki jo ma kitgi atir yam guparo pi neno gin ma wun wuneno ni, ento pe guneno, ki me winyo gin ma wuwinyo, ento pe guwinyo.</char><verse eid="MAT 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yecu ogonyo te carolok ikom lacokodi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:13-20">Mar 4:13-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:11-15">Luk 8:11-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 13:18" />
    <char style="wj">Kong dong wuwiny carolok ikom lacokodi.</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 13:19" /><char style="wj">Ka dano mo owinyo lok me ker pa Lubanga ce pe oniang iye, Larac bino ci mayo kodi ma kicoyo i cwinyeni woko; man aye kodi ma onongo kicoyo okir i yoo.</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 13:20" /><char style="wj">Dong kodi ma kicoyo ikom pata tye kit man, en aye dano ma winyo lok ci oyotoyot mako lok meno ki yomcwiny;</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 13:21" /><char style="wj">ento pe nongo tye ki lwite i iye, rii pi kare manok. Ka can obino, nyo yelo dano pi lok man, cutcut danoni tugi poto woko.</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 13:22" /><char style="wj">Dong kodi ma kicoyo okir ikin okutu, man aye dano ma winyo lok, ento paro lok me lobo man, ki maro lonyo, diyo lok woko, ci miyo pe nyak.</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 13:23" /><char style="wj">Ento kodi ma kicoyo okir i ngom maber ni, aye dano ma winyo lok dok niang iye maber; en i ada cako nyako nyige dok cek, mukene miya acel, ki mukene pyere abicel, ki mukene pyere adek.”</char><verse eid="MAT 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kaldyang ma kicoyo ikin kal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 13:24" />Yecu dok obolo botgi carolok mukene kun waco ni, <char style="wj">“Ker me polo rom ki dano mo ma ocoyo kodi mabeco i potone.</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 13:25" /><char style="wj">Ento ikare ma dano dong gubutu woko, lakwore obino ci ocoyo kaldyang ikin kal, ka ocito gire woko.</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 13:26" /><char style="wj">Ikare ma ginapitanu otwi odongo, kal ongok, ci kaldyang bene ocako nen.</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 13:27" /><char style="wj">Lutic pa won ot gucito bot won ot gupenye ni, ‘Ladit, yam onongo pe icoyo kodi mabeco keken i potoni? Pingo dok waneno kaldyang tye iye?’</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 13:28" /><char style="wj">Won ot odok iye owacigi ni, ‘Lakwor aye ma otimo man.’ Ci lutic gupenye ni, ‘Imito ni wacit waciput kaldyang magi woko?’</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 13:29" /><char style="wj">Ento won ot odok iye owaco ni, ‘Pe, ka wudoyo kaldyang magi woko, miyo kare mukene wubiputu kal mukeneni woko bene kacel ki kaldyang.</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 13:30" /><char style="wj">Kong wuwek kaldyang ki kal ducu gudong kacel nio wa ikare me kac; ikare me kac abiciko lutic ni kong wucok kaldyang woko mukwongo ci wutwegi woko i dul ki dul me awanga, ento kal aye wukaa wuket i derona.’”</char><verse eid="MAT 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Carolok ikom kodi karadali</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:30-32">Mar 4:30-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:18-19">Luk 13:18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 13:31" />Dok obolo botgi carolok mukene, kun waco ni, <char style="wj">“Ker me polo rom ki kodi karadali, ma dano okwanyo ci ocoyo i potone.</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 13:32" /><char style="wj">Kodi karadalini dok tidi tutwal ki ikin kodi ducu, ento ka odongo doko yat madit makato yat mukene ducu. Doko yat mo madit mamiyo winyo me polo gibino gigero odigi i jange.”</char><verse eid="MAT 13:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Carolok ikom tobi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:20-21">Luk 13:20-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 13:33" />Yecu obolo botgi dok carolok mukene ni, <char style="wj">“Ker me polo rom ki tobi ma dako mo okwanyo orubu ki moko mugati maromo adita adek, nio ka moko ducu oyenyo, okwot.”</char><verse eid="MAT 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kit ma Yecu onongo maro tic kwede ki carolok</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:33-34">Mar 4:33-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 13:34" />Lok magi ducu Yecu oloko bot lwak i carolok. I adane en pe obedo kalok kwedgi lok mo labongo bolo carolok, <verse eid="MAT 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 13:35" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:35: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 78:2">Jab 78:2</ref></char></note> wek omii lok mayam lanebi oloko ocobe kakare ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:35">“Abiwaco lok i carolok,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:35">abitito lok mayam okane woko cake wa i acaki piny.”<verse eid="MAT 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yecu ogonyo carolok ikom kaldyang ma kicoyo ikin kal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 13:36" />Ka Yecu oweko lwak ci ocito odonyo i ot, lupwonyene gubino bote guwace ni, “Kong itit botwa carolok ikom kaldyang ma i poto.” <verse eid="MAT 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 13:37" />Yecu odok iye ni, <char style="wj">“Ngat ma ocoyo kodi mabeconi aye Wod pa dano;</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 13:38" /><char style="wj">poto aye lobo man, dok kodi mabeconi teloke ni lutino me ker pa Lubanga, kaldyang aye lutino pa Larac.</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 13:39" /><char style="wj">Lakwor ma ocoyogi aye Catan; kac, meno agiki piny, lukac aye lumalaika.</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 13:40" /><char style="wj">Kit macalo kicoko kwede kaldyang kiwango woko i mac, bibedo bene kitmeno i agiki piny.</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 13:41" /><char style="wj">Wod pa dano bioro lumalaikane, gibicoko ki itekere gin ducu mamiyo dano gipoto ibal, kacel ki jo ducu ma gin lutim maracu,</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 13:42" /><char style="wj">ci bologi woko i ruk mac, kama dano bibedo iye kakoko kun gikayo lakgi.</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 13:43" /><char style="wj">Ikare meno jo ma kitgi atir biryeny calo ceng i ker pa Wongi. Ngat ma ite tye omyero owiny.</char><verse eid="MAT 13:43" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lonyo ma kikano i poto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 13:44" />
    <char style="wj">Ker me polo rom ki lonyo ma kikano i poto, ma dano onongo ci dok oyiko woko. Dong pi yomcwiny omiyo en ocito ocato jami ducu ma onongo en tye kwede, ci owilo poto meno woko.</char><verse eid="MAT 13:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tiko ma wele malo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 13:45" />
    <char style="wj">Dok ker me polo rom ki lacatwil ma onongo yam obedo kayenyo tiko mabeco me wel.</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 13:46" /><char style="wj">Ikare madong onongo tiko mo acel me wel, ocito ocato jami ducu ma onongo en tye kwede, ci owilo tiko meno woko.</char><verse eid="MAT 13:46" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Obwo ma kiciko i nam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 13:47" />
    <char style="wj">Dok ker me polo rom ki obwo ma kiciko i nam ci omako kit kwayi recgu ducu.</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 13:48" /><char style="wj">Ikare madong gupong woko ki rec, dano guywayo gukelo woko iwi tura, gucako bedo piny guyero mabecone guketo i aduku, ki maracune gubolo woko.</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 13:49" /><char style="wj">Bibedo kitmeno i agiki piny. Lumalaika gin bibino ci gin gipoko jo maracu woko ki ikom jo ma kitgi atir,</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 13:50" /><char style="wj">kibibologi woko i ruk mac, kama dano gibikok kun gikayo lakgi.”</char><verse eid="MAT 13:50" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lonyo manyen ki macon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 13:51" />Cutcut Yecu openyogi ni, <char style="wj">“Dong wuniang i lok man ducu?” Gudoke iye ni, “Eyo.”</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 13:52" /><char style="wj">Yecu dok owaco botgi ni, “Pimeno Lapwonycik mo ma kipwonyo pi ker me polo rom ki dano mo ma won ot, ma kwanyo gin manyen ki macon ki ikom lonyone.”</char><verse eid="MAT 13:52" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kikwero Yecu i Najaret</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:1-6">Mar 6:1-6</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:16-30">Luk 4:16-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 13:53" />Ikare ma Yecu dong otyeko loko carolok magi, oa woko ki kunu, <verse eid="MAT 13:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 13:54" />ci odwogo i lobo tugi. Opwonyogi i kacokegi, omiyo guuru matek kun giwaco ni, “Dano ni onongo ryeko man ki kwene? Dok tic matego macalo magi ma en tiyogu oa ki kwene? <verse eid="MAT 13:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 13:55" />Man pe latin pa lapac? Mine pe Maliam? Ki omegine pe Yakobo ki Yucepu ki Cimon ka Juda? <verse eid="MAT 13:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 13:56" />Lumegine ducu pe gitye kacel kwedwa kany? Ci danoni onongo kit man ducu ki kwene?” <verse eid="MAT 13:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 13:57" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:57: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 4:44">Jon 4:44</ref></char></note> Cutcut cwinygi ocako kwere woko. Ento Yecu owaco botgi ni, <char style="wj">“Lanebi kiketo deyo ikome, ento pe kiketo deyo ikome i lobo tugi ki i ode.”</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 13:58" />Pe otiyo tic matego mapol kunu, pien onongo niyegi peke.<verse eid="MAT 13:58" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MAT 14" />
  <para style="s1">To pa Jon Labatija</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:14-29">Mar 6:14-29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7-9">Luk 9:7-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 14:1" />Ikare meno Kerode ma laloc madit owinyo pi yweka pa Yecu; <verse eid="MAT 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 14:2" />ma omiyo owaco bot lutice ni, “Man aye Jon Labatija. Lubanga ocere woko ki ikin jo ma oto, en aye ma omiyo lakit teko macalo meno tye katic ikome ni.”<verse eid="MAT 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 14:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 3:19">Luk 3:19</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 3:20">20</ref></char>
    </note> Pien onongo yam Kerode omako Jon, otweyo ci oketo ibuc pi Kerodia, ciomine, dako pa Pilipo. <verse eid="MAT 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 14:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 18:16">Lev 18:16</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 20:21">20:21</ref></char></note> Pien Jon onongo owaco bote ni, “Cik pe oye ni ibed ki ciomeru.” <verse eid="MAT 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 14:5" />Kadi bed Kerode onongo mito neke woko, ento olworo lwak, pien lwak onongo giworo Jon ni en lanebi. <verse eid="MAT 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 14:6" />Ento ka kare me po pi nywalo Kerode oromo, ci nya pa Kerodia omyelo inyim welo ci oyomo cwiny Kerode mada. <verse eid="MAT 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 14:7" />Ma omiyo Kerode ocike kun kwonge akwonga bot nyako meno ni ebimiye gin ducu ma en bipenyo pire. <verse eid="MAT 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 14:8" />Mine otite lok roro, omiyo nyakonu ocito olego rwot ni, “Amito imiya wi Jon Labatija i wee kombedi.” <verse eid="MAT 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 14:9" />Ci rwot Kerode okumu matek; ento pi kwong ma en okwongo ki pi welone omiyo ociko ni omyero kimiye. <verse eid="MAT 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 14:10" />Ci ooro dano ocito oweko kingolo ngut Jon woko ki ibuc, <verse eid="MAT 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 14:11" />ci kiketo wiye i wee kikelo kimiyo bot nyako meno, ka nyakonu otero bot mine. <verse eid="MAT 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 14:12" />Lacen lupwonye pa Jon gubino gutingo kome guyiko woko ilyel; ka gucito gutito pire bot Yecu bene.<verse eid="MAT 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yecu omiyo cam ki jo alip abic</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Mar 6:30-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luk 9:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Jon 6:1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 14:13" />Ka Yecu owinyo lok man, ci oa woko ki kunu, owoto ki yeya ocito kakene ikabedo ma dano pe iye. Ento ka lwak guwinyo pire, ci gulube kun giwoto ki tyen gi ma gia ki i taun mapatpat. <verse eid="MAT 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 14:14" />Ka Yecu okato iwi tura, oneno lwak madwong; kica omake ikomgi, ci ocango lutwo ma kikelo bote. <verse eid="MAT 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 14:15" />Ka oo otyeno, ci lupwonyene gubino bote, guwace ni, “Man kabedo kama dano peke iye, cawa bene dong okato woko; cwal lwak gucit ikin paco macokcok, wek guwil cam pirgi ken gi.” <verse eid="MAT 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 14:16" />Yecu odok iye ni, <char style="wj">“Pe omyero gucit; ento wun wumii botgi cam gucam.”</char> <verse eid="MAT 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 14:17" />Guwace ni, “Watye kany ki mugati abic ki rec aryo.” <verse eid="MAT 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 14:18" />Yecu owaco ni, <char style="wj">“Wukel mugati ki rec aryo ni bota kany.”</char> <verse eid="MAT 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 14:19" />Ka ociko lwak ni gubed piny ikom lum alita. Yecu okwanyo mugati abic ki rec aryo, oneno malo i polo, olego gum, obaro i mugati omiyo ki lupwonyene, ci lupwonyene gumiyo bot lwak. <verse eid="MAT 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 14:20" />Gin ducu gucamo guyeng. Kicoko ngide cam ma odong, opongo aduku apar wiye aryo. <verse eid="MAT 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 14:21" />Jo ma gucamo cam meno onongo giromo co alip abic, ma nongo pe kikwano iye mon ki lutino.<verse eid="MAT 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yecu owoto iwi nam ki tyene</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:45-52">Mar 6:45-52</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:16-21">Jon 6:16-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 14:22" />Cutcut Yecu ociko lupwonyene ni gudony i yeya, gukwong nyime me cito loka ca, kun nongo en pud eciko lwak. <verse eid="MAT 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 14:23" />Lacen madong ociko lwak, ci ocito iwi got ka lega kakene. Ikare ma piny dong oyutu, onongo en tye kunu kene. <verse eid="MAT 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 14:24" />Yeya onongo dong okato woko mairo madwong nia ki iwi tura, kun pii tye ka twago yeya; pien onongo yamo kodo bino ki inyimgi. <verse eid="MAT 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 14:25" />I kine okokgweno, Yecu oa obino botgi kun woto iwi nam ki tyene. <verse eid="MAT 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 14:26" />Ento ka lupwonyene gunene kun woto iwi nam ki tyene, tipu komgi oto woko lirut, kun giwaco ni, “Man gemo!” Ci gudange matek pi lworo. <verse eid="MAT 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 14:27" />Ento oyotoyot Yecu oloko kwedgi kun waco ni, <char style="wj">“Wudii cwinywu, meno an; gwok wulwor.”</char> <verse eid="MAT 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 14:28" />Ci Petero ogamo doge owaco ni, “Rwot, ka meno aye in, ci wek abin boti kunu kun awoto ki iwi pii.” <verse eid="MAT 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 14:29" />Yecu odoke iye ni, <char style="wj">“Bin.”</char> Ci Petero oa woko ki i yeya, owoto ki iwi pii obino bot Yecu. <verse eid="MAT 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 14:30" />Ento ka oneno yamo tye ka kodo, ocako doko lwor, oweko ocako lwiny woko i pii, ci odange matek ni, “Rwot, lara do!” <verse eid="MAT 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 14:31" />Cutcut Yecu ocwalo cinge ci omake, kun waco ni, <char style="wj">“In dano ma niyeni nok, pingo kono ibedo ki akalakala?”</char> <verse eid="MAT 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 14:32" />Ka dong gudonyo i yeya, ci yamo ocako pye mot. <verse eid="MAT 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 14:33" />Jo ducu ma onongo gitye i yeya gucako woro Yecu kun giwaco ni, “Adada, in giri i Wod pa Lubanga.”<verse eid="MAT 14:33" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yecu ocango lutwo i Genecaret</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:53-56">Mar 6:53-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 14:34" />Ka dong gukato loka ca, ci gukato iwi tura i lobo Genecaret. <verse eid="MAT 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 14:35" />Ka jo ma ikabedo meno dong gungeye, ci gucwalo lok ikabedo ducu macokcok ki kunu, ci dano gukelo bote jo ducu mayam onongo komgi lit. <verse eid="MAT 14:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 14:36" />Gubako doggi bote ni myero oye gugud dog bongone keken; jo ducu ma gugudo dog bongone gucang woko maber.<verse eid="MAT 14:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MAT 15" />
  <para style="s1">Kit tekwaro pa ludongo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 7:1-13">Mar 7:1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 15:1" />Luparicayo ki Lupwonycik gua ki Jerucalem gubino bot Yecu, ci gupenye ni, <verse eid="MAT 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 15:2" />“Pingo lupwonyeni pe gilubu tekwaro pa ludongo? Pien gin camo cam ma pe gulwoko cinggi.” <verse eid="MAT 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 15:3" />Yecu odok iye botgi ni, <char style="wj">“Pingo wun kono pe wulubu Cik pa Lubanga pi lubu kit me tekwarowu?</char> <verse eid="MAT 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 15:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:4: a </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:12">Nia 20:12</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:16">Nwo 5:16</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">b </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 21:17">Nia 21:17</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 20:9">Lev 20:9</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Pien Lubanga yam ociko ni, ‘Wor woru ki meni’, ka dok ni, ‘Ngat ma loko lok marac ikom wone nyo ikom mine myero kinek woko aneka.’</char> <verse eid="MAT 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 15:5" /><char style="wj">Ento wun wuwaco ni ka dano mo owaco bot wone nyo bot mine ni, ‘Gin ma kono akonyi kwede dong amiyo woko bot Lubanga,’</char> <verse eid="MAT 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 15:6" /><char style="wj">en pe myero owor wone. Kitmeno pi lubu kit me tekwarowu, omiyo lok pa Lubanga dong odoko yogoyogo.</char> <verse eid="MAT 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 15:7" /><char style="wj">Wun lugoba! Lanebi Icaya yam oloko ikomwu kakare ikare ma en owaco ni:</char> <verse eid="MAT 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 15:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 29:13">Ica 29:13</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">‘Rok man kara giwora ki doggi nono,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 15:8">
    <char style="wj">ento cwinygi pe ikoma wa ki acel;</char><verse eid="MAT 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 15:9" />
    <char style="wj">giwora nono, pwony ma gipwonyo obedo pwony ma mako cik pa dano.’”</char><verse eid="MAT 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Gin ma balo dano</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 7:14-23">Mar 7:14-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 15:10" />Yecu olwongo lwak bote, ci owaco botgi ni, <char style="wj">“Wuwiny loka, ci wuniang iye maber.</char> <verse eid="MAT 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 15:11" /><char style="wj">Pe gin ma donyo i dog dano aye balo dano, ento kono gin ma a ki i dog aye balo dano.”</char> <verse eid="MAT 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 15:12" />Ci lupwonyene gubino guwaco ni, “Ingeyo ni Luparicayo cwinygi ocwer tutwal ikare ma guwinyo lok ma in iwaco?” <verse eid="MAT 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 15:13" />Yecu odok iye ni, <char style="wj">“Kit ginapita ducu ma Wora matye i polo pe opito kibiputu woko ki lwite.</char> <verse eid="MAT 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 15:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 6:39">Luk 6:39</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Wek gubedi; meno gin lutowang ma gipeyo lutowang wadigi. Kace latowang peyo latowang lawote, ci gin aryo ducu gibipoto woko ibur.”</char> <verse eid="MAT 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 15:15" />Ento Petero owaco ni, “Gony telok me carolok man botwa.” <verse eid="MAT 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 15:16" />Ci Yecu openyogi ni, <char style="wj">“Wun kara peya wuniang bene?</char> <verse eid="MAT 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 15:17" /><char style="wj">Pe wuneno ni gin ma donyo i dog dano kato cito i ic, kitmeno a ki kunu kato woko?</char> <verse eid="MAT 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 15:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:34">Mat 12:34</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Ento gin ma kati ki i dog a ki i cwiny dano, man aye balo dano.</char> <verse eid="MAT 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 15:19" /><char style="wj">Pien gin ma a ki i cwiny dano aye tam maracu, nek, abor, cot, kwalo kwo, bedo caden me goba ki yet.</char> <verse eid="MAT 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 15:20" /><char style="wj">Magi aye gin ma balo dano; ento camo cam ma pe kilwoko cing pe balo dano mo.”</char><verse eid="MAT 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Niye pa dako me Kanaan</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 7:24-30">Mar 7:24-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 15:21" />Yecu oa ki kunu, ocito wa i lobo matye cok ki Turo ki Cidon. <verse eid="MAT 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 15:22" />Ci nen, dako mo ma en Lakanan ma oa ki i lobo meno obino kun dange adanga ni, “Ai Rwot, Lakwar Daudi tima kica do; nyara tye ki cen, tye kaune marac tutwal.” <verse eid="MAT 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 15:23" />Ento Yecu pe ogamo dog dakonu kadi ki acel. Ma omiyo lupwonyene gubino gubako doggi bote ni, “Ryem dako ni ocit woko cen, pien tye ka dange tung ingewa.” <verse eid="MAT 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 15:24" />Yecu odok iye ni, <char style="wj">“Yam kiora bot jo Icrael keken, pien gitye calo romi ma orwenyo.”</char> <verse eid="MAT 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 15:25" />Ento dakonu obino ogungo inyime, kun waco ni, “Rwot, konya.” <verse eid="MAT 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 15:26" />Ci Yecu odok iye ni, <char style="wj">“Pe ber me kwanyo cam pa lutino me bolone woko bot gwogi.”</char> <verse eid="MAT 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 15:27" />Dakonu odok iye ni, “Rwoda, meno iwaco kakare. Kadi bed kitmeno lutino gwogi bene gin camo ngide cam ma poto ki iwi meja pa ladit do.” <verse eid="MAT 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 15:28" />Yecu ogamo doge owaco ni, <char style="wj">“In dakoni niyeni dit. Wek otime boti kit macalo i mito.”</char> Ci nyare otugi cang woko cut i cawa meno.<verse eid="MAT 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yecu ocango lutwo mapol</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 15:29" />Yecu oa ki kunu, omede ki wote, ongolo ki i dog nam Galilaya. Ocito oito iwi got ci obedo kunu. <verse eid="MAT 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 15:30" />Ci lwak dano gukelo bote luput ki lungolo, jo ma telebgi oto, ki lutowang, ki lutwo mukene mapol, gupyelogi piny katyen Yecu, ci en ocangogi. <verse eid="MAT 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 15:31" />Man omiyo lwak guuru tutwal ka guneno lutelebgi oto guloko, jo ma cinggi okwe gucang, jo matyen gi ongol guwoto, kadi wa lutowang bene guneno piny; gupako Lubanga pa jo Icrael matek.<verse eid="MAT 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yecu omiyo cam ki jo alip angwen</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:1-10">Mar 8:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 15:32" />Yecu olwongo lupwonyene bote ci owaco botgi ni, <char style="wj">“Kica maka ikom lwak man, pien dong gubedo kweda kany pi nino adek, makun pe gitye ki cam mo. Pe amito ni acwalgi woko ki kec, miyo kec bwoyogi woko i yoo.”</char> <verse eid="MAT 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 15:33" />Ci lupwonyene gudoke iye ni, “Kara man wabinongo mugati kwene matwero romo lwak macalo man i tim kany?” <verse eid="MAT 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 15:34" />Yecu openyogi ni, <char style="wj">“Wutye ki mugati adi?”</char> Gugamo ni, “Abiro, ki rec mogo matinotino manok.” <verse eid="MAT 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 15:35" />Ociko lwak ni gubed piny i ngom, <verse eid="MAT 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 15:36" />ci omako mugati abiro ni ki rec bene, ka dong opwoyo Lubanga, obaro igi, ci omiyogi bot lupwonyene, ka lupwonyene gumiyo bot lwak. <verse eid="MAT 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 15:37" />Gin ducu gucamo guyeng; gucoko ngide cam ma oloyogi, oromo adita abiro ma opong. <verse eid="MAT 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 15:38" />Jo ma gucamo cam meno onongo giromo co alip angwen, ma pe kikwano iye mon ki lutino. <verse eid="MAT 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 15:39" />Lacen, ociko lwak, odonyo i yeya, ci ocito i lobo Magadan.<verse eid="MAT 15:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MAT 16" />
  <para style="s1">Luparicayo gulego lanyut</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:11-13">Mar 8:11-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:54-56">Luk 12:54-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 16:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 12:38">Mat 12:38</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:16">Luk 11:16</ref></char>
    </note> Luparicayo ki Lucadukayo gubino, gubito Yecu ni onyut botgi lanyut ma a ki i polo. <verse eid="MAT 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 16:2" />Yecu ogamo doggi ni, <char style="wj">“Ka piny oyutu, wuwaco ni, ‘Piny bibedo maber; pien polo nen makwar.’</char> <verse eid="MAT 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 16:3" /><char style="wj">Dok i odiko wuwaco ni, ‘Tin kot bicwer madit, pien polo nen makwar, dok ocido woko licuc.’ Wungeyo poko kin gin manen i pol, ento pe wutwero poko lanyut me kare man.</char> <verse eid="MAT 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 16:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:39">Mat 12:39</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:29">Luk 11:29</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Yalwak pa jo maracu ma pe tike atir bot Lubanga, gin yenyo lanyut, ento pe kibimiyo botgi lanyut mo kono lanyut pa Yona keken.”</char> Ci oa woko ki botgi ocito kamukene.<verse eid="MAT 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tobi pa Luparicayo ki pa Lucadukayo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:14-21">Mar 8:14-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 16:5" />Ikare ma lupwonyene guo loka tungcel, onongo wigi owil woko me tero mugati mo. <verse eid="MAT 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 16:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 12:1">Luk 12:1</ref></char></note> Ci Yecu owaco botgi ni, <char style="wj">“Wugwoke ikom tobi pa Luparicayo ki pa Lucadukayo.”</char> <verse eid="MAT 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 16:7" />Gubedo ka laro lok ikin gi keken gi kun giwaco ni, “Pe wakelo mugati.” <verse eid="MAT 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 16:8" />Ka Yecu ongeyo, ci openyogi ni, <char style="wj">“Pingo wupenye kekenwu ni mugati peke, wun jo ma niyewu nok?</char> <verse eid="MAT 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 16:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 14:17-21">Mat 14:17-21</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Peya wuniang ce, nyo pe wupo pi mugati abic pi jo alip abici? Yam wucoko ngide opongo aduku adi?</char> <verse eid="MAT 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 16:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 15:34-38">Mat 15:34-38</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Nyo mugati abiro pi jo alip angwen, yam wucoko ngide opongo adita adi?</char> <verse eid="MAT 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 16:11" /><char style="wj">Pingo pe wuniang ni an pe aloko botwu lok ikom mugati kikome? Wugwoke ikom tobi pa Luparicayo ki pa Lucadukayo.”</char> <verse eid="MAT 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 16:12" />Lacen guniang maber ni, Yecu onongo pe oloko botgi me gwoke ikom tobi me mugati, ento ikom pwony pa Luparicayo ki pa Lucadukayo.<verse eid="MAT 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Petero otucu lok ikom Yecu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:27-30">Mar 8:27-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:18-21">Luk 9:18-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 16:13" />Ka Yecu dong oo i lobo macok ki Cecaria Pilipi, ci openyo lupwonyene ni, <char style="wj">“Dano mono giwaco ni Wod pa dano en anga?”</char> <verse eid="MAT 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 16:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 14:1">Mat 14:1</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 14:2">2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:14">Mar 6:14</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 6:15">15</ref></char></note> Gin owaco ni, “Jo mogo giwaco ni Jon Labatija, jo mukene giwaco ni Eliya, ki jo mogo giwaco ni Jeremia nyo ngat mo acel ikin lunebi.” <verse eid="MAT 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 16:15" />Ka dok openyogi ni, <char style="wj">“Wun kono wuwaco ni an anga?”</char> <verse eid="MAT 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 16:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 6:68">Jon 6:68</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 6:69">69</ref></char></note> Cimon Petero ogamo ni, “In i Kricito ma Lubanga oyero, Wod pa Lubanga makwo.” <verse eid="MAT 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 16:17" />Ci Yecu odoke iye ni, <char style="wj">“Itye ki gum, Cimon wod pa Yona! Pien dano adana aye pe onyuti lok man, ento Wora matye i polo aye onyuti.</char> <verse eid="MAT 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 16:18" /><char style="wj">Dong awaco ni in i Petero, ma teloke ni Pata, abimiyo lwak jo ma oye an gicung ikom pata man, teko me to pe bitwero loyone.</char> <verse eid="MAT 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 16:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 18:18">Mat 18:18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:23">Jon 20:23</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Abimini layab me ker me polo, dong gin ducu ma in itweyo iwi lobo man kibitweyo bene wa i polo, dok gin ducu ma igonyo iwi lobo man kibigonyo bene wa i polo.”</char> <verse eid="MAT 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 16:20" />Ci ocikogi matek tutwal ni pe gutit bot ngat mo ni en aye Kricito ma Lubanga oyero.<verse eid="MAT 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yecu otito pi tone</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:31-9:1">Mar 8:31—9:1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:22-27">Luk 9:22-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 16:21" />Cake ikare meno Yecu ocako nyutu bot lupwonyene ni myero ecit i Jerucalem, dok myero ecir can madwong ki bot ludongo ki ajwaki madito pa Lubanga ki Lupwonycik. Kibineke, ento inino me adeke kibicere woko. <verse eid="MAT 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 16:22" />Ci Petero otere cen, ocako juke, kun waco ni, “Lubanga myero pe oye ni kitimi kitmeno, Rwot! Gin macalo man pe otime ikomi wa ki acel.” <verse eid="MAT 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 16:23" />Ento Yecu oloke ci owaco bot Petero ni, <char style="wj">“Dok cen i ngeya, in Catan! Idoko ariya woko bota, pien tami pe lubu pa Lubanga, ento pa dano.”</char><verse eid="MAT 16:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 16:24" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:24: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 10:38">Mat 10:38</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:27">Luk 14:27</ref></char>
    </note> Yecu otito bot lupwonyene ni, <char style="wj">“Kace dano mo mito lubu kora, myero okwong kwere kekene, ka ocak tingo yatariyane, olub kwede kora.</char> <verse eid="MAT 16:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 16:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:39">Mat 10:39</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:33">Luk 17:33</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:25">Jon 12:25</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Pien dano ma mito laro kwone pire kene birwenyone arwenya, ento dano mo ma rwenyo kwone pira aye binongone.</char> <verse eid="MAT 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 16:26" /><char style="wj">Konyo dano ma olimo lobo ducu ki gin ango mono, kace kwone kikwanyo woko? Dano dok bimiyo kit gin ango maka kwone?</char> <verse eid="MAT 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 16:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:27: a </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 25:31">Mat 25:31</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">b </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 62:12">Jab 62:12</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 2:6">Rom 2:6</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Pien Wod pa dano bidwogo ki deyo pa Wone kacel ki lumalaikane, ci biculu dano acel acel kun lubu kit tic mayam dano ni otiyo.</char> <verse eid="MAT 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 16:28" /><char style="wj">Adada, awaco ki wun ni, tye jo mogo ma gucung kany ma pe gibibilo to wa ki acel, ni oo wang ma guneno Wod pa dano kabino i kere.”</char><verse eid="MAT 16:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="MAT 17" />
  <para style="s1">Kom Yecu oloke mapat</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:2-13">Mar 9:2-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:28-36">Luk 9:28-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 17:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">17:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2PE 1:17">2 Pet 1:17</ref>,<ref loc="2PE 1:18">18</ref></char>
    </note> Ka nino okato abicel, Yecu otero Petero, Yakobo ki Jon omine, oito kwedgi iwi got mabor i mung gin ken gi. <verse eid="MAT 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 17:2" />Kome ocako loke woko inyimgi, wange oryeny calo ceng, ginarukane odoko tar ma wil calo dero ceng. <verse eid="MAT 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 17:3" />Ci Moses ki Eliya gucako nen botgi, gubedo kalok ki Yecu. <verse eid="MAT 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 17:4" />Petero owaco bot Yecu ni, “Rwot, ber mada me bedo kany. Kace i mito, abiyubu bolo adek kany, acel meri, acel pa Moses, ki acel pa Eliya.” <verse eid="MAT 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 17:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:17">Mat 3:17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:11">Mar 1:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:22">Luk 3:22</ref></char></note> Ikare ma Petero pud tye kalok, nen, pol maryeny oumugi woko lipuk, ci dwon owinye ki i pol ma waco ni “Man aye Woda me amara; ma cwinya yom ikome, wuwinye.” <verse eid="MAT 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 17:6" />Ka lupwonyene guwinyo man, guryebe piny, lworo omakogi matek. <verse eid="MAT 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 17:7" />Yecu obino botgi ci ogudugi, kun waco botgi ni, <char style="wj">“Wua malo; pe wubed ki lworo.”</char> <verse eid="MAT 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 17:8" />Ikare ma guilo wanggi malo, pe guneno ngat mo ento kono Yecu keken.<verse eid="MAT 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 17:9" />Ikare madong gitye kalor piny ki iwi got, Yecu ocikogi ni, <char style="wj">“Pe wutit bot dano mo gin ma wuneno, nio wang ma Wod pa dano ocer ki ikin jo ma oto.”</char><verse eid="MAT 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 17:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">17:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAL 4:5">Mal 4:5</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Ci lupwonyene gupenye ni, “Pingo Lupwonycik giwaco ni, Eliya aye kong kwongo bino?” <verse eid="MAT 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 17:11" />Yecu odok iye ni, <char style="wj">“Eliya aye myero okwong bino, ka wek ocak dwoko jami ducu kakare.</char> <verse eid="MAT 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 17:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 11:14">Mat 11:14</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Ento atito botwu ni Eliya dong otyeko bino wacon, ento gin pe gungeye, gutimo gin ma gimito ikome. Wod pa dano bene bilimo can madwong ki i cinggi kitmeno.”</char> <verse eid="MAT 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 17:13" />Lacen lupwonyene guniang ni Yecu oloko botgi lok ikom Jon Labatija.<verse eid="MAT 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yecu ocango awobi matye ki cen</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:14-29">Mar 9:14-29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:37-43">Luk 9:37-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 17:14" />Ka dong guo bot lwak, ci dano mo oa obino bote ogungo inyime kun waco ni, <verse eid="MAT 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 17:15" />“Rwot, kica omaki ikom woda, pien two cimo omake marac tutwal miyo tyen mapol bole woko i mac, dok tyen mapol bole woko bene i pii. <verse eid="MAT 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 17:16" />Nakanen akele bot lupwonyeni, ento cangone oloyogi.” <verse eid="MAT 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 17:17" />Ci Yecu ogamo ni, <char style="wj">“Wun yalwak me kare man niyewu peke, kitwu bene dong obale woko, abibedo kwedwu nio wa awene? Wukel en bota kany.”</char> <verse eid="MAT 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 17:18" />Ci Yecu ogere iwi cen, ci cen oa woko ki ikome, cutcut awobi ni ocang woko i cawa meno. <verse eid="MAT 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 17:19" />Lacen lupwonyene gubino bot Yecu i mung gupenye ni, “Gin ango mugengowa ryemone?” <verse eid="MAT 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 17:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 21:21">Mat 21:21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:23">Mar 11:23</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 13:2">1 Kor 13:2</ref></char></note> Yecu odok iye botgi ni, <char style="wj">“Pien niyewu nok. Pien adada, awaco kiwun ni, kace niyewu obedo calo nyig kodi karadali, ci wubiwaco ki got man ni, ‘Dire i kabedo matye loka ca,’ kitmeno bidire; ci gin mo pe biloyowu.”</char> <verse eid="MAT 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 17:21" /><char style="wj">[Kit cen macalo man pe twero kati woko, kono ki lega ki rii kec keken.]</char><verse eid="MAT 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yecu dok otito pi tone</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:30-32">Mar 9:30-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:43-45">Luk 9:43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 17:22" />Ikare ma gucoke kacel i Galilaya, Yecu owaco botgi ni, <char style="wj">“Wod pa dano kibimiye woko i cing dano,</char> <verse eid="MAT 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 17:23" /><char style="wj">kibineke woko, ento bicer woko inino me adeke.”</char> Ci gin ducu gukumu matek tutwal.<verse eid="MAT 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Culu mucoro me Ot pa Lubanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 17:24" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">17:24: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 30:13-15">Nia 30:13-15</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 38:26">38:26</ref></char>
    </note> Ka guo i Kapernaum, jo ma jogo mucoro me Ot pa Lubanga gucito bot Petero ci gupenye ni, “Lapwonywu pe culu mucoro me Ot pa Lubanga?” <verse eid="MAT 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 17:25" />Petero ogamo ni, “Culu.” Ikare ma odwogo paco, Yecu oloko kwede mukwongo, kun penye ni, <char style="wj">“Itamo gin ango, Cimon? Luker me lobo man gijogo mucoro nyo luwalo ki bot anga? Gijogo ki bot anywali me lobogi nyo ki bot lurok mukene?”</char> <verse eid="MAT 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 17:26" />Ikare ma ogamo ni, “Ki bot lurok mukene,” Yecu owaco ni, <char style="wj">“Ka kitmeno ci anywali me lobogi ducu tye ki kuc.</char> <verse eid="MAT 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 17:27" /><char style="wj">Kadi bed kitmeno, pe wawang igi, cit i dog nam, bol goli i pii, yut rec mukwongo moko; ka iyabo doge ci ibinongo iye cekel. Kwany cekel meno imii botgi pira ki piri bene.”</char><verse eid="MAT 17:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="MAT 18" />
  <para style="s1">Anga maloyo ki dit</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:33-37">Mar 9:33-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:46-48">Luk 9:46-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 18:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 22:24">Luk 22:24</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Ikare meno lupwonye gubino bot Yecu, gupenye ni, “Anga mono ma rwome dit iker me polo?” <verse eid="MAT 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 18:2" />Ci Yecu olwongo latin mo bote, ocibo ocung ikin gi, <verse eid="MAT 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 18:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 10:15">Mar 10:15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:17">Luk 18:17</ref></char></note> ka owaco botgi ni, <char style="wj">“Adada awaco botwu ni, ka pe wuloke wudoko macalo lutino, pe wubidonyo iker me polo wa ki acel.</char> <verse eid="MAT 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 18:4" /><char style="wj">Ngat ma inen mwole woko kekene calo latin man, en aye maloyo ki dit iker me polo.</char> <verse eid="MAT 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 18:5" /><char style="wj">Ngat ma inen jolo latin mo acel macalo man inyinga, nongo ojolo an.</char><verse eid="MAT 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Gin mamiyo dano poto ibal</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:42-48">Mar 9:42-48</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:1-2">Luk 17:1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 18:6" />
    <char style="wj">Ento dano mamiyo ngat acel ma ikin jo magi matino ma guye an ni poto ibal, onongo bedo ber makato ducu ka kitweyo kidi rego madit ingute ci kibole kwede woko wa i nam matut.</char><verse eid="MAT 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 18:7" />
    <char style="wj">Lobo bineno can pi ariya mamiyo dano poto ibal. Pien gin mamiyo dano poto ibal pe bigenge, ento dano makelo gin mamiyo dano poto ibal bineno can!</char> <verse eid="MAT 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 18:8" /><char style="wj">Kace cingi nyo tyeni aye miyo i poto ibal, ci tong ingune ibol woko; twara ma idonyo i kwo ma cingi lakucel peke nyo laput, ber makato ma ibedo ki cingi aryo nyo tyeni ducu ci giboli kwede woko imac ma pe to.</char> <verse eid="MAT 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 18:9" /><char style="wj">Kace wangi aye miyo i poto ibal, ci kol woko; twara ma idonyo i kwo ki wangi lakucel, kato ma kono giboli ki wangi aryo ducu imac Geena.</char><verse eid="MAT 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Carolok ikom romo ma orwenyo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 15:3-7">Luk 15:3-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 18:10" />
    <char style="wj">Myero wunen maber ni pe wucayo ngat mo acel ki ikin jo magi matino ni; pien awaco ki wun ni, ki i polo lumalaikagi tye inyim Wora matye ipolo kare ducu.</char> <verse eid="MAT 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 18:11" /><char style="wj">[Pien Wod pa dano obino ka laro jo murwenyo.]</char><verse eid="MAT 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 18:12" />
    <char style="wj">Wutamo gin ango? Kace dano mo tye ki romine miya acel, ka acel ki ikin gi orwenyo woko, pe biweko romi pyere abongwen wiye abongwen ni iwi got kunu, ci cito kayenyo en ma orwenyo ni?</char> <verse eid="MAT 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 18:13" /><char style="wj">Ka ononge, adada awaco botwu ni, cwinye bibedo yom pire makato pi romi pyere abongwen wiye abongwen ma pe onongo gurwenyo ni.</char> <verse eid="MAT 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 18:14" /><char style="wj">Kitmeno Wora matye i polo bene pe mito ni ngat mo acel ikin jo magi matino ni myero orweny.</char><verse eid="MAT 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Omeru ka obalo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 17:3">Luk 17:3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 18:15" />
    <char style="wj">Kace lawoti obalo bal mo boti, cit bote inyute bale, ikin in ki en keken. Ka owinyo loki, ci dong inongo lawoti.</char> <verse eid="MAT 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 18:16" /><char style="wj">Ento ka pe owinyo loki, kwany dano acel nyo aryo mukene wucit kwedgi, wek lok ma caden aryo nyo adek giloko omok lok ducu.</char> <verse eid="MAT 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 18:17" /><char style="wj">Kace okwero winyo lokgi, tit pire bot lwak jo muye an; kace okwero winyo wa lok pa jo muye an, ci wek en dong obed boti calo ngat ma pe ngeyo Lubanga ki lajog mucoro.</char><verse eid="MAT 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tweyo ki gonyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 18:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 16:19">Mat 16:19</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:23">Jon 20:23</ref></char>
    </note> <char style="wj">Adada awaco botwu ni, kit gin mo ducu ma wutweyo iwi lobo man kibitweyo kadi wa i polo, dok gin mo ducu ma wubigonyo iwi lobo man kibigonyo bene wa i polo.</char> <verse eid="MAT 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 18:19" /><char style="wj">Dok bene awaco botwu ni, ka jo aryo ikinwu biye kacel lok ikom gin ma gilego, ci Wora matye ipolo bitimo pirgi.</char> <verse eid="MAT 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 18:20" /><char style="wj">Pien kama jo aryo nyo adek gucoke kacel inyinga, an bene nongo atye kunu ikin gi.”</char><verse eid="MAT 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Carolok ikom latic ma pe lakica</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 18:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:21: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 17:3">Luk 17:3</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 17:4">4</ref></char>
    </note> Petero oa obino bot Yecu ci openye ni, “Rwot lawota mono myero otim bal bota tyen adi, ka dok atim kica bote? Pud dok abitimo bote kica ka obalo tyen abiro?” <verse eid="MAT 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 18:22" />Yecu owaco ni, <char style="wj">“Pe awaco ni maromo tyen abiro, ento maromo tyen pyere abiro tyen abiro.</char><verse eid="MAT 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 18:23" />
    <char style="wj">Pimeno ker me polo gitwero poro ki rwot mo ma onongo yam omito yubo lok me banya ki lutice.</char> <verse eid="MAT 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 18:24" /><char style="wj">Ikare madong ocako kwano wel, ci kikelo ngat mo acel ma onongo tye ki banyane maromo milion mapol ata.</char> <verse eid="MAT 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 18:25" /><char style="wj">Kit macalo onongo dong pe twero culu banya meno, ci ladite ociko ni myero kicate woko i opii, en kacel ki dakone ki lutinone, ki kit jami ducu ma onongo en tye kwede, wek kicul ki banya meno.</char> <verse eid="MAT 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 18:26" /><char style="wj">Cutcut latic meno orumu conge piny inyime, kun bako doge bote ni, ‘Ladit, kong idi cwinyi ikoma do, ci abiculi gin ducu.’</char> <verse eid="MAT 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 18:27" /><char style="wj">Ci kica omako ladit ikom latice meno, ogonye woko dok oweko banyane bene ducu.</char> <verse eid="MAT 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 18:28" /><char style="wj">Ento latic meno ikare ma okato woko, orwate ki latic acel ikin lutic luwote ma onongo tye ki banyane me ciling mo manok adada, ci omake ki ngute kun peye ma waco ni, ‘Cul banyana!’</char> <verse eid="MAT 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 18:29" /><char style="wj">Ento latic lawote ni oryebe piny kun bako doge bote ni, ‘Kong idi cwinyi ikoma, abiculu banyani.’</char> <verse eid="MAT 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 18:30" /><char style="wj">Ento en okwero woko, ocito otweye i buc nio ka en biculu banyane.</char> <verse eid="MAT 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 18:31" /><char style="wj">Ikare ma lutic wadigi guneno gin ma otime ni, ci cwinygi ocwer matek tutwal, gucito gutito gin ducu ma otime bot laditgi.</char> <verse eid="MAT 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 18:32" /><char style="wj">Cutcut ladit olwonge ci owaco ni, ‘In latic marac! Aweki banya ca woko ducu pien onongo ilega kun ibako dogi bota;</char> <verse eid="MAT 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 18:33" /><char style="wj">onongo in bene pe kica twero maki ikom latic lawoti ni, kit macalo onongo kica omaka ikomi ni?’</char> <verse eid="MAT 18:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 18:34" /><char style="wj">Kiniga omako ladit tutwal oweko omiye bot acikari ma gin gwoko mabuc, nio ka oculu banyane ducu.</char> <verse eid="MAT 18:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 18:35" /><char style="wj">Wora matye ipolo bene bitimowu kitmeno, kace pe wutimo kica bot dano ki icwinywu ducu, dano acel acel ki lawote.”</char><verse eid="MAT 18:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="MAT 19" />
  <para style="s1">Lok ma Yecu opwonyo ikom keto nyom</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:1-12">Mar 10:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 16:18">Luk 16:18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 19:1" />Ikare ma Yecu dong otyeko loko lok magi, oa woko ki i Galilaya, ci obino ibut lobo me Judaya matye loka Jordan. <verse eid="MAT 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 19:2" />Lwak madwong gulube, ci ocangogi ki kunu.<verse eid="MAT 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 19:3" />Luparicayo mogo gubino bote, ci gucako omo cwinye kun gin penye ni, “Cik miyo twero ni laco myero oryem dakone pi tyen lok mo keken?” <verse eid="MAT 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 19:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 1:27">Aca 1:27</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 5:2">5:2</ref></char></note> Yecu odok iye ni, <char style="wj">“Pud peya wukwano lok ma waco ni, cake i acaki piny Lacwec ocweyogi laco ki dako?</char> <verse eid="MAT 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 19:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:24">Aca 2:24</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Dok owaco ni, ‘Pi tyen lok man laco biweko wone ki mine ci biribe ki dakone, ci gin aryoni dong gidoko kom acel.’</char> <verse eid="MAT 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 19:6" /><char style="wj">Kitmeno pe dong gibedo kom aryo ento kom acel. Pimeno gin ma Lubanga oribo kacel, ngat mo pe opok kin gi.”</char><verse eid="MAT 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 19:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 24:1-4">Nwo 24:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:31">Mat 5:31</ref></char>
    </note> Dok gupenye ni, “Ka kumeno, pingo Moses yam ociko ni kimii waraga me keto nyom, ki ryemo dako woko?”<verse eid="MAT 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 19:8" />En owaco botgi ni, <char style="wj">“Pi nwang cwinywu oweko Moses oye ni wuryem monwu, ento cake i acaki piny onongo yam pe tye kitmeno.</char> <verse eid="MAT 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 19:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:32">Mat 5:32</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 7:10">1 Kor 7:10</ref>,<ref loc="1CO 7:11">11</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Ento awaco botwu ni, laco mo ma oryemo dakone, ma pe pi tim me abor, ce onyomo dako mukene, nongo otimo abor.”</char><verse eid="MAT 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 19:10" />Lupwonyene guwace ni, “Kace lok ikom laco ki dakone tye kitmeno, ci dong bedo ber ka dano pe gunyome.” <verse eid="MAT 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 19:11" />Ento Yecu owaco botgi ni, <char style="wj">“Dano ducu pe twero jolo pwony macalo man, ento kono jo ma kimiyo botgi keken aye twero.</char> <verse eid="MAT 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 19:12" /><char style="wj">Pien tye jo mogo ma lulur cake wa ki ii megigi, ma kinywalogi kitmeno; tye jo mukene ma lulur ma nongo dano aye ma okologi; ki tye jo mukene malulur ma nongo gukole ken gi pi ker me polo. Dano matwero ye lok man, wek oye.”</char><verse eid="MAT 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yecu omiyo gum ikom lutino</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:13-16">Mar 10:13-16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:15-17">Luk 18:15-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 19:13" />Lacen kikelo lutino bot Yecu ni oket cinge ikomgi kun lego Lubanga pirgi. Lupwonyene gujuku dano woko. <verse eid="MAT 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 19:14" />Ento Yecu owaco botgi ni, <char style="wj">“Wuwek lutino gubin bota, pe wugeng gi, pien ker me polo tye pi jo macalo gin.”</char><verse eid="MAT 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 19:15" />Ci oketo cinge ikomgi, ka dong oa woko ki kunu.<verse eid="MAT 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Awobi ma lalonyo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:17-31">Mar 10:17-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:18-30">Luk 18:18-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 19:16" />Nen, dano mo obino bot Yecu kun penye ni, “Lapwony, atim gin ango maber wek alim kwo ma pe tum?”<verse eid="MAT 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 19:17" />Yecu openye ni, <char style="wj">“Pingo ipenya pi gin maber? Ngat maber tye acel keken. Ka i mito donyo i kwo, ci igwok Cik.”</char><verse eid="MAT 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 19:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:18: a </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 20:13">Nia 20:13</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:17">Nwo 5:17</ref>; </char>
      <char style="xo" closed="false">b </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 20:14">Nia 20:14</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:18">Nwo 5:18</ref>; </char>
      <char style="xo" closed="false">c </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 20:15">Nia 20:15</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:19">Nwo 5:19</ref>; </char>
      <char style="xo" closed="false">d </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 20:16">Nia 20:16</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:20">Nwo 5:20</ref></char>
    </note> Openyo Yecu ni, “Cik mene?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 19:18">Yecu owace ni, <char style="wj">“Pe ineki; Pe i tim abor; Pe ikwal; Pe ibed caden me goba;</char> <verse eid="MAT 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 19:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:19: a </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:12">Nia 20:12</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:16">Nwo 5:16</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">b </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:18">Lev 19:18</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Wor woru ki meni; ki dok ni, Mar lawoti macalo imare keni.”</char><verse eid="MAT 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 19:20" />Awobi meno odoke iye ni, “Magi ducu dong atyeko lubugi; gin ango ma pud odong?”<verse eid="MAT 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 19:21" />Yecu ogamo doge ni, <char style="wj">“Kace i mito bedo maber labongo roc mo ikomi, cit icat jami ducu ma itye kwede, ci imii lime ki lucan, ci i bibedo ki lwak lonyo ma kikano piri i polo; ka dong ibin ilub kora.”</char><verse eid="MAT 19:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 19:22" />Ikare ma awobi ni owinyo lok man, ocako cito woko kun cwinye cwer tutwal; pien onongo yam tye ki lim madwong.<verse eid="MAT 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 19:23" />Ci Yecu owaco bot lupwonyene ni, <char style="wj">“Adada awaco botwu ni, bibedo tek mada bot dano ma lalonyo me donyo i ker me polo.</char> <verse eid="MAT 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 19:24" /><char style="wj">An dok awaco botwu aye ni, kinaga twero donyo iwang libira</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:24 </char><char style="fk">Wang libira </char> Lujudaya lwongo apiding ni wang libira. Apiding aye dogola mading adada ikom cel. Tye pi dano ki lee matino calo dyel onyo romo keken. </note> <char style="wj">oyot, makato lalonyo me donyo i ker pa Lubanga.”</char> <verse eid="MAT 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 19:25" />Ka lupwonye guwinyo lok man, ci guuru tutwal kun gipenye ni, “Anga ma dok twero lare?” <verse eid="MAT 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 19:26" />Ento Yecu onenogi ci owaco botgi ni, <char style="wj">“Ki bot dano man pe twere, ento ki bot Lubanga jami ducu twere.”</char> <verse eid="MAT 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 19:27" />Petero ogamo kun waco ni, “Nen, wan waweko jamiwa ducu ci walubi. Wabinongo iye gin ango?” <verse eid="MAT 19:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 19:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:28: a </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 25:31">Mat 25:31</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">b </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 22:30">Luk 22:30</ref></char></note> Yecu owaco botgi ni, <char style="wj">“Adada awaco botwu ni, ikare me lobo manyen, ka Wod pa dano bibedo iwi komkere me deyo, wun jo madong wulubu kora bene wubibedo iwi komker apar wiye aryo, kun wungolo kop ikom kaka apar wiye aryo me Icrael.</char> <verse eid="MAT 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 19:29" /><char style="wj">Dong dano acel acel mayam oweko odi, nyo omege nyo nyimege, nyo wone, nyo mine, nyo lutino, nyo potine, pi nyinga, binongo jami makato magi tyen miya, ki en bene binongo kwo ma pe tum.</char> <verse eid="MAT 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 19:30" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 20:16">Mat 20:16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:30">Luk 13:30</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Jo mapol ma gin gubedo jo me wi atii gibidong cen, ki jo ma gudong cen gibibedo jo me wi atii.”</char><verse eid="MAT 19:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="MAT 20" />
  <para style="s1">Lutic i poto olok</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 20:1" />
    <char style="wj">“Ker me polo rom ki dano ma en won tic ma opuk woko odiko con ocito ka wako lutic i poto oloke.</char> <verse eid="MAT 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 20:2" /><char style="wj">Oyubu lok kwedgi ni ebiculugi iwel lim mamite pi nino acel acel kit ma kicul kwede cul me nino ducu, ci ocwalogi i poto oloke.</char> <verse eid="MAT 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 20:3" /><char style="wj">I cawa adek en ocito woko, ci oneno jo mukene ma gucung acunga i cuk labongo gin mo ma gitiyo.</char> <verse eid="MAT 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 20:4" /><char style="wj">Won tic owaco botgi ni, ‘Wun bene wucit i poto oloka, dok abiculu wun cul ma atir.’ Ci gin gucito.</char> <verse eid="MAT 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 20:5" /><char style="wj">Ikare ma dok en okato ocito woko i cawa abicel ki cawa abongwen, otimo marom ki me wi atii.</char> <verse eid="MAT 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 20:6" /><char style="wj">I kine me cawa apar wiye acel en dok ocito onongo jo mukene gucung acunga kunu; ci openyogi ni, ‘Pingo wucung kany dyecengi kulu labongo tiyo gin mo?’</char> <verse eid="MAT 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 20:7" /><char style="wj">Gudoke iye ni, ‘Pien dano mo pe owakowa.’ Ci won ot owaco botgi ni, ‘Wun bene wucit i poto oloka.’</char><verse eid="MAT 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 20:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 19:13">Lev 19:13</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 24:15">Nwo 24:15</ref></char>
    </note> <char style="wj">Ka dong oo otyeno, won poto olok owaco bot ladit maloyo lutice ni; ‘Lwong lutic, ci icul mucaragi. Cak ki ikom jo ma gucako tic lacen, nio kwede wa ikom jo ma gukwongo bino.’</char> <verse eid="MAT 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 20:9" /><char style="wj">Ka jo ma gucako tic i cawa apar wiye aceli gubino, ci dano acel acel ikin gi ogamo mucara me nino acel kulu.</char> <verse eid="MAT 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 20:10" /><char style="wj">Ka jo ma onongo gukwongo cako tic gubino, gutamo ni gwok onyo gibinongo mabup makato; ento ngat acel acel ikin gi kimiye mucara me nino acel.</char> <verse eid="MAT 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 20:11" /><char style="wj">Ka dong gugamo, gucako ngur bot won tic,</char> <verse eid="MAT 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 20:12" /><char style="wj">kun giwaco ni, ‘Jo magi ma gubino lacen ni gutiyo tic pi cawa acel keken, ento in imiyo gubedo rom kwedwa kun wan wacane ki tic i dyeceng malyeti kulu.’</char> <verse eid="MAT 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 20:13" /><char style="wj">Ento won tic odok iye ki dano acel ma ikin gi ni, ‘Larema, pe atye ka timi marac. Yam pe icike kweda ni ibigamo wel mucara meno?</char> <verse eid="MAT 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 20:14" /><char style="wj">Gam meri en, citi. An amiyo bot dano man ma lacen kit ma amiyo botini.</char> <verse eid="MAT 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 20:15" /><char style="wj">Pe myero atii ki jamina kit macalo iya mito? Gwok onyo nyeko omaki pi gin maber ma atiyo ni ba’?</char> <verse eid="MAT 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 20:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 19:30">Mat 19:30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:31">Mar 10:31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:30">Luk 13:30</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Kitmeno jo ma gudong cen gibibedo jo me wi atii, ki jo me wi atii gibidoko jo ma lacen.”</char><verse eid="MAT 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yecu otito pi tone tyen me adeke</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:32-34">Mar 10:32-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:31-34">Luk 18:31-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 20:17" />Ikare ma Yecu tye kaito cere me cito i Jerucalem, otero lupwonyene i mung. Ka gitye i yoo owaco botgi ni, <verse eid="MAT 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 20:18" /><char style="wj">“Wunen, dong watye kaito cere wacito i Jerucalem. Wod pa dano dong kibimiye i cing ajwaki madito pa Lubanga ki Lupwonycik. Kibingole kop me to,</char> <verse eid="MAT 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 20:19" /><char style="wj">ci kibimiye i cing Lurok wek gungale, gupwode ki del. Gin bigure woko ikom yatariya, ento en bicer woko inge nino adek.”</char><verse eid="MAT 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lega pa Yakobo ki Jon</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:35-45">Mar 10:35-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 20:20" />Lacen megi lutino pa Jebedayo obino bot Yecu kacel ki lutino awobene, ci ogungo piny inyime, ci olege pi gin mo. <verse eid="MAT 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 20:21" />Yecu openye ni, <char style="wj">“Imito ango?”</char> Odok iye ni, “Cike pi lutinona aryoni, ni ngat acel obed kangeti tung lacuc, ki acel bene obed kangeti tung lacam, i ker meri.” <verse eid="MAT 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 20:22" />Ento Yecu odoke iye ni, <char style="wj">“Wun pe wungeyo gin ma wulego. Wun wutwero mato ki kikopo me can ma abimato ni?”</char> Gudoke iye ni, “Watwero.” <verse eid="MAT 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 20:23" />Yecu dok owaco botgi ni, <char style="wj">“Kikopo me can ma an abimato ni wun bene wubimato, ento lok me bedo itung bada ma lacuc nyo ma lacam pe an aye apoko. Meno bibedo pa jo mayam Wora oyubu pirgi wa con.”</char><verse eid="MAT 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 20:24" />Ka lupwonye apar mukene ni guwinyo loke, ci cwinygi ocwer mada ikom omego aryonu. <verse eid="MAT 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 20:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 22:25">Luk 22:25</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:26">26</ref></char></note> Ento Yecu olwongogi bote, ci owaco ni, <char style="wj">“Wun wungeyo ni, jo ma kilwongogi ni gin lulo Lurok giloyo dano ki tek, dok luditogi bene gibedo ki twero ikomgi.</char> <verse eid="MAT 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 20:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 23:11">Mat 23:11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:35">Mar 9:35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:26">Luk 22:26</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Pe bibedo kitmeno ikinwu; ento ngat ma mito bedo ladit ikinwu aye omyero obed laticwu,</char> <verse eid="MAT 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 20:27" /><char style="wj">ki ngat ma mito bedo mukwongo ikinwu, en aye myero obed laticwu.</char> <verse eid="MAT 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 20:28" /><char style="wj">Kitmeno Wod pa dano bene pe obino ni omyero ki tiine, ento ni wek en aye etii ki dano, ki pi miyo kwone me koko jo mapol.”</char><verse eid="MAT 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yecu ocango lutowang aryo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:46-52">Mar 10:46-52</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:35-43">Luk 18:35-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 20:29" />Ikare madong gitye ka a woko ki i Jeriko, lwak madwong gulubu kore. <verse eid="MAT 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 20:30" />Nen, lutowang aryo ma gubedo piny inget gudo ka guwinyo ni meno aye Yecu ma obikato ni, ci gudange matek ni, “Lakwar Daudi, kica omaki ikom wa ba!”<verse eid="MAT 20:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 20:31" />Lwak gujukugi, kun giwaco botgi ni guling; ento gin gumede ameda ki dange ni, “Rwot, kica omaki ikom wa do, Lakwar Daudi!” <verse eid="MAT 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 20:32" />Yecu ocung ci olwongogi, kun waco ni, <char style="wj">“Wumito atim gin ango pirwu?”</char> <verse eid="MAT 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 20:33" />Gudoke iye ni, “Rwot wamito wangwa oyabe.” <verse eid="MAT 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 20:34" />Cutcut kica omako Yecu ikomgi, ci ogudu wanggi. Ci gucako neno piny, ka dong gulubu kore.<verse eid="MAT 20:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="MAT 21" />
  <para style="s1">Yecu odonyo i Jerucalem ki kwogo madit</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Mar 11:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luk 19:28-40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Jon 12:12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 21:1" />Ikare madong gin cok oo i Jerucalem, gubino i Betepage, ikor got Jeituni. Ci Yecu ooro lupwonyene aryo, <verse eid="MAT 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 21:2" />ocikogi ni, <char style="wj">“Wucit i gang matye inyimwu. Cut wubinongo kana ma kitweyo, tye gin ki latine; wugonygi ci wukelgi bota.</char> <verse eid="MAT 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 21:3" /><char style="wj">Kace dano mo biwaco lok mo botwu, wubidoke iye ni ‘Rwot aye mitogi,’ ci rwedgi bicwalogi kany oyotoyot.”</char> <verse eid="MAT 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 21:4" />Man otime wek lok mayam lanebi oloko ocobe kakare ni,<verse eid="MAT 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 21:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ZEC 9:9">Jek 9:9</ref>
      </char>
    </note> “Wuwac bot jo Cion ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:5">Nen ka Rwotwu bino botwu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:5">kun obedo iwi kana ki mwolo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:5">iwi latin kana.”<verse eid="MAT 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 21:6" />Lupwonye gucito gutimo kit macalo Yecu ocikogi kwede ni. <verse eid="MAT 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 21:7" />Gukelo kana ki latine, gupeto bongigi ikome ka dong Yecu obedo iwiye. <verse eid="MAT 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 21:8" />Jo mapol ikin lwak gupeto bongi i dye yoo, ki jo mogo gutongo jang yadi gupeto i dye yoo. <verse eid="MAT 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 21:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:25">Jab 118:25</ref>,<ref loc="PSA 118:26">26</ref></char></note>Lwak dano mapol ma gutelo yoo ki jo mapol malubu kore gubedo ka dange ni:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:9">“Ojana, obed bot Lakwar Daudi!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:9">Lubanga omii gum ikom ngat ma bino</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:9">inying Rwot!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:9">Ojana malo iwi polo!”<verse eid="MAT 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 21:10" />Ka dong odonyo i Jerucalem ci taun ducu otuge woko pire, kun dano giwaco ni, “Man anga?” <verse eid="MAT 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 21:11" />Lwak gugamo ni “Man aye lanebi Yecu ma oa ki i Najaret me Galilaya.”<verse eid="MAT 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yecu odonyo i Ot pa Lubanga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:15-19">Mar 11:15-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-48">Luk 19:45-48</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Jon 2:13-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 21:12" />Yecu odonyo i Ot pa Lubanga, ci oryemo jo ducu ma onongo gicato wil ki ma giwilo jami i Ot pa Lubanga. Oryebo meja pa lulok cente, ki kom pa lucat amam. <verse eid="MAT 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 21:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 56:7">Ica 56:7</ref>; <ref loc="JER 7:11">Jer 7:11</ref></char></note> Ci owaco botgi ni, <char style="wj">“Kicoyo ni, ‘Oda kibilwongo ni ot me lega’; ento wun wuloko odoko boro pa luyak.”</char><verse eid="MAT 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 21:14" />Lutowang ki lungolo gubino bote i Ot pa Lubanga ci en ocangogi. <verse eid="MAT 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 21:15" />Ento ikare ma ajwaki madito pa Lubanga ki Lupwonycik guneno gin me aura ma en otiyo, ki lutino ma dange i Ot pa Lubanga kun giwaco ni, “Ojana, obed bot Lakwar Daudi!” Man omiyo kiniga omakogi matek. <verse eid="MAT 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 21:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 8:2">Jab 8:2</ref></char></note> Gupenye ni, “Iwinyo gin ma jo magi tye kawacone?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:16">Yecu ogamo ni, <char style="wj">“Awinyo. Yam pe wukwano ni,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:16">
    <char style="wj">‘Wer ma lutino lukere ki lutino ma pud dot</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:16">
    <char style="wj">giwero me paki ber atika?’”</char><verse eid="MAT 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 21:17" />Lacen owekogi, oa ki i taun ocito i Betania ci obutu kunu.<verse eid="MAT 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yecu oceno yat oduru</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:12-14">Mar 11:12-14</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 11:20-26">20-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 21:18" />Odiko ma en dong dok Jerucalem, kec oneke. <verse eid="MAT 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 21:19" />Ma oneno yat oduru mo inget yoo, ci ongak itere, pe onongo iye gin mo, ento onongo pote keken. Yecu owaco bot yat oduru nu ni, <char style="wj">“Pe dok ibinyako nyiggi matwal.”</char> Cutcut oduru meno otugi tal woko.<verse eid="MAT 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 21:20" />Ka lupwonye guneno ci guuru tutwal, kun gipenyo ni, “Yat oduru ni dok otugi two woko oyotoyot ningning?”<verse eid="MAT 21:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 21:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:21: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 17:20">Mat 17:20</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 13:2">1 Kor 13:2</ref></char>
    </note> Yecu odok iye botgi ni, <char style="wj">“Adada awaco botwu ni, ka onongo wutye ki niye, ma kun pe wukalo akala, onongo pe wutwero timo gin ma otime ikom oduru ni keken, ento wutwero waco ki got man ni, ‘Muke, dok itinge ipot wa i nam’, ci bitime bene.</char> <verse eid="MAT 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 21:22" /><char style="wj">Gin ducu ma wupenyo ilega, wubinongo, kace wutye ki niye.”</char><verse eid="MAT 21:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kipenyo kit twero pa Yecu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:27-33">Mar 11:27-33</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:1-8">Luk 20:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 21:23" />Ikare ma Yecu odonyo i Ot pa Lubanga, ci ajwaki madito pa Lubanga ki ludongo pa lwak gubino bote ma onongo en tye kapwony, gupenye ni, “Twero mene ma omiyo itimo gin magi, dok anga ma omiyo ki in twero meno?”<verse eid="MAT 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 21:24" />Yecu ogamo doggi ni, <char style="wj">“An bene abipenyowu ki peny acel; kace wudoka iye, ci dong abitito botwu twero ma an atimo gin magi.</char> <verse eid="MAT 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 21:25" /><char style="wj">Batija pa Jon twerone oa ki kwene? Oa ki i polo nyo ki bot dano?”</char> Ci gucako pyem ikin gi keken gi kun giwaco ni, “Ka wawaci, ‘Twerone oa ki i polo’, ci en bipenyowa ni, ‘Pingo kono onongo pe wuye en?’ <verse eid="MAT 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 21:26" />Ento kace wawaco ni, ‘Oa ki bot dano’, walworo lwak; pien gin ducu gingeyo maber ni Jon aye lanebi atika.” <verse eid="MAT 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 21:27" />Ma omiyo gudok iye bot Yecu ni, “Pe wangeyo.” Yecu bene owaco botgi ni, <char style="wj">“An bene pe abitito bot wun kit twero ma omiyo atiyo gin magi.</char><verse eid="MAT 21:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Carolok ikom awobe aryo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 21:28" />
    <char style="wj">Wutamo ango? Laco mo onongo yam tye ki awobene aryo. Oa ocito bot latin mukwongo, owace ni, ‘Latina, tin cit katic i poto olok.’</char> <verse eid="MAT 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 21:29" /><char style="wj">Latin meno ogamo ni, ‘Pe abicito’, ento lacen ongut ci ocito katic i poto olok.</char> <verse eid="MAT 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 21:30" /><char style="wj">Laco meno dok oa ocito bot latine me aryo ci owace lok marom ki maca; ci wode odok iye ni, ‘Ladit, abicito’; ento pe omedo ki cito.</char> <verse eid="MAT 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 21:31" /><char style="wj">Ikin awobe aryo nu anga ma otiyo gin ma onongo wone mito?”</char> Gudoke iye ni, “Latin mukwongo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:31">Yecu owaco botgi ni, <char style="wj">“Adada awaco botwu ni, lujog mucoro ki mon ma malaya bikwongo donyo i ker pa Lubanga wi atii ki wun.</char> <verse eid="MAT 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 21:32" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:32: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 3:12">Luk 3:12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 7:29">7:29</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 7:30">30</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Pien Jon yam obino botwu kun lubu yo me kit ma atir, ento wun wukwero ye en woko; ento lujog mucoro ki mon ma malaya guye en. Dok bene kadi bed wuneno gin mutime, lacen pe wungut, dok pe wuye en.</char><verse eid="MAT 21:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Carolok ikom lugwok poto olok</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:1-12">Mar 12:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:9-19">Luk 20:9-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 21:33" />
    <char style="wj">Kong dok wuwiny carolok mukene. Yam tye dano mo ma opito olok i potone, ci orumu woko ducu ki cel, ka okwinyo iye bur me biyo pige, ogero iye lubele, oweko bot lupur, ci ocito woko i lobo mukene.</char> <verse eid="MAT 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 21:34" /><char style="wj">Ka kare me pwono nyig olok dong oromo, ci ocwalo lutice bot lupur ka kelo nyig oloke.</char> <verse eid="MAT 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 21:35" /><char style="wj">Ento lupur gumako lutice, gugoyo ngat acel, ki ngat acel guneko woko, ki mukene gucelo woko ki got.</char> <verse eid="MAT 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 21:36" /><char style="wj">En dok ocwalo lutic mukene mapol, ma gikato jo mukwongo ca, jonu bene kitimogi ki kit tim acel ma kitimo ikom lutic mukwongo ca.</char> <verse eid="MAT 21:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 21:37" /><char style="wj">Lacen dong en ocwalo wode kikome botgi, kun waco ni, ‘Gibiworo woda.’</char> <verse eid="MAT 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 21:38" /><char style="wj">Ento ka lupur guneno wode, gucako lok keken gi ni, ‘Man aye dong lale lim; wubin waneke woko, wek lim aleyane ni obed mewa.’</char> <verse eid="MAT 21:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 21:39" /><char style="wj">Ci gumake gubole woko ki i poto olok, ka guneke woko.</char> <verse eid="MAT 21:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 21:40" /><char style="wj">Pimeno ka won poto olok obino, bitimo lupur ningning?” </char> <verse eid="MAT 21:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 21:41" />Ci gugamo ni, “En bineko lupur maracuni woko ki kit nek marac atika, ci miyo poto olok woko bot lupur mukene ma gitwero miye nyig olok ka karene oromo.”<verse eid="MAT 21:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 21:42" />Ci Yecu owaco botgi ni, <char style="wj">“Yam pe wukwano lok ma kicoyo i ginacoya ni,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:42">
    <char style="wj">‘Got ma lugedo gukwero ni en aye odoko got mapire tek me gedo ot;</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:42">
    <char style="wj">man Rwot aye ma otiyo,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:42">
    <char style="wj">obedo botwa lok me aura!’</char><verse eid="MAT 21:42" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 21:43" />
    <char style="wj">Pimeno awaco botwu ni, kibikwanyo ker pa Lubanga woko ki botwu, ci kimiyo bot rok ma binyako nyig mamite iye kikome.”</char> <verse eid="MAT 21:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 21:44" /><char style="wj">[Dano ma bipoto ikom got man bitur ngide woko matinotino; ento ka got man opoto ikom dano mo, ci nyoto woko.] </char><verse eid="MAT 21:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 21:45" />Ka ajwaki madito pa Lubanga ki Luparicayo guwinyo caroloke, ci guniang ni onongo kara Yecu tye kalok ikomgi. <verse eid="MAT 21:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 21:46" />Gutemo make, ento gulworo lwak, pien lwak onongo ngeyo ni en lanebi.<verse eid="MAT 21:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="MAT 22" />
  <para style="s1">Carolok ikom karama me nyom</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 14:15-24">Luk 14:15-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 22:1" />Yecu dok oloko kwedgi i carolok kun waco ni, <verse eid="MAT 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 22:2" /><char style="wj">“Ker me polo kiporo ki rwot mo, ma oyubu karama me nyom pa wode.</char> <verse eid="MAT 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 22:3" /><char style="wj">En ooro lutice me cito kalwongo jo mayam onongo kilwongogi i karama meno, ento gin gukwero bino woko.</char> <verse eid="MAT 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 22:4" /><char style="wj">Dok ooro lutice mukene, kun waco botgi ni, ‘Wuwac bot jo ma onongo kilwongogi ni, Nen, dong ayubu cam ducu tye, twonina ki rocina ma moo dong kinekogi woko, dong kiyubu jami ducu tye; wubin ikarama me nyom’</char> <verse eid="MAT 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 22:5" /><char style="wj">Ento gin pe guketo cwinygi iye, gucito citogi, ngat acel ocito i potone, ngat mukene ocito i cato wile,</char> <verse eid="MAT 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 22:6" /><char style="wj">jo mukene ma gudong gumako lutice, gutimogi ki kit tim ducu me lewic, ci gunekogi woko.</char> <verse eid="MAT 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 22:7" /><char style="wj">Kiniga omako rwot, ocwalo mony ci guneko lunek gu woko, dok guwango taun gi madit woko bene.</char> <verse eid="MAT 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 22:8" /><char style="wj">Rwot dok owaco bot lutice ni, ‘Karama dong kiyubu, ento jo ma onongo nene kilwongogi pe dong gimyero.</char> <verse eid="MAT 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 22:9" /><char style="wj">Pimeno wucit i yoo madito, wulwong jo mapol ma wubinongo, wuwek gubin i karama me nyom.’</char> <verse eid="MAT 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 22:10" /><char style="wj">Lutic magi gucito i yoo gudo ci gucoko jo ducu ma gunongo; jo maracu kacel ki jo mabeco; ma omiyo ot me nyom opong woko nigwik ki wele.</char> <verse eid="MAT 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 22:11" /><char style="wj">Ento ikare ma rwot odonyo i ot kaneno wele, ci oneno laco mo ma obedo kunu ma pe onongo oruku bongo me nyom.</char> <verse eid="MAT 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 22:12" /><char style="wj">Cutcut otugi penye ni, ‘Larema, idonyo kany ningning ma kun pe iruku bongo me nyom?’ Laco meno oling alinga litik.</char> <verse eid="MAT 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 22:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 8:12">Mat 8:12</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 25:30">25:30</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Man oweko rwot ociko lugwok wele ni, ‘Wutwe cinge wa ki tyen ne woko, ci wubole kwede woko i piny macol; kunu dano gibikok kun gikayo lakgi.’</char> <verse eid="MAT 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 22:14" /><char style="wj">Pien jo ma kilwongogi pol, ento ma kiyerogi nok.”</char><verse eid="MAT 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Culu mucoro bot Cecar</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:13-17">Mar 12:13-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:20-26">Luk 20:20-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 22:15" />Luparicayo gucito guporo lok kit macalo myero gimak kwede lok ma a ki idoge. <verse eid="MAT 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 22:16" />Ci guoro bote lupwonyegi kacel ki jo pa Kerode, kun giwaco ni, “Lapwony, wan wangeyo ni in dano me ada, dok ipwonyo yo pa Lubanga ki ada, dok bene pe inwene ikom dano mo, pien in pe ineno kom dano ki woko. <verse eid="MAT 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 22:17" />Tit botwa gin ma itamo. Cikwa ye ni kicul mucoro bot Cecar nyo pe?” <verse eid="MAT 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 22:18" />Ento Yecu ongeyo rac cwiny ma gitye kwede, ci owaco botgi ni, <char style="wj">“Wun wuomo cwinya pingo, wun lugoba?</char> <verse eid="MAT 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 22:19" /><char style="wj">Kong wunyuta kom lim ma kiculu kwede mucoro ni.”</char> Ci gukelo bote. <verse eid="MAT 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 22:20" />Yecu openyogi ni, <char style="wj">“Cal ki coc ma kicoyo ikome ni pa anga?”</char> <verse eid="MAT 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 22:21" />Gugamo ni, “Pa Cecar.” Ci owaco botgi ni, <char style="wj">“Wumii jami pa Cecar bot Cecar, ki jami pa Lubanga wumii bot Lubanga.”</char> <verse eid="MAT 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 22:22" />Ikare ma guwinyo loke guuru matek; ci guweke gucito woko.<verse eid="MAT 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Peny ikom cer ki ikin jo ma oto</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:18-27">Mar 12:18-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:27-40">Luk 20:27-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 22:23" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:23: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 23:8">Tic 23:8</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Inino meno bene Lucadukayo gubino bot Yecu, gin aye jo ma onongo giwaco ni jo ma oto pe gicer. Ci gupenye ki peny mo acel ni, <verse eid="MAT 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 22:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 25:5">Nwo 25:5</ref></char></note> “Lapwony, Moses yam owaco ni, ‘Kace laco mo oto ma pe onywalo latin, ci omine myero olak dakone, wek onywal kwede lutino ma kaka omine.’ <verse eid="MAT 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 22:25" />Yam onongo tye omego abiro ikinwa. Ngat mukwongo onyomo dako, ci oto woko ma pe obwoto latin mo, oweko dako bot omine. <verse eid="MAT 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 22:26" />Dano me aryo ki me adeke bene ducu kitmeno, nio wa ikom dano me abirone. <verse eid="MAT 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 22:27" />Lacen ki ingegi ducu, dako bene oto. <verse eid="MAT 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 22:28" />Dong ikare me cer dakonu bibedo pa anga ikin co abironu? Pien gin ducu onongo gubedo kwede.”<verse eid="MAT 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 22:29" />Ento Yecu odok iye ni, <char style="wj">“Wun wurwenyo, pien pe wungeyo gin ma kicoyo i ginacoya, kadi wa teko pa Lubanga bene wukwiya.</char> <verse eid="MAT 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 22:30" /><char style="wj">Pien ikare ma dano gibicer woko, dong pe gibinyome, ento gibibedo macalo lumalaika ma i polo.</char> <verse eid="MAT 22:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 22:31" /><char style="wj">Ento ikom lok man me cer ki ikin jo ma oto ni, yam pe wukwano lok ma Lubanga oloko botwu ni,</char> <verse eid="MAT 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 22:32" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:32: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 3:6">Nia 3:6</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">‘An Lubanga pa Abraim, ki Lubanga pa Icaka, ki Lubanga pa Yakobo’ En pe Lubanga pa jo ma oto, ento Lubanga pa jo makwo.”</char> <verse eid="MAT 22:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 22:33" />Ka lwak guwinyo, ci guuru pwonye matek.<verse eid="MAT 22:33" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Cik madit makato ducu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:28-34">Mar 12:28-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:25-28">Luk 10:25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 22:34" />Ikare ma Luparicayo guwinyo ni Yecu otwoyo dog Lucadukayo woko ki lok, ci gucoke kacel. <verse eid="MAT 22:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 22:35" />Dano mo ikin gi onongo Lapwonycik, oteme kun penye ki peny acel, ni <verse eid="MAT 22:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 22:36" />“Lapwony, Cik mene madit makato Cik ducu?”<verse eid="MAT 22:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 22:37" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:37: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 6:5">Nwo 6:5</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Yecu odoke iye ni, <char style="wj">“‘Mar Rwot Lubangani ki cwinyi ducu, ki kwo ni ducu, ki tami ducu.’</char> <verse eid="MAT 22:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 22:38" /><char style="wj">Man aye Cik madit dok mukwongo.</char> <verse eid="MAT 22:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 22:39" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:39: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:18">Lev 19:18</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Ki me aryone marom kwede en ene ni, ‘Mar lawoti macalo imare keni.’</char> <verse eid="MAT 22:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 22:40" /><char style="wj">Ikom Cik magi aryo lok ducu matye i Cik ki i pwony pa lunebi gucung iye.”</char><verse eid="MAT 22:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Peny ikom lakwar Daudi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:35-37">Mar 12:35-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:41-44">Luk 20:41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 22:41" />Ikare ma Luparicayo dong gucoke kacel, Yecu openyogi kun waco ni, <verse eid="MAT 22:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 22:42" /><char style="wj">“Wutamo gin ango ikom Kricito ma Lubanga oyero? En lakwar anga?”</char> Gudoke iye ni, “Lakwar Daudi.” <verse eid="MAT 22:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 22:43" />Yecu dok openyogi ni, <char style="wj">“Pingo kono Cwiny Maleng dok omiyo Daudi olwonge ni Rwot? Pien yam oloko ni,</char><verse eid="MAT 22:43" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 22:44" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:44: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 110:1">Jab 110:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note> <char style="wj">‘Rwot owaco bot Rwoda ni:</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 22:44">
    <char style="wj">bed itung bada ma lacuc, i kabedo me deyo,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 22:44">
    <char style="wj">nio ka abiketo lukwori piny ite tyeni.’</char><verse eid="MAT 22:44" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 22:45" />
    <char style="wj">Ka en Daudi aye yam olwonge ni Rwot, ci en dok bedo lakware ningning?”</char> <verse eid="MAT 22:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 22:46" />Dano mo pe ma otwero doke iye lok mo kadi ki acel, dok cake ikare meno ngat mo pe dok oete me penye ki kit peny mo.<verse eid="MAT 22:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="MAT 23" />
  <para style="s1">Yecu otucu pi can ma bipoto ikom Lupwonycik ki Luparicayo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Mar 12:38-40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:37-54">Luk 11:37-54</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:45-47">20:45-47</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 23:1" />Lacen Yecu owaco bot lwak ki bot lupwonyene ni, <verse eid="MAT 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 23:2" /><char style="wj">“Lupwonycik ki Luparicayo gibedo iwi kom pa Moses;</char> <verse eid="MAT 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 23:3" /><char style="wj">pimeno lok ducu ma gin pwonyowu kwede, wutii dok wugwok bene, ento pe wutii gin ma gin tiyo, pien giloko aloka keken pe gitiyo gin ma gipwonyo.</char> <verse eid="MAT 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 23:4" /><char style="wj">Gitweyo yec mapek ma yeyone tek, ci giketo iwi gwok dano; ento gin ki komgi pe gikonyo me tingo kadi ki nyig cinggi acel.</char> <verse eid="MAT 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 23:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 6:1">Mat 6:1</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Gitiyo ticgi ducu ni wek dano onengi; pien gikwoyo coc madito ikom del aruka i turnyimgi, lok me Cik pa Lubanga, gimedo bene dog bongi gi bedo maboco adada,</char> <verse eid="MAT 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 23:6" /><char style="wj">dok gimaro bedo i kabedo me deyo i karama, ki bedo iwi kom me dito i kacoke.</char> <verse eid="MAT 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 23:7" /><char style="wj">Dok bene gimito ni dano omotgi wa i cuk gu, gimaro bene ni dano myero gulwong gi ni, ‘Lapwony.’</char> <verse eid="MAT 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 23:8" /><char style="wj">Ento wun pe myero gilwongwu ni, ‘Lapwony’, pien wutye ki Lapwony acel keken, pimeno wun ducu dong wudoko utmege.</char> <verse eid="MAT 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 23:9" /><char style="wj">Dok bene pe wulwong dano mo ni wonwu iwi lobo, pien Wonwu tye acel, en aye ngat matye i polo.</char> <verse eid="MAT 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 23:10" /><char style="wj">Pe bene gilwongwu ni lutel, pien wutye ki Latelwu acel, ma en aye Kricito ma Lubanga oyero.</char> <verse eid="MAT 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 23:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 20:26">Mat 20:26</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 20:27">27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:35">Mar 9:35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:43">10:43</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 10:44">44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:26">Luk 22:26</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Dano madit maloyo ki ikinwu aye bibedo laticwu.</char> <verse eid="MAT 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 23:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 14:11">Luk 14:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:14">18:14</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Pien ngat ma ile malo kene i rwom mamalo, kibidwoke piny, ento ngat ma mwole kene kibimiye doko dit.</char><verse eid="MAT 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 23:13" />
    <char style="wj">Wubineno can, wun Lupwonycik ki Luparicayo, wun lugoba! Pien wuloro dogola me ker me polo woko bot dano; kun wun ki komwu pe wudonyo iye, dok bene wugengo jo ma mito donyo iye woko.</char> <verse eid="MAT 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 23:14" /><char style="wj">Wubineno can wun Lupwonycik ki Luparicayo, wun lugoba! Pien wumayo odi pa mon to, dok wulego lega maboco me buta keken. Kibingolo kop madit makato ducu iwiwu.</char><verse eid="MAT 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 23:15" />
    <char style="wj">Wubineno can, wun Lupwonycik ki Luparicayo, wun lugoba! Pien wuwoto wulongo piny ki i dye nam kun wuwoto wa iwi tura gu wek wulok dano acel owek dinine odwog i mewuni, ento ka dong oloke, wumiyo doko latin me Geena marom aroma kwedwu tyen aryo.</char><verse eid="MAT 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 23:16" />
    <char style="wj">Wubineno can, wun lutel dano ma wangwu oto, ma wuwaco ni, ‘Kace dano mo okwongo kwong ki Ot pa Lubanga, lok mo bedo peke iye, ento ka ngat mo okwongo kwong ki jabu ma i Ot pa Lubanga, en myero ocob kwongeneni.’</char> <verse eid="MAT 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 23:17" /><char style="wj">Wun lutowang ma luming! Gin mene ma pire dit kato, jabu nyo Ot pa Lubanga mamiyo jabu odoko maleng?</char> <verse eid="MAT 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 23:18" /><char style="wj">Dok wuwaco ni, ‘Kace dano mo okwongo kwong ki keno tyer, lok mo peke iye, ento kace ngat mo okwongo ki mot ma giketo iwi keno tyer, kwonge ni en myero ocobi woko gire.’</char> <verse eid="MAT 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 23:19" /><char style="wj">Wun lutowang! Gin mene madit makato, mot nyo keno tyer mamiyo mot doko maleng?</char> <verse eid="MAT 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 23:20" /><char style="wj">Pimeno dano ma kwongo kwong ki keno tyer, kwongo bene ki jami ducu matye iwi keno tyer.</char> <verse eid="MAT 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 23:21" /><char style="wj">Dano ma kwonge ki Ot pa Lubanga, nongo okwonge ki Ot pa Lubanga kadi wa ki Ngat ma bedo iye.</char> <verse eid="MAT 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 23:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 66:1">Ica 66:1</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:34">Mat 5:34</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Dano ma kwonge ki polo, nongo kwonge ki komker pa Lubanga kadi wa ki Ngat ma bedo iwiye ni.</char><verse eid="MAT 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 23:23" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:23: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 27:30">Lev 27:30</ref>
      </char>
    </note> <char style="wj">Wubineno can, wun Lupwonycik ki Luparicayo, wun lugoba! Pien wumiyo dul acel me apar me malakwang ki toki ki okwerwu, ento wutenyo lok ma pirgi tego me Cik woko, gin macalo ngolo kop atir, timo kica ki bedo jo matye ki niye. Magi ducu myero wutim, kun bene pe wuweko mukene ca.</char> <verse eid="MAT 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 23:24" /><char style="wj">Wun lutowang, wukwanyo lwango ki i pii amatawu, ento wumwonyo kinaga woko kacel ki pii nu.</char><verse eid="MAT 23:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 23:25" />
    <char style="wj">Wubineno can, wun Lupwonycik ki Luparicayo, wun lugoba! Pien wulwoko nge kikopo ki cani ki woko wek obed leng, ento ki igi nongo gupong ki tim me yako dano ki miti mogo ma pe twero juke.</char> <verse eid="MAT 23:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 23:26" /><char style="wj">Wun Luparicayo ma lutowang! Mukwongo myero kong wulwok i kikopo ki cani obed leng, ka wek ngeye bene obed leng.</char><verse eid="MAT 23:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 23:27" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:27: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 23:3">Tic 23:3</ref>
      </char>
    </note> <char style="wj">Wubineno can, wun Lupwonycik ki Luparicayo, wun lugoba! Pien wurom ki lyel ma gipuyo ki gin matar, ma nongo ki tung woko nen maber, ento igi nongo opong ki cogo pa jo ma oto, ki jami ducu ma keni keken.</char> <verse eid="MAT 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 23:28" /><char style="wj">Wun bene kitmeno, ki woko wunen bot dano ni wun jo ma kitwu atir, ento wun lutim bwolobwolo dok wupong ki gin maracu keken.</char><verse eid="MAT 23:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 23:29" />
    <char style="wj">Wubineno can, wun Lupwonycik ki Luparicayo, wun lugoba! Pien wucano got iwi lyel pa lunebi, ka dok wudeyo kom gin mayam kigero pi po pi jo ma kitgi atir. Wuyubu woko wek onen maber,</char> <verse eid="MAT 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 23:30" /><char style="wj">kun wuwaco ni, ‘Ka nene onongo wabedo ikare pa kwarowa, kono onongo pe waribe kwedgi ka neko lunebi.’</char> <verse eid="MAT 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 23:31" /><char style="wj">Wun giwu wutucu kenwu ni wun likwayo pa jo mayam guneko lunebi ni.</char> <verse eid="MAT 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 23:32" /><char style="wj">Ber, dong wucob tic pa kwariwu!</char> <verse eid="MAT 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 23:33" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:33: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:7">Mat 3:7</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:34">12:34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:7">Luk 3:7</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Wun twol, lutino ororo, wubibwot ningning ki ingolo kop me bolowu i Geena?</char> <verse eid="MAT 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 23:34" /><char style="wj">Piman abioro botwu lunebi ki luryeko ki Lupwonycik, ma jo mogo ikin gi wun wubinekogi ci wugurugi woko ikom yatariya. Jo mogo wubigoyogi ki del i kacokewu, kun wuyelo gi taun ki taun.</char> <verse eid="MAT 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 23:35" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:35: a </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 4:8">Aca 4:8</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">b </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 24:20">2 Tek 24:20</ref>,<ref loc="2CH 24:21">21</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Pimeno remo pa jo ducu ma kitgi atir ma kinekogi i lobo obed iwiwu, cake ki ikom remo pa Abel ma bale peke ni nio kwede ikom remo pa Jekaria wod pa Barakia, mayam wuneko ikin Kabedo Maleng ki keno tyer pa Lubanga.</char> <verse eid="MAT 23:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 23:36" /><char style="wj">Adada awaco botwu ni, lok man ducu bipoto ikom jo ma gin yalwak me kare man.</char><verse eid="MAT 23:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yecu okumu pi Jerucalem</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:34-35">Luk 13:34-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 23:37" />
    <char style="wj">Jerucalem, Jerucalem, in ma ineko lunebi, ma icelo jo ma kioro boti woko ki got, tyen adi ma nene amito coko lutinoni woko macalo min gweno ma coko lutinone ite bwome, ento in pe iye giri!</char> <verse eid="MAT 23:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 23:38" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:38: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 22:5">Jer 22:5</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Nen, dong gitenyo otti boti, iye odong nono.</char> <verse eid="MAT 23:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 23:39" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:39: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:26">Jab 118:26</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Atito boti ni pe ibinena nio ka ibiwaco ni, ‘Kipwo ngat ma bino inying Rwot!’”</char><verse eid="MAT 23:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="MAT 24" />
  <para style="s1">Yecu otito pi muku Ot pa Lubanga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:1-2">Mar 13:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:5-6">Luk 21:5-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 24:1" />Yecu okato woko ki i Ot pa Lubanga. Ma dong tye kacito, lupwonyene gubino gunyute gedo me Ot pa Lubanga. <verse eid="MAT 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 24:2" />Ento en odok iye botgi ni, <char style="wj">“Wuneno gin magi ducu, pe kumeno? Adada awaco botwu ni, pe kibiweko got acel mo kany ma odode iwi wadi, ma pe kibicoro woko piny.”</char><verse eid="MAT 24:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Can ma bipoto i lobo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:3-13">Mar 13:3-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:7-19">Luk 21:7-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 24:3" />Ikare ma Yecu obedo iwi got Jeituni, lupwonyene gubino bote i mung gucako penye ni, “Tit botwa, lok man bitime awene, dok kit gin ango ma binyutu dwogoni ki agiki piny?” <verse eid="MAT 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 24:4" />Ci Yecu odok iye botgi ni, <char style="wj">“Wugwoke, pe wuwek ngat mo obwolwu.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 24:5" /><char style="wj">Pien jo mapol gibibino inyinga, ma giwaco ni, ‘An aye Kricito ma Lubanga oyero’, ci gibibwolo jo mapol.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 24:6" /><char style="wj">Dok bene wubiwinyo pi mony, ki lok ma yweko pi mony; pe wuwek tipu komwu oto woko lirut. Jami magi omyero kong otime, ento nongo nino me agiki pud peke.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 24:7" /><char style="wj">Pien rok bilweny ki rok wadi, ki ker bene bilweny ki ker wadi, ki kec bene bipoto i lobo, ki oyengyeng biyengo lobo i kabedo mapol.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 24:8" /><char style="wj">Gin magi ducu gin aye acaki me can ma bipoto i lobo.</char><verse eid="MAT 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 24:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 10:22">Mat 10:22</ref>
      </char>
    </note> <char style="wj">Ikare meno kibimakowu ci kibimiyowu i cing jo ma biketo can ikomwu ci gibinekowu woko. Jo me rok ducu bikwerowu pi nyinga.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 24:10" /><char style="wj">Ikare meno jo mapol bipoto, kibiketo lok roro ikin gi gidote keken gi, dok ki bibedo ki adagadaga ikin gi keken gi.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 24:11" /><char style="wj">Lunebi mapol ma lugoba bibino ma gibirwenyo jo mapol.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 24:12" /><char style="wj">Kit macalo tim maracu bibedo ka mede ameda ni, mar pa jo mapol bikwe woko.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 24:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:22">Mat 10:22</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Ento ngat ma biciro nio wa iagiki bilare.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 24:14" /><char style="wj">Dong lok man me Kwena Maber me ker pa Lubanga kibitito iwi lobo ducu wek obed caden bot rok ducu; ka dong lacen agiki piny bibino.”</char><verse eid="MAT 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Can madit ma lik</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:14-23">Mar 13:14-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:20-24">Luk 21:20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 24:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DAN 9:27">Dan 9:27</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 11:31">11:31</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 12:11">12:11</ref></char>
    </note> <char style="wj">“Pimeno ka wubineno gin mo me kwer, malik, ma balo cwiny dano, mayam Daniel otito pire, kun ocung i Kabedo Maleng,</char> (dano ma kwano myero oniang iye), <verse eid="MAT 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 24:16" /><char style="wj">ci jo matye i Judaya myero guring woko iwi godi.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 24:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 17:31">Luk 17:31</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Dano ma onongo tye iwi ot pe dok olor piny me bino ka kwanyo gin mo matye i ode.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 24:18" /><char style="wj">Dano matye i poto bene pe odok cen paco kaomo ginarukane.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 24:19" /><char style="wj">Bibedo rac adada bot mon ma giyac ki mon ma doto lutino!</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 24:20" /><char style="wj">Wuleg wek ngwecwu pe otime i cwir nyo i ceng Cabit.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 24:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 12:1">Dan 12:1</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Pien ikare meno twon can madit atika bitime iye, mayam peya onen i lobo, nia wa iacaki lobo nio kwede wa onyo, dok pe bene binen.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 24:22" /><char style="wj">Kono nene Rwot pe ojwiko kare meno obedo manok mo, kono dano mo pe obwot; ento pi jo ma ki yero, miyo kibijwiko wel nino bedo manok.</char><verse eid="MAT 24:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 24:23" />
    <char style="wj">Ikare meno kace dano mo biwaco botwu ni, ‘Nen, Kricito ma Lubanga oyero tye kany’, nyo ni, ‘Nen, tye kuca’, pe wuye.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 24:24" /><char style="wj">Pien Kricito ma lugoba, kacel ki lunebigu ma lugoba gibibino, gibinyutu lanyut kitiyo jami me tango, wek girweny jo mapol ka gitwero, wek girweny wa ki jo ma Lubanga oyero bene.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 24:25" /><char style="wj">Nen, dong atyeko tito botwu con.</char><verse eid="MAT 24:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 24:26" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:26: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 17:23">Luk 17:23</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 17:24">24</ref></char>
    </note> <char style="wj">Kace kibiwaco botwu ni, ‘Nen, en tye i tim kuca’, pe wucit kunu, nyo ni, ‘Tye i kicika ot ma i iye’, pe wuye.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 24:27" /><char style="wj">Kit macalo lutkot a ki tung kunyango ci wil menyo piny wa tung kupotoceng, dwogo pa Wod pa dano bene bibedo kitmeno.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 24:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 17:37">Luk 17:37</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Kama kom dano ma oto tye iye, acut bene gicoke kunu.</char><verse eid="MAT 24:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kit ma Wod pa dano bidwogo kwede</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:24-27">Mar 13:24-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:25-28">Luk 21:25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 24:29" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:29: a </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 13:10">Ica 13:10</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 2:10">Joe 2:10</ref>,<ref loc="JOL 2:31">31</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 3:15">3:15</ref>; <ref loc="REV 6:12">Niy 6:12</ref>; </char>
      <char style="xo" closed="false">b </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 13:10">Ica 13:10</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 32:7">Eje 32:7</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 2:10">Joe 2:10</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 3:15">3:15</ref>; </char>
      <char style="xo" closed="false">c </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 34:4">Ica 34:4</ref>
      </char>
    </note> <char style="wj">Cutcut inge can madit me kare meno bibedo kit macalo yam kicoyo ni.</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 24:29">
    <char style="wj">‘Ceng bicido woko macol licuc,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 24:29">
    <char style="wj">ki dwe bene pe biryeny,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 24:29">
    <char style="wj">lakalatwe bia ki i polo gipoto piny,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 24:29">
    <char style="wj">ki twer ducu ma i polo bene biyenge.’</char><verse eid="MAT 24:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 24:30" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:30: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DAN 7:13">Dan 7:13</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 12:10-14">Jek 12:10-14</ref>; <ref loc="REV 1:7">Niy 1:7</ref></char>
    </note> <char style="wj">Ka dong lanyut pa Wod pa dano binen i polo. Ci ikare meno kaka ducu ma iwi lobo bikumu, ci gibineno Wod pa dano kabino ki iwi pol me polo, ki twero madwong, ki deyo madit.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 24:31" /><char style="wj">En bioro lumalaika ki tum makok malongo, gibicoko jone ma en oyero ki itwok piny angwen ducu, nia ki i agiki polo tungcel nio kwede wa i agikine mukene.</char><verse eid="MAT 24:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pwony ikom yat oduru</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:28-31">Mar 13:28-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:29-33">Luk 21:29-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 24:32" />
    <char style="wj">Wupwonye ikom yat oduru; cutcut ka jange olot, ci pote luk, ci dong wungeyo ni oro dong cok.</char>
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">24:32 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Oduru cako luk i agiki dwe me apar wiye acel. </char>
    </note> <verse eid="MAT 24:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 24:33" /><char style="wj">Ki wun bene kace wuneno gin magi ducu, ci wunge ni en dong tye cok, tye wa idogola.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 24:34" /><char style="wj">Adada awaco botwu ni, yalwak me kare man pe bitum, nio wang ma lok magi ducu otime.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 24:35" /><char style="wj">Polo ki lobo bitum, ento loka pe bitum.”</char><verse eid="MAT 24:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ngat mo pe ma ngeyo nino kadi cawa meno</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:32-37">Mar 13:32-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:26-30">Luk 17:26-30</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 17:34-36">34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 24:36" />
    <char style="wj">Ento nino meno ki cawa meno, pe tye ngat mo ma ngeyo, kadi wa lumalaika ma i polo, kadi wa Wod, ento kono Lubanga Won keken aye ngeyo gire.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 24:37" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:37: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 6:5-8">Aca 6:5-8</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Kit macalo ceng otime ikare pa Nua, bitime kitmeno bene ikare me dwogo pa Wod pa dano.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 24:38" /><char style="wj">Ikare ca ma peya pii aluka ocore iwi lobo onongo dano gicamo, gimato, dok awobe ki anyira ginyome, nio wa inino ma Nua odonyo kwede i yeya.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 24:39" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:39: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 7:6-24">Aca 7:6-24</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Gin pe gumedo ki ngeyo gin mo nio ka pii aluka opong, ci omologi woko ducu. Bibedo kitmeno bene ikare ma Wod pa dano bidwogo iye.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 24:40" /><char style="wj">Ikare meno jo aryo bibedo i poto; kibikwanyo ngat acel, kibiweko ngat acel dong.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 24:41" /><char style="wj">Mon aryo bibedo ka rego kacel; kibikwanyo ngat acel, kibiweko ngat acel dong.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 24:42" /><char style="wj">Pimeno, wubed ma wangwu twolo, pien pe wungeyo nino ma Rwotwu bibino iye.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 24:43" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:43: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 12:39">Luk 12:39</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 12:40">40</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Ento myero wunge man, ni, kace nene won ot ongeyo cawa mene i dyewor ma lakwo onongo obibino kwede, kono obedo ka kiyo piny, kono pe oweko gituru ode.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 24:44" /><char style="wj">Pimeno, wun bene wubed ma wuyube; pien Wod pa dano bibino i cawa ma nongo pe wutamo pire.</char><verse eid="MAT 24:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Latic ma lagen ki ma pe lagen</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:41-48">Luk 12:41-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 24:45" />
    <char style="wj">“Anga ma lagwok ot ma lagen dok maryek, ma ladite biweko dano ducu ma bedo i ode ite loce, wek opok botgi camgi ikare mamite?</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 24:46" /><char style="wj">Latic meno tye ki gum, ma ladite ka obino nongo en tye katiyo tice kitmeno.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 24:47" /><char style="wj">Adada awaco botwu ni ladit meno bimiye twero me loyo jamine woko ducu.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 24:48" /><char style="wj">Ento ka latic meno oloko kekene ni, ‘Ladita dong ogale kabino,’</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 24:49" /><char style="wj">ci ocako goyo lutic luwote, kun camo, mato dok mer kacel ki lumero,</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 24:50" /><char style="wj">ladit pa latic meno bidwogo inino ma en pe tamo pi dwogone, dok i cawa ma en pe ngeyo.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 24:51" /><char style="wj">Ci ladite bipwode, ci kete kacel ki lugoba; kama dano gibibedo iye kakoko kun gikayo lakgi.”</char><verse eid="MAT 24:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="MAT 25" />
  <para style="s1">Carolok ikom anyira apar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 25:1" />
    <char style="wj">“Ikare meno ker me polo kibiporo ki anyira apar mayam gutero taragi, gucito ka jolo lanyom.</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 25:2" /><char style="wj">Jo abic ikin gi onongo lumingming, ki jo abic onongo luryeko.</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 25:3" /><char style="wj">Anyira ma gin lumingo ni gutero taragi labongo moo,</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 25:4" /><char style="wj">ento jo ma luryeko ni gutero moo i cupa kacel ki i taragi.</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 25:5" /><char style="wj">Ikare ma lanyom pud ogale, gin ducu nino omako wanggi, ci gunino woko.</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 25:6" /><char style="wj">Ka dong oo i cwiny dyewor woo owinye madwong ni, ‘Nen, lanyom dong bino ca! Wukat woko kajole.’</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 25:7" /><char style="wj">Anyira ca ducu gua cut, ci guyubu taragi.</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 25:8" /><char style="wj">Ento anyira ma gin lumingoni gulego anyira ma luryekoni, ni, ‘Wumii ki wan moowu ni mogo do, pien mac tarawa mito to woko.’</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 25:9" /><char style="wj">Ento anyira meno ma luryeko ni gudok iye botgi ni, ‘Nen calo moo ma watye kwede pe biromowa ki wun bene; myero wucit bot lucatwil, ci wuwil mewu.’</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 25:10" /><char style="wj">Ikare ma gucito ka wilo moo, cutcut lanyom obino; jo ma nene gitye ma guyube gudonyo kacel kwede i ot i karama me nyom, ci kiloro dogola woko.</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 25:11" /><char style="wj">Lacen anyira ca ma gin lumingo ni gubino, kun gibako dogi ni, ‘Ladit, ladit, yab dogola botwa do!’</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 25:12" /><char style="wj">Ento en odok iye botgi ni, ‘Adada awaco botwu ni, an gira pe angeyowu.’</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 25:13" /><char style="wj">Pimeno wubed atera wuki piny, pien pe wungeyo nino kadi wa cawa.</char><verse eid="MAT 25:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Carolok ikom talanta apar</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 19:11-27">Luk 19:11-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 25:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">25:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 19:11-27">Luk 19:11-27</ref>
      </char>
    </note> <char style="wj">Pien bibedo rom ki dano ma cito kawot i lobo mukene, ma olwongo lutice, ci oweko jamine i cinggi ni gulo.</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 25:15" /><char style="wj">Ci omiyo bot latic acel talanta abic, bot dano mukene omiyo talanta aryo, ki bot ngat mukene omiyo talanta acel. Omiyo bot dano acel acel dul lim kit macalo en romo tic kwede. Ci oa gire ocito i wote.</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 25:16" /><char style="wj">Dano ma onongo talanta abic ni ocako tic kwede woko oyotoyot i cato wile; onongo magoba talanta abic bene.</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 25:17" /><char style="wj">Ki ngat ma ogamo talanta aryo ni bene onongo magoba talanta aryo.</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 25:18" /><char style="wj">Ento dano ma nene ogamo talanta acel ni ocito okwinyo bur i ngom, ci okano lim pa ladite woko iye.</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 25:19" /><char style="wj">Ka dong kare okato malac, ladit pa lutic magi odwogo, ocako kwano lim kacel kwedgi.</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 25:20" /><char style="wj">Dano ma nene ogamo talanta abic ni okwongo bino anyim, kun okelo talanta abic mukene, owaco ni, ‘Ladit, nene imiya talanta abic; nen dok anongo talanta abic mukene.’</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 25:21" /><char style="wj">Ladite owaco bote ni, ‘Itimo ber mada, in latic maber dok lagen. Onongo ibedo lagen ikom jami matidi mo, abiketi dong ibedo ki twero ikom jami mapol. Dony i yomcwiny pa laditi.’</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 25:22" /><char style="wj">Lacen ngat ma kimiye talanta aryo ni bene obino anyim, owaco ni, ‘Ladit, onongo nene imiya talanta aryo; nen dok anongo talanta aryo mukene.’</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 25:23" /><char style="wj">Ladite owaco bote ni, ‘Itimo ber mada, in latic maber dok lagen. Onongo ibedo lagen ikom jami matidi mo, abiketi dong ibedo ki twero ikom jami mapol. Dony i yomcwiny pa laditi.’</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 25:24" /><char style="wj">Ka dok ngat ma nene ogamo talanta aceli bene obino anyim, owaco ni, ‘Ladit, onongo angeyo ni in dano ma kiti tek, ikayo kama yam pe icoyo iye kodi, icoko bene kama pe iketo;</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 25:25" /><char style="wj">oweko abedo ki lworo, acito akano limi woko piny i ngom. Ene, gam giri limi.’</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 25:26" /><char style="wj">Ento ladite odoke iye ni, ‘In latic marac dok bene in lawackom! Onongo ingeyo ni akayo kama pe acoyo iye kodi, dok bene acoko kama yam pe aketo iye?</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 25:27" /><char style="wj">Gin ango mugengi tero lima bot jo maloyo benge, wek ikare ma abino agam lima kacel ki magobane?</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 25:28" /><char style="wj">Pimeno wukwany talanta aceli woko ki bote, wumii bot ngat matye ki talanta aparni.</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 25:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 13:12">Mat 13:12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:25">Mar 4:25</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:18">Luk 8:18</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Pien dano acel acel matye ki gin mo, kibimiye doki makato, ci en bibedo ki jami mabup. Ento ngat ma peke ki gin mo, kadi wa gin ma en tye kwede kibikwanyo woko ki bote.</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 25:30" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 8:12">Mat 8:12</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 22:13">22:13</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Wubol latic ma konye peke ni i colpiny matye woko, kama dano gibikok kun gikayo iye lakgi.’</char><verse eid="MAT 25:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ngolo kop ikom rok ducu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 25:31" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">25:31: a </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 16:27">Mat 16:27</ref>; </char>
      <char style="xo" closed="false">b </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 19:28">Mat 19:28</ref>
      </char>
    </note> <char style="wj">Ikare ma Wod pa dano bidwogo ki deyo kacel ki lumalaikane ducu, ci en bibedo iwi komkere me deyo.</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 25:32" /><char style="wj">Rok ducu bicoke kacel inyime, ci en bipoko kin gi woko patpat, kit macalo lakwat poko kwede romi ki ikom dyegi.</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 25:33" /><char style="wj">Biketo romi itung cinge ma lacuc, ento dyegi en biketo itung cinge ma lacam.</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 25:34" /><char style="wj">Ci Rwot biwaco bot jo matye tung cinge ma lacuc ni, ‘Wubin, wun jo ma Wora omiyowu gum, wule ker mayam kiyubu pirwu cake wa i acaki me lobo.</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 25:35" /><char style="wj">Pien ma nene onongo kec oneka, wun wumiya cam, orwo oneka, wumiya pii amato, onongo awelo, wun wujola;</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 25:36" /><char style="wj">ma nene onongo atye munero, wuruku bongo ikoma, ma koma obedo lit, wubino ka lima, dok ikare ma atye ibuc, wun wubino wulima.’</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 25:37" /><char style="wj">Ci jo ma kitgi atir bidok iye bote ni, ‘Rwot, yam waneni awene ka kec neki, ci wamii cam, nyo ka orwo neki, ci wamii pii imato?</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 25:38" /><char style="wj">Yam waneni awene ka iwelo, ci wajoli; nyo ka itye munero, ci waruku bongo ikomi?</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 25:39" /><char style="wj">Dok onongo waneni awene ka komi lit nyo ka itye ibuc, ci walimi?’</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 25:40" /><char style="wj">Rwot bidok iye botgi ni, ‘Adada awaco botwu ni gin ma wutimo bot dano acel ikin utmegina magi matino ni, meno wutimo bota.’</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 25:41" /><char style="wj">Lacen en dong biwaco bot jo matye tung cinge ma lacam ni, ‘Wun jo ma kiceno, wua woko ki inyima, wudony i mac ma pe to ma kiyubu pi Catan ki lumalaikane.</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 25:42" /><char style="wj">Pien ma nene kec neka, wun pe wumiya cam, orwo pii oneka, pe bene wumiya pii me amata;</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 25:43" /><char style="wj">yam awelo, ento pe wujola, onongo atye munero ci pe wuruku bongo ikoma, nene koma lit dok abedo ibuc, ento wun pe wubino ka lima.’</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 25:44" /><char style="wj">Gin bene gibidoke iye ni, ‘Rwot, waneni awene ka kec neki nyo ka orwo neki, nyo ka iwelo, nyo ka itye munero, nyo ka komi lit, nyo ka itye ibuc, ci pe wakonyi?’</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 25:45" /><char style="wj">En bidok iye botgi ni, ‘Adada awaco botwu ni, kit macalo pe wutimo bot dano mo acel ikin jo magi matino, pe wutimo bota.’</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 25:46" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:46: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 12:2">Dan 12:2</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Ci gibicito woko i can ma pe tum, ento jo ma kitgi atir bicito i kwo ma pe tum.”</char><verse eid="MAT 25:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="MAT 26" />
  <para style="s1">Ludito gupiro lok ikom Yecu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Mar 14:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Luk 22:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Jon 11:45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 26:1" />Ikare ma Yecu dong otyeko loko lok magi ducu, owaco bot lupwonyene ni, <verse eid="MAT 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 26:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:1-27">Nia 12:1-27</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">“Odong nino aryo ci bedo Karama me Kato,</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Paska </char></note> <char style="wj">ci Wod pa dano kibimiye woko me agura ikom yatariya.”</char><verse eid="MAT 26:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 26:3" />Ikare meno ajwaki madito pa Lubanga ki ludongo pa lwak gucoke i gangkal pa ajwaka madit pa Lubanga, ma nyinge Kayapa. <verse eid="MAT 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 26:4" />Ci guporo lok kacel me mako Yecu ki ryeko ka dong gineke. <verse eid="MAT 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 26:5" />Ento guwaco ni, “Pe obed inino madit, pien miyo lwak bituge.”<verse eid="MAT 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kiwiro Yecu ki moo i Betania</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:3-9">Mar 14:3-9</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:1-8">Jon 12:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 26:6" />Ikare ma Yecu tye i Betania i ot pa Cimon ladobo, <verse eid="MAT 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 26:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 7:37-38">Luk 7:37-38</ref></char></note>ci dako mo obino bote kun tye ki adomo moo ma ngwece kur, ma wele bene dit, ci oonyo iwiye ma onongo en obedo ka cam. <verse eid="MAT 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 26:8" />Ento ma lupwonye guneno, cwinygi ocwer, guwaco ni, “Pingo moo man gibalo abala kit man? <verse eid="MAT 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 26:9" />Pien moo man ka kono kicato acata, onongo kono okelo lim madit atika, ka wek gimi bot lucan.” <verse eid="MAT 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 26:10" />Ento Yecu ongeyo lok man, ci owaco botgi ni, <char style="wj">“Wuyelo dako ni pingo? En otiyo gin maber tutwal ikoma.</char> <verse eid="MAT 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 26:11" /><char style="wj">Pien wun wutye kacel ki lucan kare ducu, ento pe wubibedo kweda kare ducu.</char> <verse eid="MAT 26:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 26:12" /><char style="wj">Moo man ma dako ni oonyo ikoma ni en otimo man pi yubu koma me ayika.</char> <verse eid="MAT 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 26:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 15:11">Nwo 15:11</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Adada awaco botwu ni, iwi lobo ducu kama kibitito iye lok man me Kwena Maber ni, gin ma dako ni otiyo bene kibitito pire, wek obed me nipo pi en.”</char><verse eid="MAT 26:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Juda oye dobo Yecu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:10-11">Mar 14:10-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:3-6">Luk 22:3-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 26:14" />Ikare meno Juda Lakeriot, ma en dano acel ma ikin jo apar wiye aryo ni, ocito bot ajwaki madito pa Lubanga, <verse eid="MAT 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 26:15" />ci openyogi ni, “Wubimiya gin ango ka amiyo Yecu i cingwu?” Ci gucule ki lim ryal pyere adek. <verse eid="MAT 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 26:16" />Cake i cawa meno cutcut Juda ocako yenyo kare maber ma en etwero miyo kwede Yecu i cinggi.<verse eid="MAT 26:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yecu ocamo Karama me Kato ki lupwonyene</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:12-21">Mar 14:12-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:7-14">Luk 22:7-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:21-23">22:21-23</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Jon 13:21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 26:17" />Inino mukwongo me nino madito me Mugati ma Tobi Peke Iye, lupwonye gubino bot Yecu, ci gupenye ni, “Imito waciyubi kabedo kwene wek icam iye Karama me Kato?”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Paska </char></note><verse eid="MAT 26:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 26:18" />Yecu ogamo ni, <char style="wj">“Wucit i Jerucalem bot dano moni, ci wuwac bote ni, ‘Lapwony owaco ni, Kare na dong cok. Abicamo Karama me Kato i odi kacel ki lupwonyena.’”</char> <verse eid="MAT 26:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 26:19" />Lupwonye gucito gutiyo kit macalo Yecu ocikogi kwede, ci guyubu cam me Kato<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Paska</char></note> kunu.<verse eid="MAT 26:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 26:20" />Ma piny dong oyutu, ci Yecu obedo piny kacel ki lupwonye apar wiye aryo. <verse eid="MAT 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 26:21" />Ikare madong gitye kacam, Yecu owaco botgi ni, <char style="wj">“Adada, awaco botwu ni, ngat acel ikinwu bidoba.”</char><verse eid="MAT 26:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 26:22" />Ci lupwonye gucako kumu cut, kun gipenye ki acel acel ni, “An bo, Rwot?” <verse eid="MAT 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 26:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 41:9">Jab 41:9</ref></char></note> Yecu odok iye ni, <char style="wj">“Dano matye ka gweyo dek i atabo acel kwedani aye bidoba.</char> <verse eid="MAT 26:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 26:24" /><char style="wj">Wod pa dano tye kawot kit macalo yam kicoyo ikome ni; ento dano ma odobo Wod pa danoni bineno can marac! Kono nene obedo ber ka dano man pe kinywalo.”</char> <verse eid="MAT 26:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 26:25" />Juda ma en ngat ma odobe openye bene ni, “Lapwony, an mono?” Yecu odoke iye ni, <char style="wj">“In iwaco giri kitmeno.”</char><verse eid="MAT 26:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Cam me otyeno pa Rwotwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:22-26">Mar 14:22-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:15-20">Luk 22:15-20</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-26">1 Kor 11:23-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 26:26" />Ka gitye kacamo cam, Yecu omako mugati, ci olego gum ikome, ka ocako baro iye, omiyo bot lupwonye, kun waco ni, <char style="wj">“Wugam, wucam; man aye koma.”</char> <verse eid="MAT 26:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 26:27" />Ka dok otingo kikopo, ka dong opwoyo Lubanga, ci omiyo botgi, kun waco ni, <char style="wj">“Wun ducu wumat man;</char> <verse eid="MAT 26:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 26:28" /><char style="wj">pien man aye remona me gicike, ma oo pi jo mapol pi weko bal.</char> <verse eid="MAT 26:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 26:29" /><char style="wj">Atito botwu ni, cake tin, pe dok abimato pig olok, nio wa inino maca ka abimatone doki kacel kwedwu i ker pa Wora.”</char> <verse eid="MAT 26:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 26:30" />Ikare madong gutyeko wero wer, gua gucito iwi got Jeituni.<verse eid="MAT 26:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yecu otito ni Petero bikwere woko</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Mar 14:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luk 22:31-34</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Jon 13:36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 26:31" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">26:31: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ZEC 13:7">Jek 13:7</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Yecu owaco botgi ni, <char style="wj">“I dyewor ma tin ni, wun ducu wubitenya woko kena, pien yam kicoyo ni, ‘Abigoyo lakwat, ci romi gibiket woko ata.’</char> <verse eid="MAT 26:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 26:32" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:32: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 28:16">Mat 28:16</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Ento lacen ka dong acer woko abitelo nyimwu me cito i Galilaya.”</char><verse eid="MAT 26:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 26:33" />Petero owaco bot Yecu ni, “Kadi bed jo mukene ducu gibitenyi woko, ento an pe abitenyi ata.”<verse eid="MAT 26:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 26:34" />Yecu owaco bote ni, <char style="wj">“Adada awaco ni, tin ki i dyewor, ma nongo twon gweno peya okok, ibikwera woko tyen adek.”</char><verse eid="MAT 26:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 26:35" />Ento Petero dok ogamo ni, “Kadi bed mite ni myero ato kacel kwedi, pe abikweri.” Lupwonye mukene ni bene ducu guwaco kitmeno.<verse eid="MAT 26:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yecu olego Lubanga i poto Gececemane</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:32-42">Mar 14:32-42</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:39-46">Luk 22:39-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 26:36" />Lacen Yecu ocito kwedgi i kabedo mo ma nyinge Gececemane, ci ociko lupwonyene ni, <char style="wj">“Wun kong wubed kany, an kong acit kuca kalego Lubanga.”</char> <verse eid="MAT 26:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 26:37" />Okwanyo Petero ki awobe pa Jebedayo aryo me wot kwede. Cwinye ocako poto matek ki kumu bene madwong. <verse eid="MAT 26:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 26:38" />Owaco botgi ni, <char style="wj">“Atye ki arem cwiny matek ma mito neka woko. Wubed piny kany kacel kweda ma wangwu twolo.”</char> <verse eid="MAT 26:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 26:39" />Ocako cito anyim manok, ci ogungo oryebe piny olego ni, <char style="wj">“Wora, kace i mito, kwany kikopo man woko ki ikoma; ento pe obed kit macalo an amito, ento wek gin ma in i mito aye myero otime.”</char> <verse eid="MAT 26:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 26:40" />Ka oa odwogo bot lupwonye onongo gunino woko, ci owaco bot Petero ni, <char style="wj">“Pe itwero bedo ma wangi twolo pi cawa acel mo kacel kweda?</char> <verse eid="MAT 26:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 26:41" /><char style="wj">Wubed ma wangwu twolo, wuleg Lubanga, wek pe wudony i abita mo; cwiny kikome mito, ento kom aye nyap.”</char> <verse eid="MAT 26:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 26:42" />Dok odok kalego Lubanga tyen me aryo kun lego ni, <char style="wj">“Wora, ka kikopo man pe twero kato ma pe amato, wek gin ma i mito otime.”</char> <verse eid="MAT 26:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 26:43" />Dok odwogo onongo gunino woko, pien onongo nino dong omako wanggi tutwal. <verse eid="MAT 26:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 26:44" />Ka dok owekogi ocito olego Lubanga tyen me adeke, kun nwoyo lego lega aceli. <verse eid="MAT 26:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 26:45" />Ka oa odwogo bot lupwonye ci openyogi ni, <char style="wj">“Wun pud wunino ce? Pud wutye kayweyo bo? Nen, cawa dong oromo, me miyo Wod pa dano i cing lubalo.</char> <verse eid="MAT 26:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 26:46" /><char style="wj">Dong wua malo, wacitu; nen dano ma doba dong oo.”</char><verse eid="MAT 26:46" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kimako Yecu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Mar 14:43-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luk 22:47-53</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:2-11">Jon 18:2-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 26:47" />Ikare ma Yecu pud tye kalok, Juda otugi bino; en yam ngat acel ikin jo apar wiye aryo ni. Obino ki lwak ma gua bot ajwaki madito pa Lubanga ki ludongo pa lwak, kun gitye ki pala lucwan ki odo gu. <verse eid="MAT 26:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 26:48" />Juda ma odobe ni yam omiyo botgi lanyut. En owaco ni, “Dano ma abimoto kun anoto leme, meno aye en kikome; wutugi makone woko.” <verse eid="MAT 26:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 26:49" />Cutcut obino bot Yecu atir, ocako mote ni, “Lapwony itye!” Ci onoto leme. <verse eid="MAT 26:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 26:50" />Yecu owaco bot Juda ni, <char style="wj">“Larema, ibino kany pingo?”</char> Ci gubino gutugi poto ikome, gumake woko cut. <verse eid="MAT 26:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 26:51" />Ento dano mo acel ikom jo ma onongo gin tye kacel ki Yecu owoto pala lucwane, otongo ki opii pa ajwaka madit pa Lubanga, onguno ite woko. <verse eid="MAT 26:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 26:52" />Ci Yecu owaco ki dano meno ni, <char style="wj">“Dwok pala lucwani kakare i akura; pien jo ducu ma mako pala lucwan, kibinekogi bene ki pala lucwan.</char> <verse eid="MAT 26:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 26:53" /><char style="wj">Itamo ni pe atwero lego Wora wek ocwala lumalaika makato dul mony apar wiye aryo woko, i cawa man?</char> <verse eid="MAT 26:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 26:54" /><char style="wj">Ci lok mayam kicoyo i ginacoya ni dong bicobbe kakare ningning, ni myero obed kitmeno?”</char> <verse eid="MAT 26:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 26:55" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:55: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 19:47">Luk 19:47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:37">21:37</ref></char></note> Ikare meno Yecu owaco bot lwak ni, <char style="wj">“Wubino bota ki pala lucwan ki odo gu me maka, macalo wubino ikom layak? Abedo ka pwony i Ot pa Lubanga jwijwi, ci pe yam wumaka do.</char> <verse eid="MAT 26:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 26:56" /><char style="wj">Ento gin magi ducu dong otime, wek lok mayam kicoyo i buk pa lunebi ocobe kakare.”</char> Cutcut lupwonye gubwote ci guringo woko.<verse eid="MAT 26:56" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yecu ocung inyim jo me Otkot kapido</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:53-65">Mar 14:53-65</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:54-55">Luk 22:54-55</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:63-71">22:63-71</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:12-14">Jon 18:12-14</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">18:19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 26:57" />Jo ma gumako Yecu gutere bot Kayapa ajwaka madit pa Lubanga, kama onongo Lupwonycik ki ludongo gucoke iye. <verse eid="MAT 26:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 26:58" />Ento Petero obedo kalubu kor Yecu ki cencen, nio kwede wa idyekal pa ajwaka madit. En odonyo ci obedo kacel ki lukur piny kun kuru wek enen gin ma bitime.<verse eid="MAT 26:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="MAT 26:59" />Ajwaki madito ki jo ma i Otkot ducu guyenyo lok me caden me goba ikom Yecu wek kineke woko. <verse eid="MAT 26:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MAT 26:60" />Ento pe gumedo ki nongo lok mo, kadi bed lucaden ma lugoba mapol gukelo lok goba. Me agikine jo aryo gubino, <verse eid="MAT 26:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MAT 26:61" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:61: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 2:19">Jon 2:19</ref></char></note> guwaco ni, “Dano man owaco ni, ‘Atwero keto Ot pa Lubanga, ka dok agero dok kakare inino adek.’”<verse eid="MAT 26:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MAT 26:62" />Cutcut ajwaka madit pa Lubanga oa malo ci owaco ni, “Pe idok iye lok mo? Kit lok ango ma joni gudoti kwede ni?” <verse eid="MAT 26:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MAT 26:63" />Ento Yecu oling woko alinga. Ajwaka madit pa Lubanga dok owaco ni, “Amito ikwong kwong ki nying Lubanga makwo, tit botwa kace in aye i Kricito ma Lubanga oyero, Wod pa Lubanga.”<verse eid="MAT 26:63" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="MAT 26:64" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">26:64: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DAN 7:13">Dan 7:13</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Yecu odoke iye ni, <char style="wj">“In iwaco giri kitmeno; ento awaco botwu ni, cake kombedi wubineno Wod pa dano ka obedo piny i kabedo me deyo ka nget Won Twer tung lacuc, kun bino ki pol me polo.”</char><verse eid="MAT 26:64" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="MAT 26:65" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">26:65: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 24:16">Lev 24:16</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Ci ajwaka madit pa Lubanga oyeco ginarukane woko kekene, kun waco ni, “Oyeto Lubanga; pud dok wumito caden me ngo? Kombedi dong wuwinyo kit ma en oyeto kwede Lubanga. <verse eid="MAT 26:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="MAT 26:66" />Wutamo iye lok ango?” Gudoke iye ni, “Bale rome to.”<verse eid="MAT 26:66" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="MAT 26:67" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">26:67: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 50:6">Ica 50:6</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Cutcut gungulu laa i wange, ka gudonge. Jo mogo gudonge kun giwaco ni, <verse eid="MAT 26:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="MAT 26:68" />“In lanebi ni! In Kricito ma Lubanga oyero ni, tuci! Anga mugoyi?”<verse eid="MAT 26:68" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Petero okwero Yecu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:66-72">Mar 14:66-72</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:56-62">Luk 22:56-62</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:15-18">Jon 18:15-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">18:25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="MAT 26:69" />Petero onongo tye woko, obedo piny idyekal. Ci angeca mo obino bote, owaco ni, “In bene onongo itye kacel ki Yecu Lagalilaya.”<verse eid="MAT 26:69" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="MAT 26:70" />Ento Petero okwero woko inyim dano ducu, kun waco ni, “An pe aniang gin ma itye kaloko ni.” <verse eid="MAT 26:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="MAT 26:71" />Ka Petero okato woko i dog gang, angeca mukene dok onene, ci owaco bot jo ma onongo gucung kunu ni, “Dano man bene onongo tye kacel ki Yecu me Najaret.”<verse eid="MAT 26:71" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="MAT 26:72" />Petero dok okwero woko kun kwonge akwonga ni, “An gira pe angeyo dano man.” <verse eid="MAT 26:72" /><verse number="73" style="v" sid="MAT 26:73" />Ka kare okato manoknok, jo ma onongo gucung kenyo gubino guwaco bot Petero ni, “Adada, in ingat acel ikin gi, pien kit ma iloko kwede nyuti woko.” <verse eid="MAT 26:73" /><verse number="74" style="v" sid="MAT 26:74" />Petero ocako kwonge kun lame kekene ni, “Pe angeyo dano man.” Cutcut twon gweno otugi kok. <verse eid="MAT 26:74" /><verse number="75" style="v" sid="MAT 26:75" />Ci Petero ocako po lok ma onongo Yecu owaco ni, <char style="wj">“Ma nongo twon gweno peya okok, nongo in dong ikwera woko tyen adek kulu.”</char> Ci okato woko okok ki cwercwiny madwong.<verse eid="MAT 26:75" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="MAT 27" />
  <para style="s1">Yecu ocung inyim Pilato</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:1">Mar 15:1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-2">Luk 23:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-32">Jon 18:28-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 27:1" />Ka piny dong oru, ajwaki madito pa Lubanga ki ludongo pa lwak guporo lok ikom Yecu kit ma myero gineke kwede. <verse eid="MAT 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 27:2" />Ci gutweye gutere gumiye bot Pilato ma onongo laloc ikare meno.<verse eid="MAT 27:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">To pa Juda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="ACT 1:18-19">Tic 1:18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 27:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">27:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 1:18">Tic 1:18</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 1:19">19</ref></char>
    </note> Ka Juda, ngat mayam odobe ni, oneno ni dong kingolo kop oloyo Yecu, ongut ci odwoko lim ryal pyere adek ca bot ajwaki madito pa Lubanga ki ludongo. <verse eid="MAT 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 27:4" />Ci owaco botgi ni, “Abalo pi dobo dano ma peke ki bal.” Gudoke iye ni, “Meno obedo lokwa bo? Meno loki giri.” <verse eid="MAT 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 27:5" />Juda obolo lim piny i ngom i Ot pa Lubanga, ci ocito odene woko. <verse eid="MAT 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 27:6" />Ento ajwaki madito gukwanyo lim meno kun giwaco ni, “Cik pe ye ni myero kiket lim man i kica lim me Ot pa Lubanga, pien ki wilo ki remo.” <verse eid="MAT 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 27:7" />Ci guporo lok kacel, guwilo lim meno woko ki poto pa lacwe agulu, odoko ka yiko lurok. <verse eid="MAT 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 27:8" />Pimeno omiyo kilwongo poto meno ni poto me remo nio wa onyo. <verse eid="MAT 27:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 27:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 11:12">Jek 11:12</ref>,<ref loc="ZEC 11:13">13</ref></char></note> Ma omiyo lok mayam lanebi Jeremia oloko ocobe kakare ni, “Yam gutero lim ryal pyere adek, en wel ma jo mogo ikin jo Icrael gungolo, <verse eid="MAT 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 27:10" />ci kimiyo pi poto pa lacwe agulu kit macalo Rwot ociko kwede.”<verse eid="MAT 27:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yecu inyim Pilato</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:2-5">Mar 15:2-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:3-5">Luk 23:3-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:33-38">Jon 18:33-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 27:11" />Yecu ocung inyim laloc ci laloc openye ni, “In i Rwot pa Lujudaya bo?” Yecu ogamo ni, <char style="wj">“In iwaco gire kitmeno.”</char> <verse eid="MAT 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 27:12" />Ento ikare ma ajwaki madito pa Lubanga ki ludongo gudote, en pe ogamo iye gin mo. <verse eid="MAT 27:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 27:13" />Pilato openye ni, “Pe iwinyo kit lwak adot mapol ma gidoti kwede ni?” <verse eid="MAT 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 27:14" />Ento Yecu pe odok iye lok mo kadi ki acel ilok ducu ma kikelo ikome; man omiyo laloc ouru tutwal.<verse eid="MAT 27:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kingolo to iwi Yecu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:6-15">Mar 15:6-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Luk 23:13-25</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39-19:16">Jon 18:39—19:16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 27:15" />Inino madito me Karama me Kato<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Paska</char></note> onongo yam Pilato gonyo iye lamabuc acel ma lwak mito. <verse eid="MAT 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 27:16" />Ikare meno onongo gitye ki lamabuc mo ma ngene ma nyinge Baraba. <verse eid="MAT 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 27:17" />Ma dong lwak gucoke kacel, Pilato openyogi ni, “Wumito ni agony botwu anga, Baraba nyo Yecu ma kilwongo Kricito?” <verse eid="MAT 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 27:18" />Pien Pilato onongo ongeyo woko ni gumiyo Yecu bote pi nyeko.<verse eid="MAT 27:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 27:19" />Dok bene ikare madong Pilato obedo iwi kom me ngolo kop, dakone ocwalo kwena bote ni, “Pe i tim gin mo ikom dano man ma kite atir ni, pien lek tin oyela mada pire.”<verse eid="MAT 27:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 27:20" />Ento ajwaki madito pa Lubanga ki ludongo gubito lwak ni myero gupeny pi Baraba, guwek kinek Yecu woko. <verse eid="MAT 27:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 27:21" />Laloc me lobo dok openyogi ni, “Ikin jo aryo ni wumito agony botwu anga?” Lwak gudoke iye ni, “Baraba.” <verse eid="MAT 27:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 27:22" />Pilato dok openyogi ni, “Ci Yecu ma kilwongo Kricito ni dong abitimo ningning?” Gin ducu gudoke iye ni, “Wek kigure ikom yatariya.” <verse eid="MAT 27:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 27:23" />Pilato dok openyogi ni, “Pingo kaa, otimo kit gin ango marac?” Ento lwak gumede ki woo ni, “Wek kigure woko ikom yatariya.” <verse eid="MAT 27:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 27:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 21:6-9">Nwo 21:6-9</ref></char></note> Ma Pilato oneno ni lok man dong pe twere, pien woo onongo tye ka mede ameda, ci okwanyo pii, olwoko ki cinge inyim lwak kun waco ni, “Bal me remo pa dano man gire pe ikoma, lokwu giwu.” <verse eid="MAT 27:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 27:25" />Dano ducu gugamo ni, “Remone obed iwiwa ki iwi lutinowa!” <verse eid="MAT 27:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 27:26" />Ci ogonyo botgi Baraba; ka lacen madong otyeko goyo Yecu ki del omiye woko ni kigure ikom yatariya.<verse eid="MAT 27:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Acikari gungalo Yecu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:16-20">Mar 15:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:2-3">Jon 19:2-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 27:27" />Acikari pa laloc gutero Yecu wa idye kal pa laloc lobo, ci gucoko buca monygi ducu inyime. <verse eid="MAT 27:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 27:28" />Gulunyo bongine woko ki ikome, ka dong guruke ki bongo makwar. <verse eid="MAT 27:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 27:29" />Gucweyo lalukana okutu, gurwako iwiye, ci guketo odo lagada i cinge ma lacuc. Gurumu cong gi piny inyime, gucako ngale kun giwaco ni, “Itye ba, Rwot pa Lujudaya!” <verse eid="MAT 27:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 27:30" />Gungulu laa ikome, gukwanyo odo lagada ci gugoyo ki wiye. <verse eid="MAT 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 27:31" />Ka dong gutyeko ngale, ci gulunyo bongo makwar woko ki ikome, ka dok guruke ki bongine kikome, ci gutere kwede woko ka gure ikom yatariya.<verse eid="MAT 27:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kiguro Yecu ikom yatariya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Mar 15:21-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luk 23:26-43</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Jon 19:17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 27:32" />Ikare ma gitye kakato woko, gurwate ki dano mo me Cirene ma nyinge Cimon, ci gudiye tektek me tingo yatariya pa Yecu. <verse eid="MAT 27:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 27:33" />Ikare ma guo i kabedo ma kilwongo ni Golgota, ma teloke ni kabedo me cogo wic, <verse eid="MAT 27:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 27:34" />gumiye kongo bwino ma kirubu ki keda ni omati, ento ikare ma en obilo, ci pe oye matone. <verse eid="MAT 27:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 27:35" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:35: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:18">Jab 22:18</ref></char></note> Madong gugure ikom yatariya, ci gupoko bongine woko ikin gi kun gibolo iye kwir. <verse eid="MAT 27:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 27:36" />Ka lacen dong gubedo piny kunu ka kiye. <verse eid="MAT 27:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 27:37" />Lok me adot ma kidote kwede ni kiguro malo ka wiye, kun kicoyo ni, “Man aye Yecu Rwot pa Lujudaya.” <verse eid="MAT 27:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 27:38" />Kigure kacel ki luyak mogo aryo, dano acel tung lacuc ki acel tung lacam. <verse eid="MAT 27:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 27:39" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:39: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:7">Jab 22:7</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 109:25">109:25</ref></char></note> Jo ma gimol gikato ki ka ngete gubedo ka yete, kun giyengo wigi, <verse eid="MAT 27:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 27:40" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:40: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:61">Mat 26:61</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:19">Jon 2:19</ref></char></note> ma giwaco ni, “Nye, in ma imuku Ot pa Lubanga woko, ci igero pi nino adek ni, dong ilare keni ba! Kace in i Wod pa Lubanga, lor woko piny ki ikom yatariya.”<verse eid="MAT 27:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 27:41" />Ki ajwaki madito pa Lubanga ki Lupwonycik ki ludongo bene gungale kitmeno kun giwaco ni, <verse eid="MAT 27:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 27:42" />“En laro jo mukene, pe twero lare kene. Ka en Rwot pa jo Icrael; wek olor piny ki ikom yatariya, ci wabiye en. <verse eid="MAT 27:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 27:43" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:43: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:8">Jab 22:8</ref></char></note> En geno Lubanga, wek Lubanga kong olare kombedi, ka mite; pien yam owaco ni, ‘An a Wod pa Lubanga.’” <verse eid="MAT 27:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 27:44" />Ki luyak bene ma onongo kigurogi kacel kwede gucaye ikit acelu.<verse eid="MAT 27:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yecu oto</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Mar 15:33-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luk 23:44-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Jon 19:28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 27:45" />Cake i cawa abicel, piny ocido woko macol i lobo ducu, nio wa i cawa abongwen. <verse eid="MAT 27:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 27:46" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:46: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:1">Jab 22:1</ref></char></note> I kine me cawa abongwen Yecu odange ki dwon malongo ni, <char style="wj">“Eloi, Eloi, lama cabaktani?”</char> ma teloke ni, <char style="wj">“Lubangana, Lubangana, itenya woko pingo?”</char> <verse eid="MAT 27:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 27:47" />Ka jo ma onongo gucung kunu guwinyo loke, ci guwaco ni, “Laco man tye kalwongo Eliya.” <verse eid="MAT 27:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 27:48" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:48: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 69:21">Jab 69:21</ref></char></note> Cutcut dano acel ikin gi oringo okwanyo amor, ci olutu i kongo bwino mawac, orwako iwi tal lagada, ka omiyo bot Yecu ni omati. <verse eid="MAT 27:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 27:49" />Ento jo mukene guwaco ni, “Kong wukur, wek mono wanen ka Eliya bino ka lare.” <verse eid="MAT 27:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 27:50" />Yecu dok odange ki dwon malongo, ka dong cwinye otum.<verse eid="MAT 27:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 27:51" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">27:51: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 26:31-33">Nia 26:31-33</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Ci nen, bongo kicika ma i Ot pa Lubanga oyec opoke woko i dul aryo, cake ki malo, nio kwede wa i tere piny. Piny oyenge, pata gubar woko; <verse eid="MAT 27:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 27:52" />ki lyel bene doggi oyabe woko, ci kom jo maleng mapol mayam guto gucer woko. <verse eid="MAT 27:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 27:53" />Gukati woko ki i lyelgi ikare ma Yecu dong ocer, gucito i Jerucalem gunyute bot jo mapol.<verse eid="MAT 27:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 27:54" />Ladit maloyo acikari kacel ki jo ma onongo gitye kwede, ma gubedo ka kiyo Yecu, ka guneno kit ma piny oyenge kwede ki gin madong otyeko time, gubedo ki lworo madit mada, ci guwaco ni, “Adada, man onongo Wod pa Lubanga!”<verse eid="MAT 27:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 27:55" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">27:55: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 8:2">Luk 8:2</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 8:3">3</ref></char>
    </note> Dok bene onongo nene tye mon mapol kunu ma gucung ki cen ka nenone, ma gulubu kor Yecu cake ki i Galilaya, ma gubedo ka konye bene. <verse eid="MAT 27:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 27:56" />Ikin mon magi onongo tye iye Maliam Lamagdala ki Maliam min Yakobo ki Yucepu, ki min awobe pa Jebedayo.<verse eid="MAT 27:56" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kiyiko kom Yecu i lyel</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Mar 15:42-47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luk 23:50-56</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Jon 19:38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 27:57" />Ki i otyeno me nino meno, dano mo ma lalonyo me Arimataya ma nyinge Yucepu obino; en kikome bene onongo yam obedo lapwonye pa Yecu. <verse eid="MAT 27:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 27:58" />Ocito bot Pilato ci olego kom Yecu. Ci Pilato ociko ni kimiye. <verse eid="MAT 27:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MAT 27:59" />Yucepu okwanyo kom Yecu, ci oboyo woko ki bongo matar maryeny ni dangdang, <verse eid="MAT 27:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MAT 27:60" />ka opyelo i lyel ma mege kikome manyen, mayam onongo okwinyo oroko i got; ci ongilo got madit oloro ki dog lyel, ka dong oa ocito gire. <verse eid="MAT 27:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MAT 27:61" />Maliam Lamagdala ki Maliam mukene ni bene onongo gitye kunu gubedo piny gukeme ki lyel.<verse eid="MAT 27:61" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lukur piny ma gurumu lyel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MAT 27:62" />Orwone, ma en aye nino malubu nino me Yube, ajwaki madito pa Lubanga ki Luparicayo gucoke inyim Pilato, <verse eid="MAT 27:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MAT 27:63" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:63: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 16:21">Mat 16:21</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 17:23">17:23</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 20:19">20:19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:31">Mar 8:31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:31">9:31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:33">10:33</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 10:34">34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:22">Luk 9:22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:31-33">18:31-33</ref></char></note> guwaco bote ni, “Ladit, wapo kit ma dano man ma lagoba ni oloko kwede, ikare ma pud en kwo. En owaco ni, ‘I nge nino adek abicer woko doki.’ <verse eid="MAT 27:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MAT 27:64" />Pimeno cik kigwok lyel maber adada nio wa inino me adeke, wek lupwonyene pe gucit gukwal kome woko, kun giwaco bot lwak ni, ‘En dong ocer woko ki ikin jo ma oto’, man bimiyo bwola man bedo rac makato mukwongo ca.”<verse eid="MAT 27:64" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="MAT 27:65" />Pilato owaco botgi ni, “Wutye ki acikari ma gin lukur piny; wucit, wugwok maber mada kit macalo wutwero.”<verse eid="MAT 27:65" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="MAT 27:66" />Ci gucito guloro dog lyel woko maber kun kimwono lanen iye ikom got, ka guketo lukur piny me gwokone.<verse eid="MAT 27:66" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="MAT 28" />
  <para style="s1">Yecu ocer</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">Mar 16:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luk 24:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Jon 20:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 28:1" />Ka ceng Cabit dong okato, ikine me okokgweno me nino mukwongo me Cabit, Maliam Lamagdala ki Maliam mukene gucito kaneno lyel. <verse eid="MAT 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 28:2" />Ento oyengyeng madit oyengo piny; pien lamalaika pa Rwot olor ki ipolo obino piny ci ongilo got woko ki i dog lyel, ka obedo iwiye. <verse eid="MAT 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 28:3" />Lamalaika meno onongo nen calo lutkot ma wil, ki ginarukane onongo nen matar calo pee. <verse eid="MAT 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 28:4" />Pi lworo en omiyo lukur piny komgi omyel, ci gudoko calo jo ma oto. <verse eid="MAT 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 28:5" />Ento lamalaika owaco bot mon meno ni, “Pe wulwor; pien angeyo ni wutye kayenyo Yecu mayam kiguro ikom yatariya ni. <verse eid="MAT 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 28:6" />Pe tye kany, pien ocer woko kit macalo nene en owaco. Wubin wunen kama onongo en obutu iye. <verse eid="MAT 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 28:7" />Ci wucit oyotoyot wutit bot lupwonyene ni en dong ocer woko ki ikin jo ma oto, nen, en dong okwongo nyimwu me cito i Galilaya; wun wubinene ki kunu. Nen, dong atyeko tito botwu.”<verse eid="MAT 28:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 28:8" />Ci gua woko ki iwi lyel oyotoyot ki lworo ki yomcwiny madwong, guringo gucito katito bot lupwonyene. <verse eid="MAT 28:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 28:9" />Ento nen, Yecu orwate kwedgi, ci omotogi ni, <char style="wj">“Wutye ba!”</char> Gin gubino bote gumako tyene ci guwore. <verse eid="MAT 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 28:10" />Ka dok Yecu owaco botgi ni, <char style="wj">“Pe wulwor; wucit wutit bot utmegina ni myero gucit i Galilaya, ci gibinena ki kunu.”</char><verse eid="MAT 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lok ma lukur piny gudwoko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 28:11" />Ikare ma mon magi gitye kawot, jo mogo ki ikin lukur piny gudok i taun madit ka dwoko lok bot ajwaki madito pa Lubanga pi gin ducu madong otime ni. <verse eid="MAT 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 28:12" />Ka dong gucoke kacel ki ludongo, madong guporo lok, ci gumiyo lim madit bot acikari. <verse eid="MAT 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 28:13" />Ci guwaco ni, “Wuwac bot lwak ni, ‘Lupwonyene gubino ki dyewor ci gukwalo kome ikare ma onongo wanino woko.’ <verse eid="MAT 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 28:14" />Kace laloc biwinyo lok man, ci wan wabiniange ki lok ducu, wek can mo pe opot ikomwu.” <verse eid="MAT 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 28:15" />Acikari gugamo lim ci gutimo kit macalo kicikogi kwede. Ma omiyo lok man obedo ka ywek ikin Lujudaya nio wa onyo.<verse eid="MAT 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yecu onyute bot lupwonyene</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Mar 16:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luk 24:36-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Jon 20:19-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Tic 1:6-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 28:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">28:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 26:32">Mat 26:32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:28">Mar 14:28</ref></char>
    </note> Ikare meno lupwonyene apar wiye acel gucito i Galilaya, iwi got mayam en ociko gi ni gucit iye. <verse eid="MAT 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 28:17" />Ka gunene ci guwore; ento jo mogo gubedo ki akalakala. <verse eid="MAT 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 28:18" />Yecu obino ci owaco botgi ni, <char style="wj">“Twero ducu ma iwi polo ki i lobo dong kityeko miyo woko bota.</char> <verse eid="MAT 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 28:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 16:15-16">Mar 16:15-16</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Pimeno dong wucit wucilok jo me rok ducu gudok jo maluba, kun wubatijagi inying Won ki Wod ki Cwiny Maleng.</char> <verse eid="MAT 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 28:20" /><char style="wj">Wupwonygi me gwoko gin ducu madong atyeko cikowu kwede. Nen, atye kwedwu kare ducu, nio i agiki piny.”</char><verse eid="MAT 28:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 28" />
</usx>